#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour410.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.10 tour"
msgstr "ການນຳຊົມ Xfce 4.10"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.10. It only "
"covers the visual part of what has been done; for the full list of changes, "
"see the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳຊົມນີ້ຈະພາທ່ານໄປຮູ້ຈັກກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກໃໝ່ໆ ໃນ Xfce 4.10 "
"ເຊິ່ງເນັ້ນສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ພາຍນອກ. ສຳລັບລາຍການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ "
"ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:9
msgid "Online Documentation"
msgstr "ເອກະສານອອນລາຍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:11
msgid ""
"During the 4.10 development we've decided to remove user manuals from the "
"packages and move them to an online wiki at "
"[docs.xfce.org](https://docs.xfce.org). The reason for this change is to "
"make [contributing](https://docs.xfce.org/wiki/documentation) and updating "
"the documentation easier."
msgstr ""
"ໃນລະຫວ່າງການພັດທະນາ 4.10 "
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຕັດສິນໃຈຍົກເລີກຄູ່ມືຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ຕິດມາກັບແພັກເກດ "
"ແລ້ວຍ້າຍໄປໄວ້ໃນວິກິອອນລາຍທີ່ [docs.xfce.org](https://docs.xfce.org) ແທນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ການ [ປະກອບສ່ວນ](https://docs.xfce.org/wiki/documentation) ແລະ "
"ການອັບເດດເອກະສານເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:13
msgid ""
"![When you click a Help button Xfce will ask you to go to an online wiki "
"page][img-online-help]"
msgstr ""
"![ເມື່ອທ່ານຄລິກປຸ່ມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ Xfce ຈະພາທ່ານໄປຍັງໜ້າວິກິອອນລາຍ][img-online-"
"help]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:15
msgid ""
"We hope that with the introduction of the wiki it will be easier for "
"developers and contributors to maintain the documentation."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາຫວັງວ່າການນຳໃຊ້ວິກິຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຜູ້ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ "
"ສາມາດປັບປຸງເອກະສານໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:17 content/about/tour418.md:199
#: content/about/tour46.md:131
msgid "Application Finder *(xfce4-appfinder)*"
msgstr "ຕົວຄົ້ນຫາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ *(xfce4-appfinder)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:19
msgid "![Collapsed view of the Application Finder][img-appfinder-collapsed]"
msgstr "![ມຸມມອງແບບຫຍໍ້ຂອງຕົວຄົ້ນຫາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ][img-appfinder-collapsed]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:21
msgid ""
"The application finder has been completely rewritten and combines the "
"functionality of the old appfinder and xfrun4. Apart from user interface "
"improvements, it now allows creating custom actions matching a prefix or a "
"regex pattern."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຄົ້ນຫາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໄດ້ຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ ໂດຍລວມເອົາຄວາມສາມາດຂອງ appfinder"
" ຕົວເກົ່າ ແລະ xfrun4 ເຂົ້າກັນ. ນອກຈາກການປັບປຸງໜ້າຕາການໃຊ້ງານແລ້ວ, "
"ຕອນນີ້ມັນຍັງຮອງຮັບການສ້າງການກະທຳແບບກຳນົດເອງທີ່ກົງກັບຄຳນຳໜ້າ ຫຼື ຮູບແບບ regex"
" ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:23
msgid "![Expanded view of the Application Finder][img-appfinder-expanded]"
msgstr "![ມຸມມອງແບບຂະຫຍາຍຂອງຕົວຄົ້ນຫາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ][img-appfinder-expanded]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:25 content/about/tour412.md:39
#: content/about/tour414.md:33 content/about/tour416.md:47
#: content/about/tour418.md:37 content/about/tour46.md:19
#: content/about/tour48.md:29
msgid "Panel *(xfce4-panel)*"
msgstr "ແຜງ *(xfce4-panel)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:27
msgid "Multiple Rows"
msgstr "ຫຼາຍແຖວ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:29
msgid ""
"In 4.10 there is a single panel-wide option for configuring the number of "
"rows in the panel. Some plugins (e.g. *launchers*) fit a single row, while "
"others, like window buttons are allowed to occupy full width of the panel."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ 4.10 ມີຕົວເລືອກລວມສຳລັບກຳນົດຈຳນວນແຖວໃນແຜງ. ປລັກອິນບາງຕົວ (ເຊັ່ນ: "
"*ຕົວເປີດແອັບ*) ຈະຢູ່ໃນແຖວດຽວ, ໃນຂະນະທີ່ປລັກອິນອື່ນ ເຊັ່ນ ປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ພື້ນທີ່ໄດ້ເຕັມຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງແຜງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:31
msgid ""
"![A horizontal panel with a number of rows set to three][img-panel-rows]"
msgstr "![ແຜງແນວນອນທີ່ຕັ້ງຄ່າຈຳນວນແຖວໄວ້ເປັນສາມແຖວ][img-panel-rows]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:33
msgid "Deskbar Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດເດັສບາ (Deskbar)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:35
msgid ""
"The panel features a new configuration called a *deskbar* mode. In the "
"deskbar mode the panel is aligned vertically, just like in the vertical "
"mode, but the plugins are laid out horizontally. With multiple rows, it "
"allows creating wide vertical panels suitable for wide-screen setups."
msgstr ""
"ແຜງມີຮູບແບບໃໝ່ທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ ໂໝດ *ເດັສບາ (deskbar)*. ໃນໂໝດນີ້ "
"ແຜງຈະວາງຕົວໃນແນວຕັ້ງ ແຕ່ປລັກອິນຕ່າງໆ ຈະວາງລຽງກັນໃນແນວນອນ. "
"ເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານຮ່ວມກັບຫຼາຍແຖວ "
"ຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ສ້າງແຜງແນວຕັ້ງຂະໜາດກວ້າງທີ່ເໝາະກັບຈໍແບບຈໍກວ້າງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:37
msgid ""
"![A panel in Deskbar mode with a number of rows set to five][img-panel-"
"deskbar]"
msgstr "![ແຜງໃນໂໝດເດັສບາທີ່ກຳນົດຈຳນວນແຖວໄວ້ເປັນຫ້າແຖວ][img-panel-deskbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:39
msgid "Actions Plugin"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນການກະທຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:41
msgid ""
"Session plugin from the xfce4-session package has been merged with a "
"rewritten *actions* plugin"
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ session ຈາກແພັກເກດ xfce4-session ໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າກັບປລັກອິນ *ການກະທຳ "
"(actions)* ທີ່ຂຽນຂຶ້ນໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:43
msgid ""
"![Action plugin in a menu mode (left), and in a button mode (right)][img-"
"panel-actions]"
msgstr ""
"![ປລັກອິນການກະທຳໃນໂໝດເມນູ (ຊ້າຍ) ແລະ ໃນໂໝດປຸ່ມ (ຂວາ)][img-panel-actions]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:45
msgid "Window Buttons"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:47
msgid ""
"The *window buttons* plugin no longer expands, which makes the plugin "
"positioning more flexible. In order to restore the previous behavior please "
"add a transparent *separator* plugin with the **Expand** option enabled just"
" behind the window buttons plugin."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນ *ປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງ* ຈະບໍ່ຂະຫຍາຍຕົວອັດຕະໂນມັດອີກຕໍ່ໄປ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ການຈັດຕຳແໜ່ງປລັກອິນມີຄວາມຢືດຢຸ່ນຂຶ້ນ. ຖ້າຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຕົວຄືເກົ່າ "
"ກະລຸນາເພີ່ມປລັກອິນ *ເສັ້ນຂັ້ນ (separator)* ແບບໂປ່ງໃສ ພ້ອມທັງເປີດຕົວເລືອກ "
"**ຂະຫຍາຍ** ໄວ້ທາງຫຼັງປລັກອິນປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:49 content/about/tour412.md:105
#: content/about/tour414.md:55 content/about/tour416.md:41
#: content/about/tour418.md:71 content/about/tour46.md:67
#: content/about/tour48.md:9
msgid "File Manager *(thunar)*"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ *(thunar)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:51
msgid ""
"There are few visual changes in this release of Thunar. The window has less "
"padding and the position of the status bar has been adjusted."
msgstr ""
"ມີການປ່ຽນແປງທາງດ້ານໜ້າຕາເລັກນ້ອຍໃນ Thunar ລຸ້ນນີ້. "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງມີໄລຍະຫ່າງຂອບໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ ປັບປຸງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງແຖບສະຖານະ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:53 content/about/tour46.md:33
msgid "Session Manager *(xfce4-session)*"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການວາລະ *(xfce4-session)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:55
msgid ""
"The *session manager*'s settings dialog has a button for clearing the saved "
"session (no more `rm -r ~/.config/sessions`). Xfce4-tips has been removed "
"and the session manager can now lock the screen before suspending or "
"hibernating the system."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ *ຕົວຈັດການວາລະ* ມີປຸ່ມສຳລັບລຶບວາລະທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ "
"(ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງສັ່ງ `rm -r ~/.config/sessions` ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ). ໂປຣແກຣມ xfce4-tips "
"ຖືກຕັດອອກ ແລະ ຕົວຈັດການວາລະສາມາດລັອກໜ້າຈໍກ່ອນທີ່ຈະ suspend ຫຼື hibernate "
"ລະບົບໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:57
msgid "Applications Autostart"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:59
msgid ""
"Another noticeable change is the way GNOME and KDE compatibility works. "
"Compatibility check boxes only enable services, which have to be started "
"before other applications (*gnome-keyring* and *gconf* for GNOME and "
"*kdeinit* for KDE). All other autostart applications are available from "
"**Applications Autostart**, but they are listed using an italic font and not"
" enabled by default in order to distinguish them from Xfce applications. "
"Unlike in previous versions of Xfce, compatibility services can be started "
"independently from each other."
msgstr ""
"ອີກໜຶ່ງການປ່ຽນແປງທີ່ໂດດເດັ່ນຄືການເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ GNOME ແລະ KDE. "
"ປ່ອງໝາຍຄວາມເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ຈະເປີດສະເພາະບໍລິການທີ່ຕ້ອງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນກ່ອນແອັບອື່ນ "
"(*gnome-keyring* ແລະ *gconf* ສຳລັບ GNOME ແລະ *kdeinit* ສຳລັບ KDE). "
"ສ່ວນແອັບທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດອື່ນໆ ຈະສະແດງໃນ "
"**ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດ** ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວອັກສອນອຽງ ແລະ "
"ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ໄວ້ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແຍກອອກຈາກແອັບຂອງ Xfce ໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:61
msgid ""
"![Applications, which are not a part of Xfce, are listed using an italic "
"font][img-session-autostart]"
msgstr ""
"![ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງ Xfce ຈະສະແດງດ້ວຍຕົວອັກສອນອຽງ][img-"
"session-autostart]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:63 content/about/tour412.md:63
#: content/about/tour46.md:85 content/about/tour48.md:73
msgid "Settings *(xfce4-settings)*"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ *(xfce4-settings)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:65
msgid "Settings Daemon"
msgstr "ດີມອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:67
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.8 used two processes for applying settings: `xfce4-settings-helper` "
"and `xfsettingsd`. In 4.10 they have been merged into xfsettingsd, which now"
" handles all system settings."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.8 ເຄີຍໃຊ້ສອງ process ໃນການນຳໃຊ້ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄື: `xfce4-settings-helper` "
"ແລະ `xfsettingsd`. ໃນ 4.10 ທັງສອງໄດ້ຖືກລວມເຂົ້າເປັນ xfsettingsd ພຽງຕົວດຽວ "
"ເຊິ່ງເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າລະບົບທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:71
msgid ""
"The new *settings manager* groups configuration dialogs in categories and "
"allows you to search for their names or descriptions. Most of the dialogs "
"are also now embedded in the settings manager window (this was a compile-"
"time option in Xfce 4.8)."
msgstr ""
"*ຕົວຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ* ແບບໃໝ່ໄດ້ຈັດກຸ່ມກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເປັນໝວດໝູ່ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຕາມຊື່ ຫຼື ຄຳອະທິບາຍໄດ້. "
"ກ່ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຍັງຖືກຝັງຢູ່ພາຍໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຕົວຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:73
msgid ""
"![The settings manager with icons grouped by category and a search filter "
"applied][img-settings-manager]"
msgstr ""
"![ຕົວຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າພ້ອມໄອຄອນທີ່ຈັດເປັນໝວດໝູ່ ແລະ ມີຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາ][img-"
"settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:75
msgid "Settings Editor"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:77
msgid ""
"The *settings editor* no longer collapses the entire tree when you edit a "
"property (this is because it now reloads a single cell rather than the whole"
" tree). Most properties can now be edited in-place, making it easier to "
"quickly adjust settings."
msgstr ""
"*ຕົວແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ* "
"ຈະບໍ່ຫຍໍ້ໂຄງສ້າງຕົ້ນໄມ້ທັງໝົດອີກຕໍ່ໄປເວລາທີ່ທ່ານແກ້ໄຂຄ່າ "
"(ເນື່ອງຈາກຕອນນີ້ມັນໂຫຼດໃໝ່ສະເພາະ cell ດຽວ). "
"ຄ່າສ່ວນຫຼາຍສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້ໂດຍກົງໃນບ່ອນນັ້ນເລີຍ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:79
msgid ""
"Using settings editor you can also monitor changes of settings in a selected"
" channel. Right-click on a channel in the main window, and select "
"**Monitor** to display the monitor window."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າເພື່ອຕິດຕາມການປ່ຽນແປງຂອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຊ່ອງທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້"
" ໂດຍຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຊ່ອງໃນໜ້າຕ່າງຫຼັກ ແລ້ວເລືອກ **ຕິດຕາມ (Monitor)** "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງໜ້າຕ່າງຕິດຕາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:81
msgid ""
"![Settings editor with an open channel monitor, while editing a property in-"
"place][img-settings-editor]"
msgstr ""
"![ຕົວແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າພ້ອມໜ້າຕ່າງຕິດຕາມຊ່ອງທີ່ເປີດຢູ່ ຂະນະກຳລັງແກ້ໄຂຄ່າ][img-"
"settings-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:83
msgid "MIME Type Editor"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຊະນິດໄຟລ໌ MIME"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:85
msgid ""
"In the last couple of years, many people were asking for a tool to manage "
"their file type associations. The new *MIME type editor* does just that. It "
"allows you to easily assign a default application to a file type, see your "
"changes and reset them to default settings when necessary. Note that it does"
" not allow you to change the system MIME Type definitions (add or remove "
"types and change icons)."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຊຸມປີຜ່ານມາ ຫຼາຍຄົນຕ້ອງການເຄື່ອງມືສຳລັບຈັດການຄວາມກ່ຽວຂ້ອງຂອງຊະນິດໄຟລ໌. "
"*ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຊະນິດ MIME* ໃໝ່ນີ້ຖືກສ້າງມາເພື່ອສິ່ງນັ້ນ "
"ໂດຍຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດແອັບເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃຫ້ກັບຊະນິດໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆ, ເບິ່ງການປ່ຽນແປງ ແລະ "
"ຕັ້ງຄືນເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ງ່າຍ. ທັງນີ້ ມັນບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂການກຳນົດຄ່າ MIME "
"ຂອງລະບົບໄດ້ (ເພີ່ມ/ລຶບຊະນິດ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນໄອຄອນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:87
msgid ""
"![MIME types matching a pattern and a menu for selecting a default "
"application][img-settings-mime]"
msgstr ""
"![ຊະນິດ MIME ທີ່ກົງກັບຮູບແບບ ແລະ ເມນູສຳລັບເລືອກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ][img-"
"settings-mime]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:89
msgid "Mouse and Touchpad"
msgstr "ເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ທັດຊ໌ແພດ (Touchpad)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:91
msgid ""
"The *mouse and touchpad* dialog is capable of handling basic Synaptics and "
"Wacom properties in the GUI. A settings daemon running in the background "
"handles all kinds of device properties, as documented in the [mouse "
"settings](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/mouse) wiki."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າ *ເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ທັດຊ໌ແພດ* ສາມາດຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດພື້ນຖານຂອງ Synaptics "
"ແລະ Wacom ຜ່ານ GUI ໄດ້. "
"ດີມອນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ເບື້ອງຫຼັງຈະຈັດການຄຸນສົມບັດຕ່າງໆ "
"ຂອງອຸປະກອນຕາມທີ່ລະບຸໄວ້ໃນວິກິ "
"[ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມົາສ໌](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/mouse)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:93
msgid ""
"![Synaptics touchpad settings in the mouse and touchpad dialog][img-"
"settings-mouse]"
msgstr ""
"![ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Synaptics touchpad ໃນກ່ອງເມົາສ໌ ແລະ ທັດຊ໌ແພດ][img-settings-"
"mouse]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour410.md:95 content/about/tour412.md:73
#: content/about/tour418.md:65 content/about/tour420.md:277
msgid "Appearance Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບລັກສະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:97
msgid ""
"In 4.10 you can drag and drop a tarball with a downloaded theme onto the "
"*style* or *icon* list. Xfce will attempt to extract and install the files "
"into the `~/.themes` or `~/.icons` directory."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ 4.10 ທ່ານສາມາດລາກໄຟລ໌ tarball ຂອງທີມທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາ ໄປວາງໃສ່ລາຍການ *ຮູບແບບ* "
"ຫຼື *ໄອຄອນ* ໄດ້ເລີຍ. Xfce ຈະແຕກໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ຕິດຕັ້ງລົງໃນໂຟນເດີ `~/.themes` ຫຼື "
"`~/.icons` ໃຫ້ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:99 content/about/tour412.md:55
#: content/about/tour418.md:47 content/about/tour46.md:9
msgid "Desktop Manager *(xfdesktop)*"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການເດັສທັອບ *(xfdesktop)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:101
msgid ""
"Although the initial plan for Xfce 4.10 was to integrate desktop handling in"
" Thunar, we have decided not to do it at this time yet. Meanwhile, Xfdesktop"
" has gained support for single-click operation, automated background image "
"cycling and thumbnail rendering."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງວ່າແຜນການເບື້ອງຕົ້ນຂອງ Xfce 4.10 ແມ່ນຈະລວມການຈັດການເດັສທັອບເຂົ້າໃນ "
"Thunar, ແຕ່ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ຕັດສິນໃຈເລື່ອນອອກໄປກ່ອນ. ໃນຂະນະດຽວກັນ, Xfdesktop "
"ກໍໄດ້ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບຄລິກດຽວ, ການປ່ຽນພາບພື້ນຫຼັງອັດຕະໂນມັດ ແລະ "
"ການສະແດງພາບຕົວຢ່າງ (thumbnail)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:103
msgid ""
"![Desktop with image thumbnails and support for single-click operation][img-"
"xfdesktop]"
msgstr ""
"![ເດັສທັອບພ້ອມຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ ແລະ ຮອງຮັບການເຮັດວຽກແບບຄລິກດຽວ][img-xfdesktop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:105
msgid "Xfdesktop is now shipped with a new default background image."
msgstr "Xfdesktop ມາພ້ອມກັບພາບພື້ນຫຼັງເລີ່ມຕົ້ນແບບໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour410.md:107 content/about/tour412.md:9
#: content/about/tour418.md:213 content/about/tour46.md:43
msgid "Window Manager *(xfwm4)*"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ *(xfwm4)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour410.md:109
msgid ""
"Xfwm4 can now tile a window when you drag it to the edge of the screen. This"
" feature is optional and is disabled by default. In such a case windows can "
"still be tiled using a keyboard shortcut. Another improvement is a better "
"theming support and cursor key navigation in the tab window (Alt+Tab)."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ Xfwm4 ສາມາດຈັດລຽງໜ້າຕ່າງ (tile) ໄດ້ເມື່ອທ່ານລາກມັນໄປທີ່ຂອບຈໍ. "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ເປັນທາງເລືອກ ແລະ ຖືກປິດໄວ້ໃນຕອນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ. "
"ທ່ານຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມເພື່ອຈັດລຽງໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້. "
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນຍັງມີການປັບປຸງການຮອງຮັບທີມ ແລະ ການໃຊ້ປຸ່ມລູກສອນໃນໜ້າຕ່າງສະຫຼັບແທັບ"
" (Alt+Tab)."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour412.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.12 tour"
msgstr "ການນຳຊົມ Xfce 4.12"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.12. It only "
"covers improvements made on the surface; for the full list of changes, see "
"the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳຊົມນີ້ຈະພາທ່ານໄປຮູ້ຈັກກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກໃໝ່ໆ ໃນ Xfce 4.12 "
"ເຊິ່ງເນັ້ນສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ພາຍນອກ. ສຳລັບລາຍການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ "
"ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:11
msgid "Window Switcher Dialog"
msgstr "ກ່ອງສະຫຼັບໜ້າຕ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:13
msgid ""
"The window manager's Alt+Tab dialog is now fully themeable and also gained "
"two new modes: a 'List' mode and a 'Window Preview' mode. Furthermore users "
"use their mouse to click/select the window they want to give focus to."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງ Alt+Tab ຂອງຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງຕອນນີ້ສາມາດປ່ຽນທີມໄດ້ທັງໝົດ ແລະ ມີສອງໂໝດໃໝ່ "
"ຄື: ໂໝດ 'ລາຍການ' ແລະ ໂໝດ 'ຕົວຢ່າງໜ້າຕ່າງ'. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຍັງສາມາດໃຊ້ເມົາສ໌ຄລິກເລືອກໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ຕ້ອງການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:15
msgid ""
"![The traditional dialog is fully themable now][img-tabwin-simple-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![ກ່ອງແບບດັ້ງເດີມສາມາດປ່ຽນທີມໄດ້ຢ່າງສົມບູນແລ້ວ][img-tabwin-simple-crop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:17
msgid "The List mode of the Alt-Tab dialog."
msgstr "ໂໝດລາຍການຂອງກ່ອງ Alt-Tab."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:19
msgid ""
"![List mode of Alt-Tab, showing all window titles][img-tabwin-list-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![ໂໝດລາຍການຂອງ Alt-Tab ສະແດງຊື່ຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງທັງໝົດ][img-tabwin-list-crop]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:21
msgid ""
"The Window Preview mode shows thumbnails of windows' content alongside their"
" icon. Activating the compositor is a prerequisite for this mode."
msgstr ""
"ໂໝດຕົວຢ່າງໜ້າຕ່າງຈະສະແດງພາບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງເນື້ອໃນໜ້າຕ່າງພ້ອມກັບໄອຄອນ. ການເປີດໃຊ້ "
"ຕົວປະສົມພາບ (compositor) ແມ່ນສິ່ງຈຳເປັນສຳລັບໂໝດນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:23
msgid "![Window thumbnails][img-tabwin-preview-crop]"
msgstr "![ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໜ້າຕ່າງ][img-tabwin-preview-crop]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:25
msgid "Tiling, Zooming, Client-side Decorations"
msgstr "ການຈັດລຽງ, ການຊູມ, ແລະ ການຕົກແຕ່ງຝັ່ງໄຄເອັນ (CSD)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:27
msgid ""
"Support for Client-Side Decorations (CSDs) has been improved. They now "
"properly snap to screen and panel borders, and tile correctly, even with "
"shadows."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງການຮອງຮັບ Client-Side Decorations (CSDs) ໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. "
"ຕອນນີ້ພວກມັນສາມາດດູດຕິດຂອບຈໍ ແລະ ຂອບແຜງໄດ້ຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງ, "
"ລວມທັງການຈັດລຽງກໍເຮັດໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນເຖິງວ່າຈະມີເງົາກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:29
msgid "![Gtk3 apps with their decorations drawn by the client][img-xfwm4-csd]"
msgstr "![ແອັບ Gtk3 ທີ່ຕົກແຕ່ງຂອບໜ້າຕ່າງໂດຍຝັ່ງໄຄເອັນ][img-xfwm4-csd]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:31
msgid ""
"Window tiling mode was improved by providing support for corner-tiling, and "
"a new zooming mode was added using Alt + Mouse Wheel."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງໂໝດການຈັດລຽງໜ້າຕ່າງໂດຍຮອງຮັບການຈັດລຽງເຂົ້າຂຸມ, ແລະ "
"ເພີ່ມໂໝດຊູມໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ Alt + ລໍ້ເມົາສ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:33
msgid ""
"![Drag and drop a window to a corner to tile it][img-xfwm4-tiling-small]"
msgstr "![ລາກແລ້ວວາງໜ້າຕ່າງໄປທີ່ມຸມຈໍເພື່ອຈັດລຽງ][img-xfwm4-tiling-small]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:35
msgid "HiDPI Support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບ HiDPI"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:37
msgid ""
"In order to better support modern hi-resolution screens, two new Xfwm4 "
"themes were added (hdpi, xhdpi)."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບຈໍພາບຄວາມລະອຽດສູງໃນປັດຈຸບັນໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ, ໄດ້ມີການເພີ່ມທີມ Xfwm4 "
"ໃໝ່ສອງທີມ (hdpi, xhdpi)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:41
msgid "Intelligent Hiding"
msgstr "ການຊ່ອນແບບອັດສະລິຍະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:43
msgid ""
"The panel can now intelligently hide itself when a window is dragged near "
"it."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ແຜງສາມາດຊ່ອນໂຕເອງແບບອັດສະລິຍະໄດ້ເມື່ອມີໜ້າຕ່າງຖືກລາກມາໃກ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:45
msgid "![Oh what is this window??][img-panel-shown]"
msgstr "![ໂອ້ ໜ້າຕ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນຫຍັງ??][img-panel-shown]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:47
msgid "![Don't come closer!][img-panel-shown-stack]"
msgstr "![ຢ່າມາໃກ້ໃດ!][img-panel-shown-stack]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:49
msgid "![Hah! Now you don't see me!][img-panel-hidden]"
msgstr "![ຮ່າ! ຕອນນີ້ເຈົ້າແນມບໍ່ເຫັນຂ້ອຍແລ້ວ!][img-panel-hidden]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:51
msgid "Gtk3 plugins"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນ Gtk3"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:53
msgid ""
"Infrastructure was added to be able to load Gtk3 plugins alongside Gtk2 "
"plugins."
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ເພີ່ມໂຄງສ້າງພື້ນຖານເພື່ອໃຫ້ສາມາດໂຫຼດປລັກອິນ Gtk3 ໄປພ້ອມໆກັບປລັກອິນ Gtk2 "
"ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:57
msgid ""
"The desktop has a new wallpaper settings dialog with many new options and "
"better multi-monitor support. Drag the dialog to the display or workspace "
"where you want to change the wallpaper."
msgstr ""
"ເດັສທັອບມີກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າພາບພື້ນຫຼັງໃໝ່ທີ່ມີຕົວເລືອກຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ "
"ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຈໍໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ. ທ່ານສາມາດລາກກ່ອງນີ້ໄປທີ່ຈໍ ຫຼື "
"ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຕ້ອງການປ່ຽນພາບພື້ນຫຼັງໄດ້ເລີຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:59
msgid ""
"![Better multi-monitor support][img-xfdesktop-properties-multiworkspace]"
msgstr "![ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍໜ້າຈໍໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ][img-xfdesktop-properties-multiworkspace]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:61
msgid ""
"Uncheck 'apply to all workspaces' to set a different wallpaper for each "
"workspace."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກເລີກການເລືອກ 'ໃຊ້ກັບທຸກພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ' "
"ເພື່ອຕັ້ງພາບພື້ນຫຼັງທີ່ຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະພື້ນທີ່."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:65 content/about/tour418.md:59
#: content/about/tour420.md:287
msgid "Display Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍສະແດງຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:67
msgid ""
"Support for multi-monitor use was vastly improved in the display settings "
"dialog. Upon connecting a new display, a quick setup popup offers some of "
"the most-used modes for users to quickly change their layout."
msgstr ""
"ການຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຈໍໄດ້ຖືກປັບປຸງຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ. ເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈໍໃໝ່, "
"ຈະມີໜ້າຕ່າງຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນສະແດງຂຶ້ນມາເພື່ອໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເລືອກຮູບແບບການວາງຈໍທີ່ໃຊ້ເລື້ອຍທີ່ສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:69
msgid "![Configure multiple displays][img-xfce4-display-settings-twoscreens]"
msgstr "![ຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍຈໍສະແດງຜົນ][img-xfce4-display-settings-twoscreens]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:71
msgid ""
"![Choose your layout when plugging in a new display][img-xfce4-display-"
"layout]"
msgstr ""
"![ເລືອກຮູບແບບການຈັດວາງເມື່ອສຽບຈໍສະແດງຜົນໃໝ່][img-xfce4-display-layout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:75
msgid "The appearance dialog now showcases previews for styles and icons."
msgstr "ກ່ອງຮູບລັກສະນະຕອນນີ້ມີການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຂອງຮູບແບບ ແລະ ໄອຄອນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:77
msgid "![Gtk style preview][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-style]"
msgstr "![ຕົວຢ່າງຮູບແບບ Gtk][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-style]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:79
msgid "![Icon theme preview][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-icons]"
msgstr "![ຕົວຢ່າງທີມໄອຄອນ][img-xfce4-appearance-settings-icons]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:81 content/about/tour414.md:69
#: content/about/tour416.md:67
msgid "Power Manager *(xfce4-power-manager)*"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການພະລັງງານ *(xfce4-power-manager)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:83 content/about/tour414.md:71
#: content/about/tour414.md:85
msgid "Panel Plugin"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນແຜງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:85
msgid ""
"A new panel plugin was created which allows you to quickly control your "
"screen brightness, either via the menu or by simply using your mouse's "
"scroll wheel over the plugin. The plugin's menu also shows all other "
"connected devices with a power status, e.g. bluetooth keyboards or wireless "
"mice. It still offers quick access to the presentation mode, which inhibits "
"your screensaver for as long as the option is active."
msgstr ""
"ໄດ້ສ້າງປລັກອິນແຜງໃໝ່ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຄວບຄຸມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງໜ້າຈໍໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ "
"ຜ່ານເມນູ ຫຼື ພຽງແຕ່ໃຊ້ລໍ້ເມົາສ໌ປັດເທິງປລັກອິນ. "
"ເມນູຂອງປລັກອິນຍັງສະແດງສະຖານະແບັດເຕີຣີຂອງອຸປະກອນອື່ນໆທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່ ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ຄີບອດບລູທູດ ຫຼື ເມົາສ໌ໄຮ້ສາຍ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນຍັງເຂົ້າເຖິງໂໝດການນຳສະເໜີໄດ້ໄວ "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ໜ້າຈໍພັກໃນຂະນະທີ່ໃຊ້ງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:87
msgid ""
"![The plugin's menu allows users to control screen brightness and check on "
"the remaining uptime their battery provides.][img-xfpm-plugin-crop]"
msgstr ""
"![ເມນູຂອງປລັກອິນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຄວບຄຸມຄວາມສະຫວ່າງຂອງໜ້າຈໍ ແລະ "
"ກວດສອບເວລາແບັດເຕີຣີທີ່ເຫຼືອ][img-xfpm-plugin-crop]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:89 content/about/tour414.md:49
msgid "Settings Dialog"
msgstr "ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:91
msgid ""
"The settings dialog was completely restructured (separating button/lid "
"events from system and display behavior) and offers a clearer way of setting"
" your preferences."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຖືກຈັດໂຄງສ້າງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ (ແຍກສ່ວນປຸ່ມ ແລະ ຝາພັບ "
"ອອກຈາກພຶດຕິກຳຂອງລະບົບ ແລະ ຈໍສະແດງຜົນ) ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:93
msgid ""
"![Configure what action to take when certain buttons are pressed or the "
"laptop lid is closed][img-xfpm-prefs-general]"
msgstr ""
"![ກຳນົດການກະທຳເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມໃດໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ເມື່ອພັບຝາຄອມພິວເຕີໂນ້ດບຸກ][img-xfpm-"
"prefs-general]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:95
msgid ""
"![Configure what to do when the user is inactive or battery is drained][img-"
"xfpm-prefs-system]"
msgstr ""
"![ກຳນົດສິ່ງທີ່ຈະເຮັດເມື່ອບໍ່ມີການໃຊ້ງານ ຫຼື ເມື່ອແບັດເຕີຣີໝົດ][img-xfpm-"
"prefs-system]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:97
msgid "![Manage display power management][img-xfpm-prefs-display]"
msgstr "![ຈັດການພະລັງງານຂອງຈໍສະແດງຜົນ][img-xfpm-prefs-display]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:99
msgid ""
"![Display information on all connected devices][img-xfpm-prefs-devices]"
msgstr "![ສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນອຸປະກອນທັງໝົດທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່][img-xfpm-prefs-devices]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:101
msgid ""
"When light-locker is available, you can control its settings directly via "
"the power manager."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີ light-locker, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຄວບຄຸມການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງມັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຜ່ານຕົວຈັດການພະລັງງານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:103
msgid "![Setup light-locker integration][img-xfpm-prefs-security]"
msgstr "![ຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັບ light-locker][img-xfpm-prefs-security]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:107
msgid "Tab Support"
msgstr "ການຮອງຮັບແທັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:109
msgid ""
"A long-awaited feature was added: you can now open multiple folders in the "
"same Thunar window."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ຫຼາຍຄົນລໍຄອຍໄດ້ມາແລ້ວ: ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດເປີດຫຼາຍໂຟນເດີໃນໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"Thunar ດຽວກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:111
msgid "![Browse multiple directories][img-thunar-tabs]"
msgstr "![ທ່ອງເບິ່ງຫຼາຍໄດເຣັກໂທຣີ][img-thunar-tabs]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:113
msgid ""
"Thunar now displays the remaining free space with a bar in a folder "
"properties."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ Thunar ສະແດງພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງທີ່ເຫຼືອດ້ວຍແຖບສີໃນສ່ວນຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງໂຟນເດີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:115
msgid "![Freespace bar][img-thunar-freespace]"
msgstr "![ແຖບພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງ][img-thunar-freespace]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:117
msgid "And you can select multiple files to see their properties at once."
msgstr "ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອເບິ່ງຄຸນສົມບັດພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:119
msgid "![Multiple File Properties][img-thunar-multifiles-props]"
msgstr "![ຄຸນສົມບັດຂອງຫຼາຍໄຟລ໌][img-thunar-multifiles-props]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:121
msgid "Goodies"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງມືເສີມ (Goodies)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:123
msgid ""
"There have been lots of improvements to our goodies, and some new and shiny "
"applications have been added by new contributors."
msgstr ""
"ມີການປັບປຸງຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນເຄື່ອງມືເສີມຂອງພວກເຮົາ, ແລະ "
"ມີແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່ໆທີ່ສວຍງາມຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໂດຍຜູ້ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມໃໝ່."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:125
msgid "Alternative panel menu plugin *(xfce4-whiskermenu)*"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນເມນູແຜງທາງເລືອກ *(xfce4-whiskermenu)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:127
msgid ""
"The whisker menu is an alternative to the traditional menu plugin, showing "
"favourites, allowing to search through existing apps and much more."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູ Whisker ແມ່ນທາງເລືອກໃໝ່ແທນປລັກອິນເມນູແບບເດີມ, ໂດຍຈະສະແດງລາຍການທີ່ມັກ, "
"ຄົ້ນຫາແອັບ ແລະ ອື່ນໆອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:129
msgid "![Browse through categories][img-whiskermenu-default]"
msgstr "![ເລືອກເບິ່ງຕາມໝວດໝູ່][img-whiskermenu-default]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:131
msgid "![Search for an application][img-whiskermenu-search]"
msgstr "![ຄົ້ນຫາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ][img-whiskermenu-search]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:133
msgid "Task Manager *(xfce4-taskmanager)*"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າວຽກ *(xfce4-taskmanager)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:135
msgid ""
"The task manager got a revamped user interface, a filter and also supports "
"Gtk3 now."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການວຽກໄດ້ປັບປຸງໜ້າຕາໃໝ່, ເພີ່ມຕົວຄົ້ນຫາ ແລະ ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບ Gtk3 ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:137
msgid "![Show processes as a tree][img-taskman-tree]"
msgstr "![ສະແດງໂປຣເຊສແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້][img-taskman-tree]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:139
msgid "![Filter processes by name][img-taskman-filter]"
msgstr "![ກັ່ນຕອງໂປຣເຊສຕາມຊື່][img-taskman-filter]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:141 content/about/tour414.md:91
msgid "Media Player *(parole)*"
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມຫຼິ້ນມີເດຍ *(parole)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:143
msgid ""
"Parole's UI was totally redone in Gtk3. It now supports multiple video "
"backends, makes more efficient use of your resources and contains a few "
"novel plugins."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າຕາຂອງ Parole ຖືກຂຽນໃໝ່ທັງໝົດດ້ວຍ Gtk3. "
"ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບລະບົບເບື້ອງຫຼັງວິດີໂອຫຼາຍແບບ, ໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ ແລະ "
"ມີປລັກອິນໃໝ່ໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:145
msgid "![Watch videos][img-parole]"
msgstr "![ເບິ່ງວິດີໂອ][img-parole]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:147
msgid ""
"The media controls are now contained in a slide-over overlay (with a "
"configurable timeout)."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມຄວບຄຸມມີເດຍຕອນນີ້ຖືກວາງຊ້ອນແບບເລື່ອນ (ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າເວລາການສະແດງໄດ້)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:149
msgid "![Listen to music][img-parole-audio]"
msgstr "![ຟັງເພງ][img-parole-audio]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour412.md:151
msgid "Text Editor *(mousepad)*"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ *(mousepad)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:153
msgid ""
"Mousepad was totally rewritten, gained a settings dialog and now supports "
"Gtk3."
msgstr "Mousepad ຖືກຂຽນໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ, ມີກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ຮອງຮັບ Gtk3 ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:155
msgid "![New mousepad settings][img-mousepad-prefs]"
msgstr "![ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ mousepad ໃໝ່][img-mousepad-prefs]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour412.md:157
msgid "A note on Xfce's portability"
msgstr "ໝາຍເຫດກ່ຽວກັບການຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍລະບົບຂອງ Xfce"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour412.md:159
msgid ""
"All but one of those screenshots were taken on machines running OpenBSD "
"-current, a good proof that Xfce is still portable and friendly to all Unix "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"ພາບໜ້າຈໍທັງໝົດນີ້ (ຍົກເວັ້ນອັນດຽວ) ແມ່ນຖ່າຍຈາກເຄື່ອງທີ່ໃຊ້ OpenBSD, "
"ເຊິ່ງເປັນການຢືນຢັນວ່າ Xfce ຍັງຄົງຮອງຮັບ ແລະ ເປັນມິດກັບທຸກລະບົບ Unix."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour414.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.14 tour"
msgstr "ການນຳຊົມ Xfce 4.14"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.14. It only "
"covers improvements made on the surface; for the full list of changes, see "
"the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳຊົມນີ້ຈະພາທ່ານໄປຮູ້ຈັກກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກໃໝ່ໆ ໃນ Xfce 4.14 "
"ເຊິ່ງເນັ້ນສະເພາະສ່ວນທີ່ເຫັນໄດ້ພາຍນອກ. ສຳລັບລາຍການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ "
"ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ [ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:9 content/about/tour416.md:17
#: content/about/tour418.md:53
msgid "Settings Manager *(xfce4-settings)*"
msgstr "ຕົວຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ *(xfce4-settings)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:11
msgid "Color Profiles Dialog"
msgstr "ກ່ອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:13
msgid ""
"A new dialog for setting [color "
"profiles](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/color) for "
"monitors, printers and scanners was introduced. It acts as a frontend to "
"various daemons that talk directly to colord, e.g. saned (scanners), cupsd "
"(printers) or xiccd (monitors)."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມກ່ອງຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່ສຳລັບກຳນົດ "
"[ໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີ](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/color) "
"ໃຫ້ກັບໜ້າຈໍ, ເຄື່ອງພິມ ແລະ ສະແກນເນີ ໂດຍເຮັດໜ້າທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບດີມອນ colord "
"ຕ່າງໆ ເຊັ່ນ saned, cupsd ຫຼື xiccd."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:15
msgid "![The new color profiles dialog][img-color-profiles]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ສີແບບໃໝ່][img-color-profiles]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:17 content/about/tour416.md:29
msgid "Display Dialog"
msgstr "ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍສະແດງຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:19
msgid ""
"Several improvements were made to the [display "
"dialog](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/display). Apart from "
"tweaks to the user interface to make the interaction more intuitive "
"(introducing display numbering, showing a primary indicator with quick "
"access to panel, notification and desktop settings etc.) a feature to save "
"and restore complete display profiles was added. If a single profile exists "
"for a setup, the Xfce settings daemon will automatically enable it. If "
"multiple profiles exist, it will pop up the minimal dialog and offer all "
"profiles in addition to the previously available pre-sets (internal only, "
"mirror, extend and external only)."
msgstr ""
"ມີການປັບປຸງຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນ "
"[ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍ](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/display) "
"ນອກຈາກການປັບປຸງ UI ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານງ່າຍຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ ຍັງໄດ້ເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດໃນການບັນທຶກ ແລະ"
" ຄືນຄ່າໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍສະແດງຜົນອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:21
msgid "![The primary indicator][img-display-general]"
msgstr "![ຕົວບົ່ງຊີ້ຈໍຫຼັກ][img-display-general]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:23
msgid "![The display profile list][img-display-advanced]"
msgstr "![ລາຍການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍສະແດງຜົນ][img-display-advanced]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:25
msgid ""
"![The improved minimal dialog - in this case only showing one profile only "
"which never happens anymore now ;)][img-display-minimal]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງໂຕ້ຕອບແບບຍໍ້ທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງ][img-display-minimal]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:27
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:29
msgid ""
"One "
"[accessibility](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/accessibility)"
" feature that people coming from other desktop environments or operating "
"systems were still missing is to set a (custom) keyboard shortcut (by "
"default: Super+F1) to visually locate the mouse pointer. This feature was "
"added in Xfce 4.14."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"[ການເຂົ້າເຖິງ](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/4.14/accessibility)"
" ຢ່າງໜຶ່ງທີ່ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໃນ Xfce 4.14 ແມ່ນການຕັ້ງປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມ "
"(ຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ: Super+F1) ເພື່ອສະແດງຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌ເທິງໜ້າຈໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:31
msgid "![The mouse pointer location animation][img-locate-mouse]"
msgstr "![ພາບເຄື່ອນໄຫວສະແດງຕຳແໜ່ງຕົວຊີ້ເມົາສ໌][img-locate-mouse]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:35
msgid "General: Icon size"
msgstr "ທົ່ວໄປ: ຂະໜາດໄອຄອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:37
msgid ""
"A new feature that we introduced in the "
"[panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/start) is being able to "
"control the icon size of all plugins. ('All' may not be technically correct,"
" as not all plugins support the new API as of now, but now they *can*. Plus "
"the Window buttons plugin is an exception, because libwnck doesn't allow "
"anything other than 16px or 32px.) This means setups that were previously "
"impossible, because icons would upscale automatically according to size-"
"steps hard-coded in the panel, are now possible (see below)."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ທີ່ເຮົາໄດ້ເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໃນ "
"[ແຜງ](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/start) "
"ແມ່ນການສາມາດຄວບຄຸມຂະໜາດໄອຄອນຂອງທຸກໆ ປລັກອິນໄດ້. ('ທຸກໆ' "
"ອາດຈະບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງທາງດ້ານເຕັກນິກທັງໝົດ ເນື່ອງຈາກຍັງບໍ່ແມ່ນທຸກປລັກອິນທີ່ຮອງຮັບ "
"API ໃໝ່ໃນເວລານີ້, ແຕ່ຕອນນີ້ພວກມັນ *ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ແລ້ວ*. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ "
"ປລັກອິນປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງຍັງເປັນຂໍ້ຍົກເວັ້ນ, ເພາະວ່າ libwnck "
"ບໍ່ອະນຸຍາດຂະໜາດອື່ນນອກຈາກ 16px ຫຼື 32px). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ໝາຍຄວາມວ່າການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເຄີຍເຮັດບໍ່ໄດ້ໃນເມື່ອກ່ອນ, "
"ຍ້ອນວ່າໄອຄອນເຄີຍຂະຫຍາຍຂະໜາດໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດຕາມຂັ້ນ ທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ຕາຍໂຕໃນແຜງ, "
"ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເຮັດໄດ້ແລ້ວ (ເບິ່ງດ້ານລຸ່ມ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:39
msgid "![A 32px tall panel with 16px icons][img-panel-iconsize]"
msgstr "![ແຜງສູງ 32px ພ້ອມໄອຄອນ 16px][img-panel-iconsize]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:41
msgid "Window buttons: Grouping"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງ: ການຈັດກຸ່ມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:43
msgid ""
"Grouping was improved in the [Window buttons "
"plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/tasklist), both "
"functionally (by improving the matching and icon-finding) and visually by "
"providing a new group indicator that is less likely to clash with window "
"titles containing an enumeration in brackets."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດກຸ່ມໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງໃນ "
"[ປລັກອິນປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງ](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/4.14/tasklist), "
"ທັງດ້ານການເຮັດວຽກ (ໂດຍການປັບປຸງການຈັບຄູ່ ແລະ ການຊອກຫາໄອຄອນ) ແລະ "
"ດ້ານຮູບລັກສະນະ ໂດຍມີຕົວບອກສະຖານະກຸ່ມໃໝ່ "
"ເຊິ່ງຫຼຸດໂອກາດທີ່ຈະໄປຂັດກັບຫົວຂໍ້ໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ມີຕົວເລກລຳດັບໃນວົງເລັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:45
msgid "![The new group indicator (two terminal windows)][img-panel-group]"
msgstr "![ຕົວບອກສະຖານະກຸ່ມໃໝ່ (ໜ້າຕ່າງເທີມິນອລສອງອັນ)][img-panel-group]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:47
msgid "Session *(xfce4-session)*"
msgstr "ເຊດຊັນ *(xfce4-session)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:51
msgid ""
"As soon as a "
"[session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/4.14/preferences) has "
"been saved a new tab is dynamically added to the settings dialog displaying "
"all saved sessions and allowing to delete one or all of them. This should "
"make it way more discoverable for users if they actually have saved sessions"
" that influence the startup behavior - previously this had to be checked "
"manually in the filesystem."
msgstr ""
"ທັນທີທີ່ [ເຊດຊັນ](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/4.14/preferences)"
" ຖືກບັນທຶກ, ແທັບໃໝ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງທຸກເຊດຊັນທີ່ບັນທຶກໄວ້ ແລະ ສາມາດເລືອກລຶບອັນໃດອັນໜຶ່ງ ຫຼື ທັງໝົດໄດ້."
" ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍວ່າຕົນເອງໄດ້ບັນທຶກເຊດຊັນ "
"ທີ່ມີຜົນຕໍ່ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນລະບົບໄວ້ຫຼືບໍ່ - "
"ເຊິ່ງແຕ່ກ່ອນຕ້ອງໄດ້ກວດສອບດ້ວຍຕົນເອງໃນລະບົບໄຟລ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:53
msgid "![The settings dialog after saving a session][img-session-saved]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼັງຈາກບັນທຶກເຊດຊັນ][img-session-saved]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:57
msgid "Pathbar"
msgstr "ແຖບເສັ້ນທາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:59
msgid ""
"Up to Xfce 4.12 [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/4.14/start) "
"offered two options for the pathbar/locationbar. The best of both worlds has"
" now been mixed into one powerful pathbar, featuring both clickable "
"breadcrumbs (i.e. folders), an easily accessible way to hand-type a path as "
"well as an improved look."
msgstr ""
"ຈົນຮອດລຸ້ນ Xfce 4.12, [Thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/4.14/start)"
" ມີສອງຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບແຖບເສັ້ນທາງ/ແຖບຕຳແໜ່ງ. "
"ສ່ວນທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດຂອງທັງສອງແບບໄດ້ຖືກຮວມເຂົ້າກັນເປັນແຖບເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງ,"
" ເຊິ່ງປະກອບມີທັງປຸ່ມເສັ້ນທາງທີ່ຄລິກໄດ້ (ເຊັ່ນ: ໂຟນເດີ), "
"ວິທີພິມເສັ້ນທາງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ງ່າຍ ພ້ອມທັງຮູບລັກສະນະທີ່ສວຍງາມຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:61
msgid "![Thunar's new pathbar][img-thunar-pathbar]"
msgstr "![ແຖບເສັ້ນທາງໃໝ່ຂອງ Thunar][img-thunar-pathbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:63
msgid "Folder Thumbnailer"
msgstr "ຕົວສ້າງພາບຕົວຢ່າງຂອງໂຟນເດີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:65
msgid ""
"Same as on the Desktop you can now save an image with the name 'folder.jpg' "
"in a folder and get it displayed as its icon in the File Manager. Note: "
"[Please read the "
"docs](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/tumbler/available_plugins#customized_thumbnailer_for_folders)"
" on how to set this up (if your distribution hasn't enabled it by default)."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບເທິງເດັສທັອບ, ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດບັນທຶກຮູບພາບໂດຍໃສ່ຊື່ 'folder.jpg' "
"ໄວ້ໃນໂຟນເດີ ແລ້ວໃຫ້ມັນສະແດງເປັນໄອຄອນຂອງໂຟນເດີນັ້ນໃນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໄດ້. ໝາຍເຫດ:"
" "
"[ກະລຸນາອ່ານເອກະສານ](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/tumbler/available_plugins#customized_thumbnailer_for_folders)"
" ກ່ຽວກັບວິທີການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"(ຫາກດິສໂຕຣຂອງທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເປີດໃຊ້ງານມາເປັນຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:67
msgid "![Thunar's new folder thumbnails][img-thunar-folder-jpg]"
msgstr "![ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໂຟນເດີໃໝ່ຂອງ Thunar][img-thunar-folder-jpg]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:73
msgid ""
"The [Power Manager's panel plugin](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-"
"manager/4.14/panel-plugin) supports symbolic icons now and uses the standard"
" UPower icon names (making it more compatible with all icon themes). It also"
" shows an indicator if applications inhibit power management functions like "
"suspend (when power is low) or display dimming (after a defined timeout)."
msgstr ""
"[ປລັກອິນແຜງຂອງຕົວຈັດການພະລັງງານ](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-"
"manager/4.14/panel-plugin) ຮອງຮັບໄອຄອນສັນຍະລັກແລ້ວ ແລະ "
"ໃຊ້ຊື່ໄອຄອນມາດຕະຖານຂອງ UPower (ເຮັດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນກັບທຸກທີມໄອຄອນ). "
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງສະແດງຕົວບອກສະຖານະ "
"ຫາກມີແອັບພລິເຄຊັນກຳລັງກີດກັ້ນຟັງຊັນຈັດການພະລັງງານ ເຊັ່ນ: ການພັກເຄື່ອງ "
"(ເມື່ອແບັດເຕີຣີຕ່ຳ) ຫຼື ການຫຼຸດແສງໜ້າຈໍ (ຫຼັງຈາກຮອດກຳນົດເວລາ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:75
msgid ""
"![Parole's video playback is inhibiting power management][img-xfpm-"
"inhibitors]"
msgstr ""
"![ການຫຼິ້ນວິດີໂອຂອງ Parole ກຳລັງກີດກັ້ນການຈັດການພະລັງງານ][img-xfpm-"
"inhibitors]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:77
msgid "Notification Service *(xfce4-notifyd)*"
msgstr "ບໍລິການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ *(xfce4-notifyd)*"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:79 content/about/tour44.md:123
msgid "Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:81
msgid ""
"Several new features have been added in Xfce's [Notification "
"service](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/notifyd/start), including a "
"notifications log, the possibility to disable notifications per application,"
" a global 'Do Not Disturb' mode, which inhibits all notifications, and "
"finally a new animation ('slide out')."
msgstr ""
"ມີຫຼາຍຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນ "
"[ບໍລິການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/notifyd/start) ຂອງ Xfce, "
"ລວມທັງບັນທຶກການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການປິດການແຈ້ງເຕືອນເປັນລາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, "
"ໂໝດ 'ຫ້າມລົບກວນ' ແບບທົ່ວລະບົບ ເຊິ່ງຈະປິດກັ້ນທຸກການແຈ້ງເຕືອນ, ແລະ "
"ແອນິເມຊັນໃໝ່ ('ເລື່ອນອອກ')."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:83
msgid "![The new notification animation 'slide out'][img-notifyd-slideout]"
msgstr "![ແອນິເມຊັນການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃໝ່ 'ເລື່ອນອອກ'][img-notifyd-slideout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:87
msgid ""
"Furthermore a new panel plugin was added which provides quick access to both"
" the 'Do Not Disturb' mode as well as the log of recent notifications."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມປລັກອິນແຜງເພື່ອເຂົ້າເຖິງໂໝດ 'ຫ້າມລົບກວນ' ແລະ ບັນທຶກການແຈ້ງເຕືອນໄດ້ໄວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:89
msgid "![The new panel plugin][img-notifyd-panel]"
msgstr "![ປລັກອິນແຜງໃໝ່][img-notifyd-panel]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:93
msgid "Mini Mode"
msgstr "ໂໝດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ (Mini Mode)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:95
msgid ""
"[Parole](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/start) now features a 'Mini "
"Mode', where the interface is simplified to just display the album artwork "
"and can be positioned over other windows without getting in the way."
msgstr ""
"[Parole](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/parole/start) ມີ 'ໂໝດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ' ແລ້ວ, "
"ເຊິ່ງໜ້າຕາໂປຣແກຣມຈະຖືກປັບໃຫ້ລຽບງ່າຍພຽງແຕ່ສະແດງຮູບໜ້າປົກອັນລະບັ້ມ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດວາງຊ້ອນເທິງໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ ໄດ້ໂດຍບໍ່ກີດຂວາງການເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:97
msgid ""
"![Just right-click anywhere in the player window to select 'Mini "
"Mode'...][img-parole-normal-mode]"
msgstr ""
"![ພຽງແຕ່ຄລິກຂວາບ່ອນໃດກໍໄດ້ໃນໜ້າຕ່າງເຄື່ອງຫຼິ້ນ ເພື່ອເລືອກ "
"'ໂໝດຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ'...][img-parole-normal-mode]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:99
msgid ""
"![Afterwards, enjoy a truly minimalistic playback experience!][img-parole-"
"mini-mode]"
msgstr ""
"![ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນ, ເພີດເພີນກັບປະສົບການການຫຼິ້ນແບບມິນິມໍຢ່າງແທ້ຈິງ!][img-parole-"
"mini-mode]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:101
msgid "Screensaver *(xfce4-screensaver)*"
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມຮັກສາໜ້າຈໍ *(xfce4-screensaver)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour414.md:103
msgid "A Modern Locking Experience"
msgstr "ປະສົບການການລັອກໜ້າຈໍທີ່ທັນສະໄໝ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:105
msgid ""
"The new Xfce [Screensaver](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screensaver/start) "
"provides a configurable lockscreen experience. You can selectively toggle "
"the lock screen and screensaver, and all Xscreensaver themes are supported "
"(with configuration options) out of the box. If you prefer a blank screen, "
"Xfce Screensaver also includes a blank screen option with DPMS integration."
msgstr ""
"[ໂປຣແກຣມຮັກສາໜ້າຈໍ](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screensaver/start) ໃໝ່ຂອງ "
"Xfce ມອບປະສົບການໜ້າຈໍລັອກທີ່ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້. ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກເປີດ-ປິດໜ້າຈໍລັອກ"
" ແລະ ໂປຣແກຣມຮັກສາໜ້າຈໍໄດ້, ພ້ອມທັງຮອງຮັບທຸກຮູບແບບຂອງ Xscreensaver "
"(ພ້ອມຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າ) ໂດຍທັນທີ. ຫາກທ່ານມັກໜ້າຈໍດຳຫວ່າງເປົ່າ, Xfce "
"Screensaver ກໍຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກໜ້າຈໍຫວ່າງເປົ່າທີ່ເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ DPMS ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:107
msgid ""
"![The new lock screen, sharing styles with LightDM GTK+ Greeter for a "
"consistent experience.][img-saver-dialog]"
msgstr ""
"![ໜ້າຈໍລັອກໃໝ່, ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບດຽວກັບ LightDM GTK+ Greeter "
"ເພື່ອປະສົບການທີ່ກົມກຽວກັນ.][img-saver-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:109
msgid ""
"![Make it your own. Xfce Screensaver supports a multitude of configuration "
"options.][img-saver-preferences]"
msgstr ""
"![ປັບແຕ່ງຕາມໃຈທ່ານ. Xfce Screensaver "
"ຮອງຮັບຕົວເລືອກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍ.][img-saver-preferences]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:111
msgid "Terminal *(xfce4-terminal)*"
msgstr "ເທີມິນອລ *(xfce4-terminal)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:113
msgid ""
"Lots and lots of features have accumulated in the "
"[Terminal](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/terminal/start) over the last years. "
"Amongst them 'Undo Close Tab' and 'Close Other Tabs' functionality (similar "
"to web browsers), 'Copy Input to All Tabs', 'Set Title Color' (allows to "
"customize tab text color), 'Save Contents' (saves tab contents to a file), "
"an 'Unsafe Paste' dialog (which prevents the terminal from auto-executing "
"pasted text as a command) and support for zooming. Finally when closing a "
"tab or window, there is a new check for running processes which prevents "
"accidentally closing a terminal that is running a process."
msgstr ""
"ມີຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໆ ຢ່າງຫຼວງຫຼາຍຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາໃນ "
"[ເທີມິນອລ](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/terminal/start) ໃນຊຸມປີຜ່ານມາ. "
"ໃນນັ້ນມີຟັງຊັນ 'ຮຽກຄືນແທັບທີ່ປິດ' ແລະ 'ປິດແທັບອື່ນໆ' (ຄ້າຍກັບເວັບບຣາວເຊີ), "
"'ຄັດລອກຂໍ້ຄວາມປ້ອນເຂົ້າໄປທຸກແທັບ', 'ກຳນົດສີຫົວຂໍ້' "
"(ສາມາດປັບສີຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງແທັບໄດ້), 'ບັນທຶກເນື້ອໃນ' "
"(ບັນທຶກເນື້ອໃນໃນແທັບລົງເປັນໄຟລ໌), ກ່ອງເຕືອນ 'ການວາງທີ່ບໍ່ປອດໄພ' "
"(ເຊິ່ງປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເທີມິນອລສັ່ງເຮັດວຽກຂໍ້ຄວາມທີ່ວາງເປັນຄຳສັ່ງໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ) "
"ແລະ ຮອງຮັບການຊູມ. ສຸດທ້າຍ ເມື່ອປິດແທັບ ຫຼື ໜ້າຕ່າງ, "
"ຈະມີການກວດສອບໂປຣເຊສທີ່ກຳລັງເຮັດວຽກຢູ່ "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ປິດເທີມິນອລໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:115
msgid "![Zooming, 'Save Contents' and much more!][img-terminal]"
msgstr "![ການຊູມ, 'ບັນທຶກເນື້ອໃນ' ແລະ ອື່ນໆ ອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ!][img-terminal]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour414.md:117
msgid "Screenshooter *(xfce4-screenshooter)*"
msgstr "ໂປຣແກຣມຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍ *(xfce4-screenshooter)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:119
msgid ""
"The Xfce [Screenshooter](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screenshooter/start) "
"gained several notable features, amongst others seeing the size of the "
"screenshot while dragging, moving the selection with the mouse and better "
"[imgur](https://imgur.com) integration."
msgstr ""
"[ໂປຣແກຣມຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍ](https://docs.xfce.org/apps/screenshooter/start) ຂອງ "
"Xfce ໄດ້ຮັບຄຸນສົມບັດເດັ່ນໆ ຫຼາຍຢ່າງ, ເຊັ່ນ: "
"ການເບິ່ງເຫັນຂະໜາດຂອງຮູບໜ້າຈໍໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກ, ການຍ້າຍພື້ນທີ່ເລືອກດ້ວຍເມົາສ໌ ແລະ "
"ການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ [imgur](https://imgur.com) ທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour414.md:121
msgid ""
"![I can drag and move the screenshot area, whoop whoop!][img-screenshooter]"
msgstr "![ສາມາດລາກ ແລະ ຍ້າຍພື້ນທີ່ຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍໄດ້ແລ້ວ!][img-screenshooter]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour416.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.16 tour"
msgstr "ການນຳຊົມ Xfce 4.16"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.16. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface; for the full list of"
" changes, see the [changelog](/download/changelogs/4.16/)."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳຊົມນີ້ຈະແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຮູ້ຈັກກັບຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກໃໝ່ໆ ຂອງ Xfce 4.16. "
"ເຊິ່ງກວມເອົາສະເພາະການປັບປຸງໃນສ່ວນ (ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ເຫັນໄດ້); "
"ສຳລັບລາຍການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ](/download/changelogs/4.16/)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour416.md:9
msgid "Visual identity: New icons and palette"
msgstr "ເອກະລັກທາງພາບ: ໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຊຸດສີໃໝ່"

#: content/about/tour416.md:11
msgid ""
"In order to make Xfce shine a little more out of the box and to strengthen "
"its visual identity we created new icons for all of our core applications "
"and based them on a shared palette to ensure consistency. We also set some "
"further (implicit) design constraints, loosely following "
"[Adwaita](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adwaita_(design_language))'s "
"principles."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ Xfce ໂດດເດັ່ນຂຶ້ນຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ "
"ສ້າງຄວາມເຂັ້ມແຂງໃຫ້ກັບເອກະລັກທາງພາບ, "
"ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ສ້າງໄອຄອນໃໝ່ສຳລັບທຸກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຫຼັກ "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມຊຸດສີດຽວກັນເພື່ອຄວາມກົມກຽວ. "
"ພວກເຮົາຍັງໄດ້ກຳນົດຂອບເຂດການອອກແບບເພີ່ມເຕີມ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຫຼັກການຂອງ "
"[Adwaita](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Adwaita_(design_language))."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:13
msgid "![The Xfce palette][img-palette]"
msgstr "![ຊຸດສີຂອງ Xfce][img-palette]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:15
msgid ""
"![New upstream Xfce icons, coming in many sizes for sharp appearance][img-"
"upstream-icons]"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນຕົ້ນສະບັບໃໝ່ຂອງ Xfce, ມີຫຼາຍຂະໜາດເພື່ອຄວາມຄົມຊັດ][img-upstream-icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:19
msgid ""
"The Settings Manager itself received a visual refresh of its filter box, "
"which can now be hidden permanently. At the same time the search "
"capabilities of the filter box were improved by searching the descriptive "
"'Comments' part of each dialog's launcher (aka "
"[.desktop](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/desktop-entry-"
"spec/desktop-entry-spec-latest.html)) file."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງກ່ອງກັ່ນຕອງໃໝ່, "
"ເຊິ່ງຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເຊື່ອງໄວ້ຖາວອນໄດ້. ພ້ອມດຽວກັນນັ້ນ, "
"ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຄົ້ນຫາກໍໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງ ໂດຍສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາຈາກສ່ວນ 'ຄຳອະທິບາຍ' "
"ຂອງໄຟລ໌ຕົວເປີດແຕ່ລະອັນ (ຫຼື ໄຟລ໌ "
"[.desktop](https://specifications.freedesktop.org/desktop-entry-"
"spec/desktop-entry-spec-latest.html))."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:21
msgid "![Visually cleaner, more powerful filter box][img-settings-manager]"
msgstr ""
"![ກ່ອງກັ່ນຕອງທີ່ສະອາດຕາ ແລະ ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງຂຶ້ນ][img-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour416.md:23 content/about/tour418.md:163
msgid "Default Applications"
msgstr "ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ"

#: content/about/tour416.md:25
msgid ""
"This new dialog represents a merger between the previously available 'MIME "
"Type Editor' and the 'Preferred Applications' dialogs. Consolidating both in"
" one place means users have an easier time setting default applications to "
"handle certain file types."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ນີ້ເປັນການຮວມກັນລະຫວ່າງ 'ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຊະນິດ MIME' ແລະ "
"'ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ມັກ' ທີ່ມີມາກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້. ການຮວມທັງສອງຢ່າງໄວ້ບ່ອນດຽວກັນ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດກຳນົດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"ເພື່ອເປີດໄຟລ໌ແຕ່ລະຊະນິດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:27
msgid "![The new Default Applications dialog][img-default-applications]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໃໝ່][img-default-applications]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:31
msgid ""
"To better support high-density displays - which come in various sizes and "
"densities - we added fractional scaling based on the RandR extension of X11."
" Furthermore the preferred mode of a display is now marked with an asterisk "
"and aspect ratios are shown along display resolutions."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດແບບເສດສ່ວນ (fractional scaling) ສຳລັບຈໍຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:33
msgid "![Fractional scaling support][img-display-dialog]"
msgstr "![ການຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດແບບເສດສ່ວນ][img-display-dialog]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour416.md:35
msgid "Keyboard Shortcuts"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:37
msgid ""
"In order to make things easier for our users we added more default keyboard "
"shortcuts out of the box, for instance for window tiling or to open Thunar. "
"The keyboard shortcuts dialog itself was also visually updated."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມເລີ່ມຕົ້ນຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ ເຊັ່ນ: ການຈັດລຽງໜ້າຕ່າງ ຫຼື ການເປີດ "
"Thunar."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:39
msgid "![Visually updated keyboard shortcuts dialog][img-keyboard-shortcuts]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມທີ່ປັບປຸງຮູບລັກສະນະໃໝ່][img-keyboard-shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:43
msgid ""
"In Thunar's copy and move dialogs users can now easily pause the respective "
"file operation. Furthermore support for queued file transfer, remembering "
"view settings per folder and support for transparency in Gtk themes was "
"added."
msgstr "ໃນ Thunar ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດກົດພັກການກັອບປີ້ ຫຼື ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:45
msgid "![Thunar can now pause copying/moving files][img-thunar-copy]"
msgstr "![Thunar ສາມາດກົດພັກການກັອບປີ້/ຍ້າຍໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ແລ້ວ][img-thunar-copy]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:49
msgid ""
"The panel received quite a few noteworthy updates, an animation for autohide"
" and intellihide, a new 'Status Tray' plugin that combines both legacy "
"Systray item support with modern StatusNotifier item support, dark mode "
"support, launchers showing additional actions on right-click, window buttons"
" offering to 'Launch a new instance...' and much more."
msgstr ""
"ແຜງໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຫຼາຍຢ່າງ ເຊັ່ນ: ແອນິເມຊັນການຊ່ອນ, ປລັກອິນຖາດສະຖານະໃໝ່ ແລະ "
"ໂໝດມືດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:51
msgid "![Dark mode enabled in the panel's settings dialog][img-panel-dark]"
msgstr "![ເປີດໃຊ້ງານໂໝດມືດໃນກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງແຜງ][img-panel-dark]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:53
msgid "![The new statustray plugin][img-panel-statustray]"
msgstr "![ປລັກອິນຖາດສະຖານະໃໝ່][img-panel-statustray]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:55
msgid "![Autohide animation][img-panel-autohide]"
msgstr "![ແອນິເມຊັນການເຊື່ອງອັດຕະໂນມັດ][img-panel-autohide]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:57
msgid "![Launch a new instance!][img-panel-launch]"
msgstr "![ເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງໃໝ່ອີກອັນ!][img-panel-launch]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour416.md:59
msgid "About Dialog *(xfce4-about)*"
msgstr "ກ່ອງກ່ຽວກັບ *(xfce4-about)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:61
msgid ""
"Not only was the Xfce tab reworked to be more visually appealing and easily "
"parsable, a separate tab showing basic information about the user's system "
"was also added."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງໜ້າ 'ກ່ຽວກັບ' ໃຫ້ສວຍງາມ ແລະ ເພີ່ມແທັບສະແດງຂໍ້ມູນຂອງລະບົບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:63
msgid "![About Xfce][img-about-xfce]"
msgstr "![ກ່ຽວກັບ Xfce][img-about-xfce]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:65
msgid "![About System][img-about-system]"
msgstr "![ກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບ][img-about-system]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:69
msgid ""
"The settings dialog of the power manager was cleaned up and shows either 'on"
" battery' or 'plugged in' settings as opposed to both in a huge table."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຈັດການພະລັງງານໃຫ້ເບິ່ງງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour416.md:71
msgid "![Power Manager settings][img-powermanager]"
msgstr "![ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວຈັດການພະລັງງານ][img-powermanager]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour418.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.18 tour"
msgstr "ການນຳຊົມ Xfce 4.18"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.18. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface."
msgstr "ແນະນຳຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໆໃນ Xfce 4.18 ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:9
msgid ""
"Check the full [Xfce 4.18 changelog](/download/changelogs/4.18/) for a "
"detailed list of changes."
msgstr ""
"ກວດເບິ່ງ [ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ Xfce 4.18](/download/changelogs/4.18/) ສະບັບເຕັມ "
"ສຳລັບລາຍການປ່ຽນແປງລະອຽດ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:11
msgid "Widget Library *(libxfce4ui)*"
msgstr "ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດວິດເຈັດ *(libxfce4ui)*"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:13
msgid "Filename Input Dialog"
msgstr "ກ່ອງປ້ອນຊື່ໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:15
msgid ""
"XfceFilenameInput is a comfortable widget for filename input, which was "
"added in order to prevent invalid filenames at an early stage and to give "
"detailed feedback on the concrete problem."
msgstr ""
"XfceFilenameInput ແມ່ນວິດເຈັດສຳລັບປ້ອນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ "
"ເຊິ່ງເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການຕັ້ງຊື່ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:17
msgid ""
"![XfceFilenameInput - trailing whitespaces][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog1]"
msgstr ""
"![XfceFilenameInput - ຍະຫວ່າງທ້າຍຂໍ້ຄວາມ][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:19
msgid "![XfceFilenameInput - slash][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog2]"
msgstr "![XfceFilenameInput - ເຄື່ອງໝາຍທັບ][img-xfce4ui-new-file-dialog2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:21
msgid "Generic Shortcut Editor"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂປຸ່ມລັດທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:23
msgid ""
"This widget is a shortcut editor which was introduced in order to have a "
"graphical interface to modify component-specific shortcuts. Currently, it is"
" only used inside Thunar, Xfce4-terminal and Mousepad, though other "
"components might follow."
msgstr "ວິດເຈັດນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ແກ້ໄຂປຸ່ມລັດຂອງແຕ່ລະສ່ວນປະກອບໄດ້ຜ່ານໜ້າຕາແບບກຣາຟິກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:25
msgid "![XfceShortcutsEditor in Thunar][img-xfce4ui-shortcuts-editor]"
msgstr "![XfceShortcutsEditor ໃນ Thunar][img-xfce4ui-shortcuts-editor]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:27
msgid "Thumbnail Service *(tumbler)*"
msgstr "ບໍລິການຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ *(tumbler)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:29
msgid ""
"Some performance improvements for the pixbuf-thumbnailer and the scheduler "
"were done. As well now there are multiple overwrite options for the desktop-"
"thumbnailer."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບຂອງການສ້າງພາບຕົວຢ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:31
msgid ""
"There is now support for the thumbnail sizes x-large and xx-large, which are"
" very useful for high resolution displays."
msgstr ""
"ຮອງຮັບພາບຕົວຢ່າງຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ພິເສດ (x-large ແລະ xx-large) ສຳລັບຈໍຄວາມລະອຽດສູງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:33
msgid ""
"Tumbler and Thunar now support shared thumbnail repositories, like described"
" in the freedesktop.org thumbnail specification. This feature can be used to"
" produce thumbnails for a folder in advance, directly located near the "
"pictures. Like that, the thumbnails don't need to be re-generated for each "
"individual user."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ຄັງພາບຕົວຢ່າງຮ່ວມກັນ ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ຕ້ອງສ້າງໃໝ່ທຸກຄັ້ງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:35
msgid ""
"For more information on shared thumbnails, check the [related blog "
"post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog03.html)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຮູບຕົວຢ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັນ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[ບົດຄວາມບລັອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog03.html)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:39
msgid ""
"The DateTime and the Clock plugins provided overlapping functionality. In "
"order to prevent parallel development, they have been merged into a single "
"plugin."
msgstr "ລວມປລັກອິນ DateTime ແລະ Clock ເຂົ້າເປັນອັນດຽວກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:41
msgid "![The new 'Clock' panel widget][img-panel-clock1]"
msgstr "![ວິດເຈັດແຜງ 'ໂມງ' ໃໝ່][img-panel-clock1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:43
msgid ""
"The new Clock plugin received a new binary time mode now and provides a "
"sleep monitor. Here's a screenshot of all possible layouts which are: "
"Analog, Binary, Digital, Fuzzy and LCD."
msgstr "ປລັກອິນໂມງໃໝ່ຮອງຮັບການສະແດງຜົນຫຼາຍຮູບແບບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:45
msgid "![All possible Clock Modes][img-panel-clock2]"
msgstr "![ຮູບແບບໂມງທັງໝົດທີ່ເລືອກໄດ້][img-panel-clock2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:49
msgid ""
"Like in Thunar, the 'Delete' menu entry in the context menu can now be "
"hidden."
msgstr "ສາມາດຊ່ອນເມນູ 'ລຶບ' ໃນເມນູຄລິກຂວາໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:51
msgid ""
"In order to don't mess the desktop by accident on pressing 'rearrange "
"desktop icons', the user is asked for confirmation now."
msgstr ""
"ຈະມີການຖາມເພື່ອຢືນຢັນກ່ອນຈະ 'ຈັດລຽງໄອຄອນເດັສທັອບໃໝ່' ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຄວາມຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:55
msgid ""
"The search entry for xfce4-settings-manager was a bit simplified. Now it "
"will always be shown, without any slider or button."
msgstr "ຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາໃນຕົວຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າຖືກປັບໃຫ້ສະແດງຕະຫຼອດເວລາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:57
msgid ""
"![xfce4-settings-manager - the search entry is always shown][img-settings-"
"main-dialog]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce4-settings-manager - ຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາຈະສະແດງຢູ່ສະເໝີ][img-settings-main-"
"dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:61
msgid ""
"xfce4-display-settings got some minor improvements and the possibility to "
"decide what to do when new displays are connected."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍສະແດງຜົນ ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກເມື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຈໍໃໝ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:63
msgid "![xfce4-display-settings - minor improvements][img-settings-display]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce4-display-settings - ການປັບປຸງເລັກໆ ນ້ອຍໆ][img-settings-display]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:67
msgid ""
"On selecting a new theme, there is now the option to automatically set a "
"matching xfwm4 theme, if available."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອເລືອກທີມໃໝ່, ຈະມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າທີມ xfwm4 ທີ່ເຂົ້າກັນໃຫ້ອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:69
msgid ""
"![xfce4-appearance-settings - toggle to set matching Xfwm4 theme][img-"
"settings-appearance]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce4-appearance-settings - ຕົວເລືອກຕັ້ງຄ່າທີມ Xfwm4 ໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັນ][img-"
"settings-appearance]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:73 content/about/tour420.md:171
msgid "List View"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງແບບລາຍການ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:75
msgid ""
"For directories, the count of containing files can now be displayed in the "
"size column. It is now possible to add a 'file creation date' column, and "
"the 'configure columns' dialog can be opened with a right-click on any "
"column head."
msgstr "ສາມາດສະແດງຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ໃນໂຟນເດີ ແລະ ວັນທີສ້າງໄຟລ໌ໃນມຸມມອງລາຍການໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:77
msgid "![Thunar - List View - Preferences][img-thunar-listview1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ມຸມມອງແບບລາຍການ - ການປັບແຕ່ງ][img-thunar-listview1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:79
msgid ""
"![Thunar - List View - File count and file creation date][img-thunar-"
"listview2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - ມຸມມອງແບບລາຍການ - ຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ວັນທີສ້າງໄຟລ໌][img-thunar-"
"listview2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:81
msgid "Image Preview"
msgstr "ຕົວຢ່າງຮູບພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:83
msgid ""
"Finally, an image preview side pane has been added to Thunar. No, wait, "
"actually two of them! You can choose to either use the 'embedded' mode which"
" will take no extra space, but hide parts of the left side pane. Or you can "
"go for the 'standalone' mode, which will use a separate pane on the right "
"and display as well some basic information."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມແຖບສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຮູບພາບໃນ Thunar."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:85
msgid "![Thunar - Embedded Image Preview][img-thunar-preview1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ຕົວຢ່າງຮູບພາບແບບຝັງໃນຕົວ][img-thunar-preview1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:87
msgid "![Thunar - Standalone Image Preview][img-thunar-preview2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ຕົວຢ່າງຮູບພາບແບບແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ][img-thunar-preview2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:89
msgid "Undo and Redo"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ເຮັດຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:91
msgid ""
"It is now possible to undo basic file operations and to redo them. Undo and "
"Redo can be used for 'move', 'rename', 'trash', 'link' and 'create' "
"operations. Per default, a history of the last 10 operations is stored, "
"though the history length is configurable. Whenever an Undo/Redo is "
"triggered, a notification with few details will be shown."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຍົກເລີກ (Undo) ແລະ ເຮັດຄືນ (Redo) ການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ພື້ນຖານໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:93
msgid "![Thunar - Undo and Redo][img-thunar-undo-redo]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ຍົກເລີກ ແລະ ເຮັດຄືນ][img-thunar-undo-redo]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:95
msgid "File Highlight"
msgstr "ການເນັ້ນສີໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:97
msgid ""
"Files now can be highlighted by setting the background and the filename to "
"different colors. This can be done via an additional tab, located in the "
"'properties' dialog. The view menu provides a checkbox in order to "
"enable/disable the feature. Once enabled, files now can be shown in all the "
"colors of the rainbow."
msgstr "ສາມາດເນັ້ນສີພື້ນຫຼັງ ຫຼື ສີຊື່ໄຟລ໌ເພື່ອໃຫ້ສັງເກດໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:99
msgid "![Thunar - File Highlight Options][img-thunar-hightlight1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ຕົວເລືອກການເນັ້ນສີໄຟລ໌][img-thunar-hightlight1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:101
msgid "![Thunar - Highlighted files in List View][img-thunar-hightlight2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເນັ້ນສີໃນມຸມມອງແບບລາຍການ][img-thunar-hightlight2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:103
msgid "![Thunar - Highlighted files in Icon View][img-thunar-hightlight3]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເນັ້ນສີໃນມຸມມອງແບບໄອຄອນ][img-thunar-hightlight3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:105
msgid ""
"For more information on file highlight, check the [related blog "
"post](https://elessar-space.blogspot.com/2022/08/gsoc22-file-highlighting-"
"in-thunar.html)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການເນັ້ນສີໄຟລ໌, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[ບົດຄວາມບລັອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ](https://elessar-"
"space.blogspot.com/2022/08/gsoc22-file-highlighting-in-thunar.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:107 content/about/tour420.md:90
msgid "Toolbar"
msgstr "ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:109
msgid ""
"It is now possible to customize the toolbar according to your personal "
"needs! An additional dialog has been added for that purpose, on which the "
"visibility and position of specific items can be managed. As well custom "
"actions, which appear for folders can be used in the toolbar."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງແຖບເຄື່ອງມືໄດ້ຕາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:111
msgid ""
"When the menubar is hidden, an additional toolbar button which can be used "
"to show the menu will be displayed."
msgstr "ເມື່ອຊ່ອນແຖບເມນູ, ຈະມີປຸ່ມໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມືເພື່ອໃຊ້ສະແດງເມນູ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:113
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Toolbar with all configurable Elements][img-thunar-toolbar1]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືພ້ອມອົງປະກອບທັງໝົດທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້][img-thunar-toolbar1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:115
msgid "![Thunar - Toolbar Configuration Dialog][img-thunar-toolbar2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຖບເຄື່ອງມື][img-thunar-toolbar2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:117
msgid "![Thunar - Show Menubar button][img-thunar-toolbar3]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ປຸ່ມສະແດງແຖບເມນູ][img-thunar-toolbar3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:119
msgid ""
"For more information on the configurable toolbar, check the [related blog "
"post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog10.html)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບແຖບເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[ບົດຄວາມບລັອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog10.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:121 content/about/tour420.md:177
msgid "Split View"
msgstr "ມຸມມອງແບບແຍກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:123
msgid ""
"Thunar now provides the option to use split panes. The pane separator can be"
" moved, and its position will be stored. Via a xfconf setting, it is as well"
" possible to have a vertical split."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ Thunar ມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແຖບມຸມມອງແບບແຍກສ່ວນໄດ້. "
"ເສັ້ນຂັ້ນແຖບສາມາດຍ້າຍໄດ້ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງມັນຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້. "
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນຍັງສາມາດແຍກມຸມມອງເປັນແນວຕັ້ງໄດ້ຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ xfconf."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:125
msgid "![Thunar - Split Panes][img-thunar-splitpanes]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ແຖບມຸມມອງແບບແຍກສ່ວນ][img-thunar-splitpanes]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:127 content/about/tour420.md:115
msgid "Statusbar"
msgstr "ແຖບສະຖານະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:129
msgid ""
"The status bar style was tweaked and '|' is now used to separate entries. "
"Furthermore, it is now possible to customize it by using the context menu."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງຮູບແບບແຖບສະຖານະ ແລະ ສາມາດປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ຜ່ານເມນູຄລິກຂວາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:131
msgid "![Thunar - Statusbar Customization][img-thunar-statusbar]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ການປັບແຕ່ງແຖບສະຖານະ][img-thunar-statusbar]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:133
msgid "Recursive Search"
msgstr "ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດທຸກໂຟນເດີ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:135
msgid ""
"Thunar has now the possibility to search recursively, directly inside Thunar"
" itself. The search is done in a separate thread and search results are "
"added rapidly into a List View. A new row 'Location' shows where the search "
"results are located, and the context menu provides the option 'Open Item "
"Location' in order to travel there quickly. The preferences dialog provides "
"an option to limit recursive search to local folders, or to disable it."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ Thunar ສາມາດຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດທຸກໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍພາຍໃນ Thunar ໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ. "
"ການຄົ້ນຫາເຮັດວຽກແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ແລະ "
"ຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາຈະຖືກເພີ່ມໃສ່ມຸມມອງລາຍການຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ. ມີແຖວໃໝ່ 'ຕຳແໜ່ງ' "
"ເພື່ອສະແດງວ່າຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາຢູ່ໃສ, ແລະ ເມນູຄລິກຂວາມີຕົວເລືອກ 'ເປີດຕຳແໜ່ງລາຍການ'"
" ເພື່ອໄປຫາບ່ອນນັ້ນໄດ້ທັນທີ. "
"ໃນກ່ອງປັບແຕ່ງຍັງມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ຈຳກັດການຄົ້ນຫາລະອຽດສະເພາະໂຟນເດີພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື "
"ປິດຕົວເລືອກນີ້ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:137
msgid "![Thunar - Recursive Search][img-thunar-search1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ການຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດທຸກໂຟນເດີ][img-thunar-search1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:139
msgid "![Thunar - Recursive Search Preferences][img-thunar-search2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດທຸກໂຟນເດີ][img-thunar-search2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:141
msgid ""
"For more information on the recursive search feature, check the [related "
"blog post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog04.html)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບການຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດທຸກໂຟນເດີ, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[ບົດຄວາມບລັອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog04.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:143
msgid "Recently used Files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:145
msgid ""
"Recently used files now can be accessed in the side pane. Like for the "
"'Recursive Search' feature, the new 'Location' row can be used in List View."
" Additionally, for 'Recent' a new row 'Recency' can be added to sort the "
"files by their latest usage."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດໄດ້ຈາກແຖບຂ້າງ. ເຊັ່ນດຽວກັບຄຸນສົມບັດ "
"'ຄົ້ນຫາແບບລະອຽດທຸກໂຟນເດີ', ແຖວໃໝ່ 'ຕຳແໜ່ງ' ສາມາດໃຊ້ໃນມຸມມອງລາຍການໄດ້. "
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ໃນສ່ວນ 'ຫຼ້າສຸດ' ຍັງສາມາດເພີ່ມແຖວ 'ຄວາມໃໝ່' "
"ເພື່ອຮຽງລຳດັບໄຟລ໌ຕາມເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:147
msgid "![Thunar - Recently Used Files][img-thunar-recent]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ][img-thunar-recent]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:149
msgid ""
"For more information on 'Recent' in Thunar check the [related blog "
"post](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog02.html)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບ 'ໄຟລ໌ຫຼ້າສຸດ' ໃນ Thunar, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[ບົດຄວາມບລັອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ](http://users.uoa.gr/~sdi1800073/sources/xfce_blog02.html)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:151
msgid "Bookmark Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູທີ່ຂັ້ນໄວ້ (Bookmark)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:153
msgid ""
"In order to keep the 'Go' menu compact, bookmarks have been moved into a "
"separate, new 'Bookmarks' menu. The menu item 'add Bookmark' was rather "
"hidden in the 'send to' menu in Thunar 4.18. As part of the new 'Bookmarks' "
"menu, it is more prominent now."
msgstr "ແຍກເມນູ 'ທີ່ຂັ້ນໄວ້' ອອກມາຕ່າງຫາກເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:155
msgid "![Thunar - Bookmarks Menu][img-thunar-bookmarks]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ເມນູທີ່ຂັ້ນໄວ້][img-thunar-bookmarks]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:157
msgid "Trash directory"
msgstr "ໄດຣັກທໍຣີຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:159
msgid ""
"With the new release, the trash directory provides an info bar which gives "
"easy access to `Empty Trash` and 'Restore' functionality. When using List "
"View, a 'Date Deleted' column will be shown, so that the files can be sorted"
" by deletion date. Via context menu, it is now possible to select 'Restore "
"and Show' in order to automatically open a new tab in the folder of the "
"restored file(s)."
msgstr ""
"ຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອມີແຖບຂໍ້ມູນເພື່ອໃຫ້ 'ເທຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ' ຫຼື 'ກູ້ຄືນ' ໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:161
msgid "![Thunar - Trash Infobar and Date Deleted Column][img-thunar-trash]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ແຖບຂໍ້ມູນຖັງຂີ້ເຫຍື້ອ ແລະ ຖັນວັນທີລຶບ][img-thunar-trash]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:165
msgid ""
"The management to set/unset default applications for specific mime types was"
" improved. The context menu got a dedicated item 'Set Default Application' "
"which will open the 'ApplicationChooserDialog' with 'use as default' "
"preselected. The dialog now has a section 'Default Application' in order to "
"make clear which default application currently is set. If you want to remove"
" applications from the list, right click it and select 'forget association'."
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການຈັດການແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນສຳລັບຊະນິດໄຟລ໌ຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:167
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Context Menu Entry to set Default Application][img-thunar-"
"default-application1]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - ລາຍການເມນູຄລິກຂວາເພື່ອຕັ້ງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ][img-thunar-"
"default-application1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:169
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Revamped Application Chooser Dialog][img-thunar-default-"
"application2]"
msgstr ""
"![Thunar - ກ່ອງເລືອກແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ປັບປຸງໃໝ່][img-thunar-default-"
"application2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:171 content/about/tour420.md:147
msgid "Custom Actions"
msgstr "ການກະທຳແບບກຳນົດເອງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:173
msgid ""
"It is now possible to arrange custom actions in cascading submenus. Just "
"enter the same submenu name for a custom action in order to place it into "
"the same menu. If you require multiple menu levels, you can achieve that by "
"using '/' in the path of the 'Submenu' entry."
msgstr "ສາມາດຈັດກຸ່ມການກະທຳແບບກຳນົດເອງເປັນເມນູຍ່ອຍໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:175
msgid "![Thunar - Custom Action Submenu][img-thunar-uca-submenu1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ເມນູຍ່ອຍການກະທຳແບບກຳນົດເອງ][img-thunar-uca-submenu1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:177
msgid ""
"![Thunar - Custom Action Configuration Dialog][img-thunar-uca-submenu2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າການກະທຳແບບກຳນົດເອງ][img-thunar-uca-submenu2]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:179 content/about/tour420.md:227
#: content/about/tour420.md:355
msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "ປັບແຕ່ງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:181
msgid ""
"The thumbnail settings in the preferences dialog got grouped together, and "
"meanwhile it is possible to limit the file size for which thumbnails should "
"be generated. That should mitigate possible performance issues by preventing"
" thumbnail generation for huge video files."
msgstr "ສາມາດຈຳກັດຂະໜາດໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຈະໃຫ້ສ້າງພາບຕົວຢ່າງເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງຊ້າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:183
msgid "![Thunar - Thumbnail Preferences][img-thunar-preferences1]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ການປັບແຕ່ງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງ][img-thunar-preferences1]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:185
msgid ""
"File transfer operations optionally can use *.partial~ as an intermediate "
"file now. After a transfer operation, there is now the option to verify the "
"file checksums in order to make sure that no single bit got corrupted. Note "
"that the checksum feature will require some extra time during copy when "
"activated."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງຂອງໄຟລ໌ຫຼັງຈາກການຍ້າຍ ຫຼື ກັອບປີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:187
msgid "![Thunar - File Transfer Preferences][img-thunar-preferences2]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ການປັບແຕ່ງການສົ່ງໂອນໄຟລ໌][img-thunar-preferences2]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:189
msgid ""
"For more information on the new file transfer options, check the [related "
"blog post](https://dev.ikx.kr/GSOC-5th/)."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບຕົວເລືອກການສົ່ງໂອນໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່, ເບິ່ງໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[ບົດຄວາມບລັອກທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ](https://dev.ikx.kr/GSOC-5th/)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:191
msgid ""
"A checkbox was added in order to allow running shell scripts. In Thunar 4.18"
" it only was possible to change that behavior by changing a hidden setting. "
"Use that option with caution!"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກເພື່ອອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເປີດໃຊ້ເຊລສະຄຣິບ (shell scripts)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:193
msgid "![Thunar - Script Execution Preferences][img-thunar-preferences3]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ການປັບແຕ່ງການເປີດໃຊ້ສະຄຣິບ][img-thunar-preferences3]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:195
msgid ""
"There is now the possibility to restore tabs on startup, and to show the "
"full directory path in the tab title."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດເປີດແທັບເກົ່າຄືນໃໝ່ເມື່ອເລີ່ມໂປຣແກຣມ ແລະ ສະແດງເສັ້ນທາງເຕັມໃນຊື່ແທັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:197
msgid "![Thunar - Tab and Window Preferences][img-thunar-preferences4]"
msgstr "![Thunar - ການປັບແຕ່ງແທັບ ແລະ ໜ້າຕ່າງ][img-thunar-preferences4]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:201
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "ການກຳນົດຄ່າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:203
msgid ""
"Application Finder got support for the 'PrefersNonDefaultGPU' property, "
"which is useful for systems with hybrid graphic cards."
msgstr "ຕົວຄົ້ນຫາແອັບຮອງຮັບການເລືອກໃຊ້ GPU."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:205
msgid "Environment variables are now parsed when passed in collapsed mode."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການໃຊ້ຕົວປ່ຽນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມ (Environment variables)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:207
msgid "Appearance"
msgstr "ຮູບລັກສະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:209
msgid "An option to hide the window decorations was added."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກສຳລັບຊ່ອນສ່ວນຕົກແຕ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:211
msgid "![xfce4-appfinder without window decorations][img-appfinder]"
msgstr "![xfce4-appfinder ແບບບໍ່ມີສ່ວນຕົກແຕ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງ][img-appfinder]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:215
msgid "Workspaces"
msgstr "ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:217
msgid "Workspace setting will now work as well with other window managers."
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກສາມາດໃຊ້ຮ່ວມກັບຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆໄດ້."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:219
msgid "Compositor"
msgstr "ຕົວປະສົມພາບ (Compositor)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:221
msgid "The compositor now supports adaptive vsync with GLX."
msgstr "ຕົວປະສົມພາບຮອງຮັບ adaptive vsync ດ້ວຍ GLX ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour418.md:223 content/about/tour420.md:12
#: content/about/tour420.md:205
msgid "General"
msgstr "ທົ່ວໄປ"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:225 content/about/tour420.md:44
msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "ການປັບຂະໜາດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:227
msgid ""
"Improved support for UI scaling and fix for many blurry icons in the core "
"components when scaling is used. This will be particularly useful for Hi DPI"
" screens."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງການຮອງຮັບການປັບຂະໜາດ UI ແລະ "
"ແກ້ໄຂໄອຄອນທີ່ມົວໃນສ່ວນປະກອບຫຼັກເມື່ອມີການປັບຂະໜາດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍສຳລັບໜ້າຈໍ HiDPI."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour418.md:229
msgid "Window Header Bars"
msgstr "ແຖບຫົວໜ້າຕ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:231
msgid ""
"All header bars of Xfce Windows/Dialogs by default will be drawn by the "
"window manager now (Xfwm4). Some dialogs optionally support 'GtkHeaderBar' "
"(CSD) which can be enabled via a xfconf setting."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍພື້ນຖານແລ້ວ ແຖບຫົວໜ້າຕ່າງ ແລະ ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂອງ Xfce "
"ຈະຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໂດຍຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ (Xfwm4). ບາງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມສາມາດເລືອກຮອງຮັບ "
"'GtkHeaderBar' (CSD) ຊຶ່ງສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ຜ່ານການຕັ້ງຄ່າ xfconf."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour418.md:233
msgid ""
"![xfce-appearance-settings - Preference to enable GtkHeaderBar][img-general-"
"gtkheaderbar]"
msgstr ""
"![xfce-appearance-settings - ການປັບແຕ່ງເພື່ອເປີດໃຊ້ GtkHeaderBar][img-"
"general-gtkheaderbar]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour420.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.20 tour"
msgstr "ແນະນຳ Xfce 4.20"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:8
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to new major features of Xfce 4.20. It only "
"covers improvements made on the (user-visible) surface."
msgstr ""
"ການແນະນຳນີ້ຈະພາທ່ານໄປຮູ້ຈັກກັບຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ທີ່ສຳຄັນຂອງ Xfce 4.20 "
"ຊຶ່ງຈະເນັ້ນໃສ່ສ່ວນທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເຫັນໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:10
msgid ""
"Check the full [Xfce 4.20 changelog](/download/changelogs/4.20/) for a "
"detailed list of changes."
msgstr ""
"ກວດເບິ່ງ [ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ Xfce 4.20](/download/changelogs/4.20/) ສະບັບເຕັມ "
"ສຳລັບລາຍການປ່ຽນແປງລະອຽດ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:14
msgid "Wayland"
msgstr "Wayland"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:16
msgid ""
"**Important Notice:** Please be aware that the Wayland support in Xfce 4.20 "
"is experimental. It is recommended for advanced users only, as you may "
"encounter bugs and experience incomplete functionality. Proceed with "
"caution!"
msgstr ""
"**ແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳຄັນ:** ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ການຮອງຮັບ Wayland ໃນ Xfce 4.20 "
"ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນທົດລອງ. ແນະນຳສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ລະດັບສູງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, "
"ເນື່ອງຈາກທ່ານອາດພົບບັນຫາ ແລະ ການເຮັດວຽກທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ທັນສົມບູນ. "
"ກະລຸນາໃຊ້ງານດ້ວຍຄວາມລະມັດລະວັງ!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:18
msgid ""
"Thanks to [Brian](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos) and "
"[Gaël](https://gitlab.xfce.org/Tamaranch) almost all Xfce components are "
"able to run on Wayland windowing, while still keeping support for X11 "
"windowing."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍຂອບໃຈ [Brian](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos) ແລະ "
"[Gaël](https://gitlab.xfce.org/Tamaranch) ທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສ່ວນປະກອບເກືອບທັງໝົດຂອງ "
"Xfce ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກເທິງລະບົບໜ້າຕ່າງ Wayland ໄດ້, ພ້ອມທັງຍັງຮອງຮັບລະບົບໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"X11 ໄວ້ຄືເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:20
msgid ""
"This major effort was achieved by abstracting away any X11/Wayland windowing"
" specific calls and making use of Wayland/Wlroots protocols. A whole new "
"Xfce library, \"libxfce4windowing\" was introduced during that process. "
"XWayland will not be required to run any of the ported Xfce components."
msgstr ""
"ຄວາມສຳເລັດນີ້ເກີດຈາກການແຍກການເອີ້ນໃຊ້ງານສະເພາະຂອງ X11/Wayland ອອກຈາກກັນ ແລະ "
"ຫັນມາໃຊ້ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ Wayland/Wlroots ແທນ. ຫ້ອງສະໝຸດໃໝ່ຂອງ Xfce ທີ່ຊື່ວ່າ "
"\"libxfce4windowing\" ໄດ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃນຂະບວນການນີ້. ທ່ານບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຊ້ "
"XWayland ເພື່ອລັນສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ Xfce ທີ່ຖືກພອດມາແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:22
msgid ""
"So far Xfce does not feature a compositor which supports Wayland. If you "
"want to run Xfce in Wayland, Labwc and Wayfire will give you the best "
"results. A detailed instruction on this can be found "
"[here](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap#testing). Please be "
"aware that Wayland support is still experimental!"
msgstr ""
"ມາຮອດປະຈຸບັນ Xfce ຍັງບໍ່ມີຕົວປະສົມພາບ (compositor) ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ Wayland ໂດຍກົງ."
" ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃຊ້ Xfce ເທິງ Wayland, ການໃຊ້ Labwc ແລະ Wayfire "
"ຈະໃຫ້ຜົນຮັບທີ່ດີທີ່ສຸດ. ຄຳແນະນຳລະອຽດກ່ຽວກັບເລື່ອງນີ້ ສາມາດເບິ່ງໄດ້ "
"[ທີ່ນີ້](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap#testing). "
"ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າການຮອງຮັບ Wayland ຍັງຢູ່ໃນຂັ້ນທົດລອງ!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:24
msgid ""
"Plans are underway to add Wayland support to Xfwm4 while preserving its "
"existing X11 functionality. However, such a restructurization will be a "
"major effort and we cannot tell yet when/if it will be done, so please don't"
" hold your breath waiting for it."
msgstr ""
"ພວກເຮົາກຳລັງມີແຜນທີ່ຈະເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບ Wayland ເຂົ້າໃນ Xfwm4 "
"ໂດຍທີ່ຍັງຮັກສາການເຮັດວຽກຂອງ X11 ໄວ້. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ການປັບປຸງໂຄງສ້າງໃໝ່ນີ້ຕ້ອງໃຊ້ຄວາມພະຍາຍາມຢ່າງມະຫາສານ ແລະ "
"ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດລະບຸໄດ້ວ່າຈະສຳເລັດເມື່ອໃດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:26
msgid ""
"For few components and multiple features, it was not possible to port them "
"to Wayland, partly because there are no standardized Wayland protocols "
"available yet to provide the required services:"
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບບາງສ່ວນປະກອບ ແລະ ບາງຄຸນສົມບັດ, ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດພອດໄປຫາ Wayland ໄດ້ "
"ເພາະຍັງບໍ່ມີໂປຣໂຕຄໍມາດຕະຖານຂອງ Wayland ທີ່ຮອງຮັບບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນ:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:28
msgid ""
"Workspace support is missing (ext-workspace protocol [was just "
"merged](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-"
"protocols/-/merge_requests/40))."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງຂາດການຮອງຮັບພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ (ໂປຣໂຕຄໍ ext-workspace "
"[ຫາກໍ່ຖືກຮວມເຂົ້າໄປ](https://gitlab.freedesktop.org/wayland/wayland-"
"protocols/-/merge_requests/40))."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:29
msgid ""
"Systray icons will be missing for multiple applications (required to use "
"StatusNotifier instead of GtkStatusIcon)"
msgstr ""
"ໄອຄອນໃນຖາດລະບົບ (Systray) ຂອງຫຼາຍແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະບໍ່ສະແດງ (ຕ້ອງປ່ຽນໄປໃຊ້ "
"StatusNotifier ແທນ GtkStatusIcon)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:30
msgid ""
"Xfce4-settings: Keyboard and mouse settings so far are internal to the "
"Wayland compositor and as such the according Xfce dialogs won't be available"
" on Wayland yet."
msgstr ""
"Xfce4-settings: ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຄີບອດ ແລະ ເມົາສ໌ ຍັງເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງພາຍໃນຂອງ Wayland "
"compositor ດັ່ງນັ້ນກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງ Xfce ຈຶ່ງຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເທິງ "
"Wayland."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:31
msgid ""
"Power related keyboard handling (brightness keys, suspend, etc.) is internal"
" to the Wayland compositor and as such cannot be supported yet by Xfce "
"components."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດການປຸ່ມຄີບອດທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບພະລັງງານ (ປຸ່ມປັບແສງ, ພັກເຄື່ອງ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) "
"ແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ Wayland compositor ແລະ ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບຈາກສ່ວນປະກອບຂອງ "
"Xfce."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:32
msgid ""
"Wayland does not specify a native protocol for taking screenshots. However, "
"xfce4-screenshooter already supports screenshots via the wlroots "
"'screencopy' protocol (entire screen). Screenshots of a rectangle selection "
"or the active window are not yet supported via Wayland."
msgstr ""
"Wayland ບໍ່ມີໂປຣໂຕຄໍມາດຕະຖານສຳລັບການຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍ. ແຕ່ xfce4-screenshooter "
"ຮອງຮັບການຖ່າຍຮູບຜ່ານໂປຣໂຕຄໍ 'screencopy' ຂອງ wlroots (ຖ່າຍທັງໝົດໜ້າຈໍ). "
"ສ່ວນການຖ່າຍສະເພາະບາງສ່ວນ ຫຼື ໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ແມ່ນຍັງບໍ່ທັນຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:34
msgid "Some other Xfce components don't run at all on Wayland:"
msgstr "ສ່ວນປະກອບອື່ນໆ ບາງຢ່າງຂອງ Xfce ຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຮັດວຽກໄດ້ເລີຍເທິງ Wayland:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:36
msgid "Xfwm4"
msgstr "Xfwm4"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:37
msgid "Xfdashboard"
msgstr "Xfdashboard"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:38
msgid ""
"Xfce4-screensaver (porting to Wayland [completed but not "
"merged](https://gitlab.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-screensaver/-/merge_requests/28),"
" as it requires the experimental [libwlembed "
"library](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos/libwlembed))"
msgstr ""
"Xfce4-screensaver (ການພອດໄປຫາ Wayland "
"[ສຳເລັດແລ້ວແຕ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຮວມເຂົ້າ](https://gitlab.xfce.org/apps/xfce4-screensaver/-/merge_requests/28),"
" ຍ້ອນຕ້ອງອາໄສຫ້ອງສະໝຸດທົດລອງ "
"[libwlembed](https://gitlab.xfce.org/kelnos/libwlembed))"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:39
msgid ""
"Xfce4-windowck-plugin (needs to be [ported to "
"libxfce4windowing](https://gitlab.xfce.org/panel-plugins/xfce4-windowck-"
"plugin/-/issues/37))"
msgstr ""
"Xfce4-windowck-plugin (ຕ້ອງໄດ້ຮັບ [ການພອດໄປຫາ "
"libxfce4windowing](https://gitlab.xfce.org/panel-plugins/xfce4-windowck-"
"plugin/-/issues/37))"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:40
msgid ""
"Xfce4-xkb-plugin (keyboard handling is internal to the Wayland compositor)"
msgstr "Xfce4-xkb-plugin (ການຈັດການຄີບອດແມ່ນຂຶ້ນກັບ Wayland compositor)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:42
msgid ""
"More detailed info on the current Wayland status can be found on our "
"[Wayland roadmap.](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap)"
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດເບິ່ງຂໍ້ມູນລະອຽດເພີ່ມເຕີມກ່ຽວກັບສະຖານະຂອງ Wayland ໄດ້ທີ່ [ແຜນພັດທະນາ "
"Wayland.](https://wiki.xfce.org/releng/wayland_roadmap)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:46
msgid ""
"Icons and thumbnail scaling was fixed for various components. Various "
"missing icons for larger scales were added. Any blurriness when using Xfce "
"components on a HiDPI display should be gone now."
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂການປັບຂະໜາດໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຮູບຕົວຢ່າງສຳລັບຫຼາຍສ່ວນປະກອບ. "
"ເພີ່ມໄອຄອນທີ່ຂາດຫາຍໄປສຳລັບການປັບຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່. ບັນຫາໄອຄອນມົວເມື່ອໃຊ້ງານເທິງຈໍ "
"HiDPI ຄວນຈະໝົດໄປແລ້ວ."

#: content/about/tour420.md:48
msgid "[exo](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/exo/start)"
msgstr "[exo](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/exo/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:50
msgid "Icon View Performance"
msgstr "ປະສິດທິພາບການສະແດງໄອຄອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:52
msgid ""
"By using different container types, the \"Exo-Icon-View\" now can handle "
"100,000 files and more without freezing."
msgstr ""
"ດ້ວຍການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການຈັດເກັບທີ່ຕ່າງກັນ, \"Exo-Icon-View\" "
"ສາມາດຮອງຮັບໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ຫຼາຍກວ່າ 100,000 ໄຟລ໌ ໂດຍທີ່ເຄື່ອງບໍ່ຄ້າງ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:54
msgid "Type ahead search box"
msgstr "ຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາແບບພິມລ່ວງໜ້າ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:56
msgid ""
"The type ahead search box in the exo icon view now always stays inside the "
"according view widget."
msgstr ""
"ຊ່ອງຄົ້ນຫາແບບພິມລ່ວງໜ້າໃນ exo icon view ຈະສະແດງຢູ່ພາຍໃນວິດເຈັດການເບິ່ງສະເໝີ."

#: content/about/tour420.md:58
msgid "[libxfce4ui](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4ui/start)"
msgstr "[libxfce4ui](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4ui/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:60
msgid "Shortcut Editor"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຄີລັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:62
msgid ""
"Shortcuts now can be used for multiple actions if they don't conflict with "
"each other."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄີລັດດຽວກັນກັບຫຼາຍການກະທຳໄດ້ ຫາກມັນບໍ່ຂັດແຍ່ງກັນ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:64
msgid "About Dialog"
msgstr "ກ່ອງກ່ຽວກັບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:66
msgid ""
"The dialog now shows the distribution logo, information about the used "
"windowing system and the used GPU."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຕອນນີ້ຈະສະແດງໂລໂກ້ຂອງລະບົບ, ຂໍ້ມູນກ່ຽວກັບລະບົບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ ແລະ "
"ຂໍ້ມູນ GPU."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:68
msgid "![libxfce4ui - about dialog][img-libxfce4ui_about]"
msgstr "![libxfce4ui - ກ່ອງກ່ຽວກັບ][img-libxfce4ui_about]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:70
msgid ""
"[libxfce4windowing](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4windowing/start)"
msgstr ""
"[libxfce4windowing](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/libxfce4windowing/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:72
msgid ""
"This library is new to Xfce. Libxfce4windowing is an abstraction library "
"that attempts to present windowing concepts (screens, top level windows, "
"workspaces, etc.) in a windowing-system-independent manner."
msgstr ""
"ນີ້ແມ່ນຫ້ອງສະໝຸດໃໝ່ຂອງ Xfce. Libxfce4windowing "
"ເປັນຫ້ອງສະໝຸດທີ່ພະຍາຍາມນຳສະເໜີແນວຄິດເລື່ອງລະບົບໜ້າຕ່າງ (ໜ້າຈໍ, "
"ໜ້າຕ່າງລະດັບສູງ, ພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ) ໃຫ້ເປັນກາງຕໍ່ທຸກລະບົບໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:74
msgid ""
"Currently, X11 is fully supported via libwnck. Wayland is partially "
"supported by using various Wayland protocol extensions. However, the full "
"range of operations available on X11 is not available on Wayland, due to "
"missing features in these protocols extensions."
msgstr ""
"ໃນເວລານີ້, X11 ໄດ້ຮັບການຮອງຮັບຢ່າງສົມບູນຜ່ານ libwnck. ສ່ວນ Wayland "
"ແມ່ນຮອງຮັບບາງສ່ວນໂດຍການໃຊ້ສ່ວນເສີມຂອງໂປຣໂຕຄໍ Wayland. ແນວໃດກໍຕາມ, "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດບາງຢ່າງທີ່ມີໃນ X11 ອາດຈະຍັງບໍ່ມີໃນ Wayland ເພາະຂໍ້ຈຳກັດຂອງໂປຣໂຕຄໍ."

#: content/about/tour420.md:76
msgid "[thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start)"
msgstr "[thunar](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/thunar/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:78
msgid "Mounted and Remote Locations"
msgstr "ຕຳແໜ່ງທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງ ແລະ ຕຳແໜ່ງທາງໄກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:80
msgid "Mount points now show an emblem and have a specific type description."
msgstr ""
"ຈຸດຕິດຕັ້ງ (Mount points) ຈະສະແດງສັນຍະລັກ ແລະ ມີຄຳອະທິບາຍປະເພດທີ່ຊັດເຈນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:82
msgid "Ipv6 remote URLs are now supported."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບ URL ທາງໄກແບບ Ipv6 ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:84
msgid ""
"It is now possible to create symbolic links as well on remote locations."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດສ້າງລິງສັນຍະລັກ (symbolic links) ໃນຕຳແໜ່ງທາງໄກໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:86
msgid "Search"
msgstr "ຄົ້ນຫາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:88
msgid ""
"It is not required any more to wait until a search is finished to open the "
"context menu on search results."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ການຄົ້ນຫາສຳເລັດກໍສາມາດເປີດເມນູຄລິກຂວາໃສ່ຜົນການຄົ້ນຫາໄດ້ເລີຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:92
msgid "A couple of new toolbar buttons were added:"
msgstr "ເພີ່ມປຸ່ມໃໝ່ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື:"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:94
msgid "View Switcher - A drop-down button to select a view."
msgstr "ຕົວສະຫຼັບມຸມມອງ - ປຸ່ມລາຍການເລືອກເພື່ອປ່ຽນຮູບແບບການເບິ່ງ."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:95
msgid ""
"Menu - This hamburger button will show automatically in the toolbar, when "
"the menubar is hidden. It will reveal a vertical menu, bar, when pressed."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູ - "
"ປຸ່ມຮູບແຮມເບີເກີຈະສະແດງໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມືໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອແຖບເມນູຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້. "
"ເມື່ອກົດຈະສະແດງເມນູແນວຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:96
msgid "New Tab - Open a new tab using the current directory."
msgstr "ແທັບໃໝ່ - ເປີດແທັບໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour420.md:97
msgid "New Window - Open a new window using the current directory."
msgstr "ໜ້າຕ່າງໃໝ່ - ເປີດໜ້າຕ່າງໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ໂຟນເດີປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:99
msgid "![thunar - new toolbar buttons][img-thunar_toolbar_new_items]"
msgstr "![thunar - ປຸ່ມໃໝ່ໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື][img-thunar_toolbar_new_items]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:101
msgid ""
"![thunar - improved hamburger toolbar button][img-thunar_toolbar_hamburger]"
msgstr ""
"![thunar - ປຸ່ມເມນູແຮມເບີເກີທີ່ປັບປຸງໃໝ່][img-thunar_toolbar_hamburger]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:103
msgid ""
"On shrinking the Thunar window, toolbar items will now be moved to an "
"overflow menu. Like that, it is possible to maintain smaller thunar windows."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຫຍໍ້ຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງ Thunar, "
"ລາຍການໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມືຈະຖືກຍ້າຍໄປໄວ້ໃນເມນູສ່ວນເກີນ. ເຮັດໃຫ້ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"Thunar ຂະໜາດນ້ອຍໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:105
msgid ""
"Furthermore, a bug was fixed which prevented the usage of submenu custom "
"actions in the toolbar."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, "
"ຍັງໄດ້ແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຜິດພາດທີ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ບໍ່ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານເມນູຍ່ອຍຂອງການກະທຳທີ່ກຳນົດເອງໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:107
msgid "Window Decorations"
msgstr "ການຕົກແຕ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:109
msgid "There is now an option to use client side decorations in Thunar (CSD)."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ໃຊ້ການຕົກແຕ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງຝັ່ງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (CSD) ໃນ Thunar ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:111
msgid "![thunar - CSD with menu][img-thunar_csd_with_menu]"
msgstr "![thunar - CSD ພ້ອມເມນູ][img-thunar_csd_with_menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:113
msgid "![thunar - CSD without menu][img-thunar_csd_without_menu]"
msgstr "![thunar - CSD ແບບບໍ່ມີເມນູ][img-thunar_csd_without_menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:117
msgid ""
"An option to show the number of hidden files in the statusbar was added."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ສະແດງຈຳນວນໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເຊື່ອງໄວ້ໃນແຖບສະຖານະ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:119
msgid "Recently Used Files"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:121
msgid ""
"Only files which were successfully opened are now added to the list of "
"recently used files."
msgstr ""
"ສະເພາະໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກເປີດສຳເລັດເທົ່ານັ້ນທີ່ຈະຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:123
msgid "Directories won't be added to the recently used files anymore."
msgstr "ໂຟນເດີຈະບໍ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ຫຼ້າສຸດອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:125
msgid "Symbolic Icons"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນສັນຍະລັກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:127
msgid ""
"There is now an option to use symbolic icons in the side pane and colored "
"icons in the toolbar."
msgstr "ມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ໃຊ້ໄອຄອນສັນຍະລັກໃນແຖບຂ້າງ ແລະ ໄອຄອນແບບມີສີໃນແຖບເຄື່ອງມື."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:129
msgid "![thunar - symbolic icons][img-thunar_symbolic_icons]"
msgstr "![thunar - ໄອຄອນສັນຍະລັກ][img-thunar_symbolic_icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:131
msgid "![thunar - colored icons][img-thunar_colored_icons]"
msgstr "![thunar - ໄອຄອນແບບມີສີ][img-thunar_colored_icons]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:133
msgid "Drag and Drop"
msgstr "ລາກ ແລະ ວາງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:135
msgid "While dragging files, folders are now opened automatically on hover."
msgstr "ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກໄຟລ໌, ໂຟນເດີຈະຖືກເປີດອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປຈໍ່ໃສ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:137
msgid ""
"While dragging files, the focus of the split view pane is now updated when "
"hovered."
msgstr ""
"ໃນຂະນະທີ່ລາກໄຟລ໌, "
"ຈຸດໂຟກັດຂອງແຖບມຸມມອງແບບແຍກຈະຖືກອັບເດດເມື່ອເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປຈໍ່ໃສ່."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:139
msgid "Performance"
msgstr "ປະສິດທິພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:141
msgid ""
"In the past, you might have faced situation involving bigger numbers of "
"files in which thunar showed a freeze. Due to various different performance "
"measures, thunar now is much more bullet-proof for action involving huge "
"numbers of files."
msgstr ""
"ໃນອະດີດ, ທ່ານອາດຈະພົບກັບບັນຫາ Thunar ຄ້າງເມື່ອຈັດການກັບໄຟລ໌ຈຳນວນມະຫາສານ. "
"ດ້ວຍການປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍດ້ານ, ຕອນນີ້ Thunar "
"ສາມາດຈັດການກັບໄຟລ໌ຈຳນວນຫຼາຍໄດ້ຢ່າງໝັ້ນຄົງຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:143
msgid ""
"This was achieved by using appropriate container types, moving some actions "
"into separate jobs and throttling of view-updates."
msgstr ""
"ສິ່ງນີ້ສຳເລັດໄດ້ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຮູບແບບການຈັດເກັບທີ່ເໝາະສົມ, "
"ການແຍກການເຮັດວຽກບາງຢ່າງອອກໄປເຮັດເບື້ອງຫຼັງ ແລະ ການຄວບຄຸມການອັບເດດມຸມມອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:145
msgid ""
"A [number of integration test "
"cases](https://wiki.xfce.org/thunar/dev/integration_testcases) will be used "
"in order to keep performance on the current level in the future."
msgstr ""
"[ຊຸດການທົດສອບລະບົບ](https://wiki.xfce.org/thunar/dev/integration_testcases) "
"ຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ ເພື່ອຮັກສາລະດັບປະສິດທິພາບນີ້ໄວ້ຕໍ່ໄປໃນອະນາຄົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:149
msgid ""
"Shortcuts for custom action will now as well work when the custom action is "
"located in a sub-menu."
msgstr ""
"ຄີລັດສຳລັບການກະທຳທີ່ກຳນົດເອງຈະສາມາດໃຊ້ງານໄດ້ເຖິງວ່າການກະທຳນັ້ນຈະຢູ່ໃນເມນູຍ່ອຍກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:151
msgid "File Transfer"
msgstr "ການສົ່ງໂອນໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:153
msgid ""
"For file validation in thunar 4.18.x a md5 checksum was calculated for "
"source and target file. This calculation turned out to be rather slow and "
"actually superfluous. Now files are just compared directly. In addition, the"
" usage of direct I/O operations now attempts to prevent comparison of "
"possibly cached buffers."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການກວດສອບໄຟລ໌ໃນ Thunar 4.18.x ໄດ້ມີການຄິດໄລ່ຄ່າ md5 checksum "
"ຂອງໄຟລ໌ຕົ້ນທາງ ແລະ ປາຍທາງ. ເຊິ່ງການຄິດໄລ່ນີ້ຂ້ອນຂ້າງຊ້າ ແລະ ເກີນຄວາມຈຳເປັນ. "
"ຕອນນີ້ລະບົບຈະປຽບທຽບໄຟລ໌ໂດຍກົງແທນ. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ການໃຊ້ການຈັດການ direct I/O "
"ຍັງຊ່ວຍປ້ອງກັນການປຽບທຽບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ອາດຄ້າງຢູ່ໃນແຄຊ (cache) ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:155
msgid ""
"An option was added to only copy files in parallel if the relevant devices "
"are in idle state. This prevents possible fragmentation during copy for HDD "
"drives."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ສຳເນົາໄຟລ໌ແບບຂະໜານສະເພາະເມື່ອອຸປະກອນຢູ່ໃນສະຖານະຫວ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ."
" ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການເກີດໄຟລ໌ກະຈັດກະຈາຍໃນຮາດດິດ (HDD)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:157
msgid "Transferring files no longer steals the current focus."
msgstr "ການສົ່ງໂອນໄຟລ໌ຈະບໍ່ລົບກວນຈຸດໂຟກັດຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:159
msgid ""
"The file transfer question dialog now provides the same options while having"
" less buttons. In addition, file thumbnails now are properly requested by "
"the dialog."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຖາມກ່ຽວກັບການໂອນໄຟລ໌ມີຕົວເລືອກຄົບຖ້ວນໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ "
"ສະແດງຮູບຕົວຢ່າງໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:161
msgid "![thunar - file transfer dialog][img-thunar_transfer_dialog]"
msgstr "![thunar - ກ່ອງການສົ່ງໂອນໄຟລ໌][img-thunar_transfer_dialog]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:163
msgid "Launchers"
msgstr "ຕົວເປີດໂປຣແກຣມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:165
msgid ""
"By default, launcher names instead of filenames are shown now for trusted "
"launchers."
msgstr ""
"ໂດຍພື້ນຖານແລ້ວ, "
"ຊື່ຂອງຕົວເປີດຈະຖືກສະແດງແທນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ສຳລັບຕົວເປີດທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບຄວາມເຊື່ອຖື."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:167
msgid "Undo/Redo"
msgstr "ຍົກເລີກ/ເຮັດຄືນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:169
msgid ""
"The user now will be asked before any deletion will be done by an undo "
"operation."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈະຖືກຖາມກ່ອນທຸກຄັ້ງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະມີການລຶບໄຟລ໌ໂດຍການໃຊ້ຄຳສັ່ງ \"ຍົກເລີກ\" "
"(Undo)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:173
msgid ""
"Similar to the tree-view side pane, the main view now also supports folder "
"expansion."
msgstr "ມຸມມອງຫຼັກຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບການຂະຫຍາຍໂຟນເດີໄດ້ຄືກັບແຖບຂ້າງແບບຕົ້ນໄມ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:175
msgid "![thunar - expandable folders][img-thunar_expandable_folders]"
msgstr "![thunar - ໂຟນເດີທີ່ຂະຫຍາຍໄດ້][img-thunar_expandable_folders]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:179
msgid ""
"A shortcut now can be used to toggle between split-view panes, and the "
"focused pane now uses different coloring."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ຄີລັດເພື່ອສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງແຖບມຸມມອງແບບແຍກ ແລະ "
"ແຖບທີ່ຖືກໂຟກັດຈະມີສີທີ່ຕ່າງອອກໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:181
msgid "![thunar - split view][img-thunar_split_view]"
msgstr "![thunar - ມຸມມອງແບບແຍກ][img-thunar_split_view]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:183
msgid ""
"A dialog will now ask for confirmation when closing a split-pane with "
"multiple tabs."
msgstr "ຈະມີກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຖາມເພື່ອຢືນຢັນເມື່ອປິດແຖບມຸມມອງທີ່ມີຫຼາຍແທັບເປີດຢູ່."

#: content/about/tour420.md:185
msgid "[xfce4-appfinder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start)"
msgstr "[xfce4-appfinder](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-appfinder/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:187
msgid ""
"The application list now as well can be navigated via Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P keys "
"(VI default)."
msgstr ""
"ລາຍການແອັບພລິເຄຊັນສາມາດເລື່ອນເບິ່ງໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ Ctrl+N / Ctrl+P (ມາດຕະຖານ "
"VI)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:189
msgid ""
"An option was added to close the Appfinder window automatically when focus "
"is lost."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ປິດໜ້າຕ່າງ Appfinder ອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອອອກຈາກຈຸດໂຟກັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:191
msgid ""
"Ctrl+Enter can be used to execute commands immediately when selecting "
"entries from the dropdown."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ Ctrl+Enter ເພື່ອລັນຄຳສັ່ງທັນທີເມື່ອເລືອກລາຍການຈາກລາຍການເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:193
msgid ""
"Within the new version, application specific actions will show on right "
"click."
msgstr "ໃນລຸ້ນໃໝ່ນີ້, ການກະທຳສະເພາະຂອງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈະສະແດງຂຶ້ນເມື່ອຄລິກຂວາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:195
msgid "An option to show generic names of launchers was added."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ສະແດງຊື່ທົ່ວໄປຂອງຕົວເປີດໂປຣແກຣມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:197
msgid ""
"Appfinder optionally can now be launched as a daemon, so that it will "
"respond even quicker."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເລືອກເປີດ Appfinder ເປັນ daemon ເພື່ອໃຫ້ຕອບສະໜອງໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:199
msgid "An option allows now to launch items on a single click."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ເປີດລາຍການດ້ວຍການຄລິກພຽງບາດດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:201
msgid "![xfce4-appfinder - settings][img-appfinder_new]"
msgstr "![xfce4-appfinder - ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ][img-appfinder_new]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:203
msgid "[xfce4-panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start)"
msgstr "[xfce4-panel](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-panel/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:207
msgid "The border width of the panel is now configurable."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມກວ້າງຂອງຂອບແຜງ (panel) ໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:209
msgid ""
"For manual installations: the panel now does its best to find plugins in XDG"
" base directories, and better preserves its configuration when it can't find"
" them."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການຕິດຕັ້ງດ້ວຍຕົນເອງ: ແຜງຈະພະຍາຍາມຊອກຫາປລັກອິນໃນໂຟນເດີ XDG ແລະ "
"ຈະຮັກສາການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄວ້ໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນເຖິງວ່າຈະຊອກຫາປລັກອິນບໍ່ເຫັນກໍຕາມ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:211
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "ໂມງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:213
msgid "LCD clock: An option was added to visualize inactive segments."
msgstr "ໂມງ LCD: ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ສະແດງສ່ວນທີ່ບໍ່ໄດ້ເຮັດວຽກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:215
msgid "Analog: There is now an optional 24h mode."
msgstr "ໂມງເຂັມ: ຕອນນີ້ມີໂໝດ 24 ຊົ່ວໂມງໃຫ້ເລືອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:217
msgid "Digital: Week numbers now are shown optionally."
msgstr "ໂມງດີຈີຕອນ: ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເລືອກໃຫ້ສະແດງເລກລຳດັບຂອງອາທິດໄດ້."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:219
msgid "Show Desktop"
msgstr "ສະແດງເດດທັອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:221
msgid ""
"There is now the possibility to show the desktop when hovering the mouse on "
"the \"show desktop\" panel icon."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໃຫ້ສະແດງເດດທັອບໄດ້ເມື່ອເອົາເມົາສ໌ໄປຈໍ່ໃສ່ໄອຄອນ "
"\"ສະແດງເດດທັອບ\" ເທິງແຜງ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:223
msgid "Tasklist"
msgstr "ລາຍການໜ້າວຽກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:225
msgid ""
"Icon size management has been improved overall, notably by switching to "
"libxfce4windowing."
msgstr ""
"ການຈັດການຂະໜາດໄອຄອນໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງໃນພາບລວມ ໂດຍສະເພາະການປ່ຽນມາໃຊ້ "
"libxfce4windowing."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:229
msgid ""
"The 'delete' key can now be used to remove panel objects, and several "
"objects can be removed at once."
msgstr ""
"ສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ 'Delete' ເພື່ອລຶບວັດຖຸອອກຈາກແຜງ ແລະ "
"ສາມາດລຶບຫຼາຍວັດຖຸພ້ອມກັນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:231
msgid ""
"Panel objects in the panel configuration list now will have the same icons "
"as in the panel itself."
msgstr "ວັດຖຸໃນລາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຜງຈະມີໄອຄອນຄືກັນກັບທີ່ສະແດງຢູ່ໃນແຜງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:233
msgid "![xfce4-panel - panel configuration list][img-panel_item_list]"
msgstr "![xfce4-panel - ລາຍການຕັ້ງຄ່າແຜງ][img-panel_item_list]"

#: content/about/tour420.md:235
msgid ""
"[xfce4-power-manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start)"
msgstr ""
"[xfce4-power-manager](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-power-manager/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:237
msgid "Screen Locking"
msgstr "ການລັອກໜ້າຈໍ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:239
msgid ""
"There is no dedicated \"security\" tab anymore. Lock screen management was "
"massively simplified and \"Light Locker\" was dropped. \"lock-on-sleep\" is "
"now synchronized with xfce4-session and xfce4-screensaver."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ມີແທັບ \"ຄວາມປອດໄພ\" ແຍກຕ່າງຫາກອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. "
"ການຈັດການການລັອກໜ້າຈໍຖືກເຮັດໃຫ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຍົກເລີກການໃຊ້ \"Light Locker\". "
"ສ່ວນ \"ລັອກເມື່ອພັກເຄື່ອງ\" ຈະເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ xfce4-session ແລະ "
"xfce4-screensaver."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:241
msgid ""
"Screen locking settings are now only handled by xfce4-screensaver to avoid "
"conflicts. A button to open xfce4-screensaver-preferences was added:"
msgstr ""
"ການຕັ້ງຄ່າລັອກໜ້າຈໍຈະຖືກຈັດການໂດຍ xfce4-screensaver "
"ພຽງຢ່າງດຽວເພື່ອຫຼີກລ່ຽງການຂັດແຍ່ງ. ເພີ່ມປຸ່ມເພື່ອເປີດການຕັ້ງຄ່າ "
"xfce4-screensaver:"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:243
msgid "![xfce4-power-manager - settings][img-power_manager_settings]"
msgstr "![xfce4-power-manager - ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ][img-power_manager_settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:245
msgid "![xfce4-screensaver - settings][img-power_manager_screensaver]"
msgstr "![xfce4-screensaver - ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ][img-power_manager_screensaver]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:247
msgid "Power Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າພະລັງງານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:249
msgid ""
"Support for handling different power profiles via power-profiles-daemon was "
"added."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບການຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ພະລັງງານຜ່ານ power-profiles-daemon."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:251
msgid ""
"The overall charge state calculation was wrong for some cases and is now "
"fixed."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການຄຳນວນສະຖານະການຊາດໄຟໃນບາງກໍລະນີທີ່ເຄີຍຜິດພາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:253
msgid ""
"When the critical power dialog pops up, unintentional user actions are now "
"prevented."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອມີກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມເຕືອນພະລັງງານວິກິດສະແດງຂຶ້ນ, "
"ລະບົບຈະປ້ອງກັນການກົດປຸ່ມໂດຍບໍ່ຕັ້ງໃຈ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:255
msgid "There is now support for the hybrid sleep mode."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບໂໝດພັກເຄື່ອງແບບໄຮບຣິດ (hybrid sleep) ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:257
msgid "The device details tab now as well shows the energy rate."
msgstr "ແທັບລາຍລະອຽດອຸປະກອນຈະສະແດງອັດຕາການໃຊ້ພະລັງງານນຳ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:259
msgid "Others"
msgstr "ອື່ນໆ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:261
msgid "Several use-cases for lid close were fixed."
msgstr "ແກ້ໄຂການເຮັດວຽກເມື່ອປິດຝາຄອມພິວເຕີໃນຫຼາຍກໍລະນີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:263
msgid "There are now the options \"shutdown\" and \"do nothing\" on lid close."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກ \"ປິດເຄື່ອງ\" ແລະ \"ບໍ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດຫຍັງ\" ເມື່ອປິດຝາຄອມພິວເຕີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:265
msgid ""
"Buttons to change the brightness exponentially and keyboard backlight toggle"
" keys now are supported."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບປຸ່ມປັບຄວາມສະຫວ່າງແບບທະວີຄູນ ແລະ ປຸ່ມສະຫຼັບໄຟພື້ນຄີບອດແລ້ວ."

#: content/about/tour420.md:267
msgid "[xfce4-session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start)"
msgstr "[xfce4-session](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-session/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:269
msgid ""
"The logout dialog will not provide a checkbox to enable session saving "
"anymore."
msgstr "ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມອອກຈາກລະບົບຈະບໍ່ມີຊ່ອງໃຫ້ຕິກເພື່ອບັນທຶກເຊດຊັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:271
msgid ""
"It is now possible to start a Wayland session via `startxfce4 --wayland`."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນເຊດຊັນ Wayland ໄດ້ໂດຍຜ່ານຄຳສັ່ງ `startxfce4 --wayland`."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:273
msgid ""
"Minimal support for xdg-desktop-portal was added by registering for a "
"wallpaper, screenshot and background xapp."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບ xdg-desktop-portal ເບື້ອງຕົ້ນສຳລັບພາບພື້ນຫຼັງ ແລະ "
"ການຖ່າຍຮູບໜ້າຈໍ."

#: content/about/tour420.md:275
msgid "[xfce4-settings](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start)"
msgstr "[xfce4-settings](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfce4-settings/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:279
msgid ""
"Icon themes are now loaded in a separate thread, in order to prevent a "
"possible freeze."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທີມໄອຄອນຈະຖືກໂຫຼດແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ເຄື່ອງຄ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:281
msgid ""
"For icon themes which are known to be incomplete, a warning now will be "
"shown."
msgstr "ຈະມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນສຳລັບທີມໄອຄອນທີ່ຮູ້ວ່າຂໍ້ມູນບໍ່ຄົບຖ້ວນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:283
msgid "The usage of client side decorations is opt-in now, not opt-out."
msgstr "ການໃຊ້ການຕົກແຕ່ງຝັ່ງຜູ້ໃຊ້ (CSD) ຕອນນີ້ຕ້ອງເລືອກເປີດເອງ (opt-in)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:285
msgid ""
"Dark themes now are identified and supported in a more reliable way. "
"(Relevant e.g. for the Qogir and Orchis themes)"
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງການກວດສອບ ແລະ ຮອງຮັບທີມແບບມືດໃຫ້ດີຂຶ້ນ (ເຊັ່ນ ທີມ Qogir ແລະ Orchis)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:289
msgid ""
"The default display profile has been added to the list of profiles that can "
"match, and will be used if more than one matches now."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຈໍສະແດງຜົນມາດຕະຖານເຂົ້າໃນລາຍການ ແລະ "
"ຈະຖືກນຳມາໃຊ້ຫາກມີຫຼາຍໂປຣໄຟລ໌ທີ່ກົງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:291
msgid ""
"Profile management has been extended to all profiles, not just those that "
"match, and their names can now be edited."
msgstr "ຂະຫຍາຍການຈັດການໂປຣໄຟລ໌ໃຫ້ຄວບຄຸມທຸກໂປຣໄຟລ໌ ແລະ ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂຊື່ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:293
msgid ""
"Scaling now always is done for both dimensions, and the preview shows the "
"resulting size."
msgstr ""
"ການປັບຂະໜາດຈະເຮັດທັງສອງມິຕິສະເໝີ ແລະ ມີການສະແດງຕົວຢ່າງຂະໜາດທີ່ຈະໄດ້ຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:295
msgid ""
"Mirror state management has been improved overall, in particular by removing"
" the need to match refresh rates."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງການຈັດການສະຖານະການສະທ້ອນຈໍ (Mirror) "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງໃຫ້ອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊກົງກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:297
msgid ""
"The minimal dialog has been improved, in particular by allowing the display "
"to be extended to the left and from top to bottom, and with compact profile "
"display."
msgstr ""
"ປັບປຸງກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຂະໜາດນ້ອຍ ໂດຍອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ຂະຫຍາຍຈໍໄປທາງຊ້າຍ ແລະ ຈາກເທິງລົງລຸ່ມ"
" ພ້ອມທັງສະແດງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ແບບກະທັດຮັດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:299
msgid "![xfce4-settings - minimal display][img-settings_display]"
msgstr "![xfce4-settings - ການສະແດງຜົນແບບກະທັດຮັດ][img-settings_display]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:301
msgid "Mouse Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມົາສ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:303
msgid ""
"A checkbox was added to toggle between adaptive and flat mouse accel "
"profile."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມຊ່ອງໃຫ້ເລືອກສະຫຼັບລະຫວ່າງໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຄວາມໄວເມົາສ໌ແບບປັບຕົວ (adaptive) ແລະ "
"ແບບຄົງທີ່ (flat)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:305
msgid ""
"High resolution scrolling can now be enabled for mice which do support it."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ການເລື່ອນໜ້າຈໍແບບຄວາມລະອຽດສູງສຳລັບເມົາສ໌ທີ່ຮອງຮັບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:307
msgid "![xfce4-settings - mouse][img-settings_mouse]"
msgstr "![xfce4-settings - ເມົາສ໌][img-settings_mouse]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:309
msgid "Mime Settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Mime"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:311
msgid "It is now possible to select/change multiple items at once."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເລືອກ ຫຼື ປ່ຽນແປງຫຼາຍລາຍການພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#: content/about/tour420.md:313
msgid "[xfconf](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfconf/start)"
msgstr "[xfconf](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfconf/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:315
msgid ""
"A systemd user unit, corresponding to the D-Bus session service, is now "
"added."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມ systemd user unit ທີ່ກົງກັບບໍລິການ D-Bus session ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:317
msgid ""
"Whitespaces are now properly escaped when writing a xfconf channel to disk."
msgstr "ມີການຈັດການຍະຫວ່າງໃຫ້ຖືກຕ້ອງເມື່ອບັນທຶກຊ່ອງ xfconf ລົງໃນດິດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:319
msgid "Xfconf-query now displays array contents."
msgstr "Xfconf-query ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດສະແດງເນື້ອໃນແບບອາເຣ (array) ໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#: content/about/tour420.md:321
msgid "[xfdesktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start)"
msgstr "[xfdesktop](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfdesktop/start)"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:323
msgid "Background Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການພື້ນຫຼັງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:325
msgid ""
"For random wallpaper cycling, wallpapers now are only repeated after all "
"other wallpapers were shown."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບການວົນພາບພື້ນຫຼັງແບບສຸ່ມ, ພາບຈະບໍ່ກັບມາຊ້ຳຈົນກວ່າຈະສະແດງຄົບທຸກພາບແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:327
msgid ""
"Old Xfce backgrounds were ported from .png to .svg to be usable for large "
"screens."
msgstr ""
"ພາບພື້ນຫຼັງເກົ່າໆ ຂອງ Xfce ຖືກປ່ຽນຈາກ .png ເປັນ .svg "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ໃຊ້ກັບໜ້າຈໍຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ໄດ້ດີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:329
msgid "Gradients will now be rendered in a gamma-correct way."
msgstr "ການໄລ່ສີ (Gradients) ຈະຖືກສະແດງຜົນໃຫ້ມີຄ່າແສງ (gamma) ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:331
msgid "Icon grid"
msgstr "ຕາໜ່າງໄອຄອນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:333
msgid "The confirmation dialog for arranging desktop icons now is optional."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງຂໍ້ຄວາມຢືນຢັນການຈັດລຽງໄອຄອນເດດທັອບ ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເລືອກບໍ່ໃຫ້ສະແດງໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:335
msgid ""
"It is now possible to set custom colors for icon labels and icon background."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າສີເອງສຳລັບຊື່ໄອຄອນ ແລະ ພື້ນຫຼັງໄອຄອນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:337
msgid "The icon grid on each monitor is now independent of one another."
msgstr "ຕາໜ່າງໄອຄອນໃນແຕ່ລະໜ້າຈໍຈະແຍກເປັນອິດສະຫຼະຈາກກັນ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:339
msgid "Minimized Application Icons"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຖືກຫຍໍ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:341
msgid ""
"Window icons are now initially shown on the monitor where the window was "
"present before being minimized."
msgstr "ໄອຄອນໜ້າຕ່າງຈະສະແດງຢູ່ໃນໜ້າຈໍເດີມທີ່ມັນເຄີຍຢູ່ກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖືກຫຍໍ້ລົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:343
msgid ""
"The context menu (when clicking on an empty space) now has more useful "
"options than before."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູຄລິກຂວາ (ເມື່ອຄລິກໃສ່ບ່ອນຫວ່າງ) ມີຕົວເລືອກທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນກວ່າເກົ່າ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:345
msgid "File Icons"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນໄຟລ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:347
msgid "There is now an option to sort folders before files."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ມີຕົວເລືອກໃຫ້ຮຽງໂຟນເດີຂຶ້ນກ່ອນໄຟລ໌ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:349
msgid ""
"The positions of the icons are now saved in a way that should avoid icons "
"moving around in unexpected ways when monitors are added and removed."
msgstr ""
"ຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງໄອຄອນຈະຖືກບັນທຶກໄວ້ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນບໍ່ໃຫ້ໄອຄອນຍ້າຍໄປມາເມື່ອມີການເພີ່ມ "
"ຫຼື ຖອດໜ້າຈໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:351
msgid ""
"New files and dropped files now will be placed near the current cursor "
"location."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ ແລະ ໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຖືກລາກມາຈະຖືກວາງໄວ້ໃກ້ກັບຕຳແໜ່ງຂອງເຄີເຊີປັດຈຸບັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:353
msgid "Icons of fixed disks and drives can now be optionally shown."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເລືອກໃຫ້ສະແດງໄອຄອນຂອງດິດ ແລະ ໄດຣຟ໌ຕ່າງໆ ໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:357
msgid "The 'Desktop Icons' tab was fully reworked."
msgstr "ແທັບ 'ໄອຄອນເດດທັອບ' ຖືກປັບປຸງໃໝ່ທັງໝົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:359
msgid "![xfdesktop - settings - desktop icons][img-xfdesktop_settings_icons]"
msgstr ""
"![xfdesktop - ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ - ໄອຄອນເດັສທັອບ][img-xfdesktop_settings_icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:361
msgid ""
"All shortcuts of Xfdesktop now can be configured, using the "
"XfceShortcutsManagers widget."
msgstr ""
"ຄີລັດທັງໝົດຂອງ Xfdesktop ສາມາດຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ແລ້ວ ໂດຍໃຊ້ວິດເຈັດ "
"XfceShortcutsManagers."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:363
msgid ""
"![xfdesktop - settings - keyboard shortcuts][img-"
"xfdesktop_settings_shortcuts]"
msgstr ""
"![xfdesktop - ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ - ປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມ][img-xfdesktop_settings_shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:365
msgid ""
"More folders that hold background images were added as shortcuts in the "
"settings dialog."
msgstr "ເພີ່ມໂຟນເດີທີ່ເກັບພາບພື້ນຫຼັງເຂົ້າເປັນທາງລັດໃນກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:367
msgid ""
"The settings dialog will update if the background is changed from outside "
"the dialog."
msgstr "ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈະອັບເດດອັດຕະໂນມັດຫາກມີການປ່ຽນພາບພື້ນຫຼັງຈາກພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:369
msgid ""
"Wallpaper image folders now are loaded fully asynchronously to prevent lag."
msgstr ""
"ໂຟນເດີພາບພື້ນຫຼັງຈະຖືກໂຫຼດແບບເບື້ອງຫຼັງ (asynchronously) "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນການກະຕຸກ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour420.md:371
msgid "Context Menu"
msgstr "ເມນູຄລິກຂວາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:373
msgid ""
"Cascading custom actions will now as well shown correctly in Xfdesktop."
msgstr ""
"ການກະທຳທີ່ກຳນົດເອງແບບລຽງລຳດັບ (Cascading) ຈະສະແດງຢ່າງຖືກຕ້ອງໃນ Xfdesktop."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:375
msgid "It is now possible to open multiple selected folders at once."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດເປີດຫຼາຍໂຟນເດີທີ່ເລືອກໄວ້ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:377
msgid ""
"The context menu now opens on button press rather than button release, as "
"most users will expect."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູຄລິກຂວາຈະເປີດຂຶ້ນທັນທີເມື່ອກົດປຸ່ມ ແທນທີ່ຈະລໍຖ້າໃຫ້ປ່ອຍປຸ່ມ "
"ຄືກັບທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ຄຸ້ນເຄີຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:379
msgid "The middle-click window list menu has new styling and added features."
msgstr ""
"ເມນູລາຍຊື່ໜ້າຕ່າງເມື່ອຄລິກປຸ່ມກາງມີຮູບແບບໃໝ່ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#: content/about/tour420.md:381
msgid "[xfwm4](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start)"
msgstr "[xfwm4](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/start)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:383
msgid "Support for stretch theme variants"
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບທີມແບບຍືດ (stretch)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:385
msgid "Compositor: Block softpipe for GLX vsync"
msgstr "Compositor: ປິດກັ້ນ softpipe ສຳລັບ GLX vsync"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:387
msgid "Focus: Include skip taskbar/pager when passing focus"
msgstr "Focus: ຮວມການຂ້າມແຖບໜ້າວຽກ/ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຈໍເມື່ອສົ່ງຕໍ່ຈຸດໂຟກັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour420.md:389
msgid ""
"Fix crash when alt-tabbing "
"([#762](https://gitlab.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/-/issues/762))"
msgstr ""
"ແກ້ໄຂການຂັດຂ້ອງເມື່ອກົດ alt-tab "
"([#762](https://gitlab.xfce.org/xfce/xfwm4/-/issues/762))"

#: content/about/tour420.md:391
msgid ""
"<p align=\"right\"><small>Used theme: \"Greybird-dark\". Used icon-theme: "
"\"elementary Xfce dark\".</small></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"right\"><small>ຮູບແບບທີມທີ່ໃຊ້: \"Greybird-dark\". "
"ຮູບແບບໄອຄອນທີ່ໃຊ້: \"elementary Xfce dark\".</small></p>\n"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour44.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.4 tour"
msgstr "ການນຳຊົມ Xfce 4.4"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:7
msgid ""
"As of today, the long awaited version 4.4.0 of the Xfce Desktop Environment "
"is finally available. I will try to highlight some of the new features which"
" have been added since the last stable release."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ສຸດ Xfce 4.4.0 ທີ່ຫຼາຍຄົນລໍຄອຍກໍໄດ້ເປີດຕົວແລ້ວ. "
"ຂ້ອຍຈະມາແນະນຳບາງຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມານັບຕັ້ງແຕ່ລຸ້ນກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:9
msgid "Desktop Icons"
msgstr "ໄອຄອນເທິງເດັສທັອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:11
msgid ""
"One of the most often requested features during the 4.0 and 4.2 was support "
"for icons on the desktop. Now, with Xfce 4.4.0, this feature was finally "
"added to the desktop manager **Xfdesktop**."
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງໃນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ມີການຮຽກຮ້ອງຫຼາຍທີ່ສຸດໃນຊ່ວງລຸ້ນ 4.0 ແລະ 4.2 "
"ແມ່ນການຮອງຮັບໄອຄອນເທິງໜ້າຈໍເດັສທັອບ. ຕອນນີ້, ໃນ Xfce 4.4.0 "
"ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ກໍໄດ້ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າໄປໃນຕົວຈັດການເດັສທັອບ **Xfdesktop** ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:13
msgid "![Desktop Icons][img-desktop-icons]"
msgstr "![ໄອຄອນເດັສທັອບ][img-desktop-icons]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:15
msgid ""
"The desktop manager utilizes **Thunar**'s libraries to handle application "
"launchers and regular files/folders on the desktop. The desktop manager is "
"also able to display icons for minimized windows on the desktop, which is "
"quite a popular feature from the CDE world. Of course, you can disable the "
"desktop icons altogether if you prefer a clean desktop."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການເດັສທັອບນຳໃຊ້ໄລບຣາຣີຂອງ **Thunar** ເພື່ອຈັດການຕົວຮຽກໃຊ້ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"
" ແລະ ໄຟລ໌/ໂຟນເດີທົ່ວໄປເທິງເດັສທັອບ. "
"ຕົວຈັດການເດັສທັອບຍັງສາມາດສະແດງໄອຄອນສຳລັບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ຫຍໍ້ໄວ້ເທິງເດັສທັອບໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ,"
" ເຊິ່ງເປັນຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ນິຍົມຫຼາຍມາຈາກລະບົບ CDE. "
"ແນ່ນອນວ່າທ່ານສາມາດປິດການສະແດງໄອຄອນເທິງເດັສທັອບທັງໝົດໄດ້ "
"ຫາກທ່ານມັກເດັສທັອບທີ່ສະອາດຕາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:17
msgid "![Desktop Settings][img-desktop-settings]"
msgstr "![ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເດັສທັອບ][img-desktop-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:19
msgid ""
"**Xfdesktop** also continues to provide access to the applications menu, as "
"it did in the previous Xfce releases."
msgstr ""
"**Xfdesktop** ຍັງສືບຕໍ່ຮອງຮັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງເມນູແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ "
"ຄືກັນກັບລຸ້ນກ່ອນໜ້າຂອງ Xfce."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:23
msgid ""
"The desktop icon support goes hand in hand with the new file manager "
"[Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/) which replaces the previous file manager "
"**Xffm**."
msgstr ""
"ການຮອງຮັບໄອຄອນເທິງເດັສທັອບມາພ້ອມກັບຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໃໝ່ "
"[Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/) ເຊິ່ງເຂົ້າມາແທນທີ່ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ເກົ່າ "
"**Xffm**."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:25
msgid "![Thunar File Manager][img-thunar]"
msgstr "![ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ Thunar][img-thunar]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:27
msgid ""
"**Thunar** was written from scratch to provide an easy to use, but still "
"very lightweight file manager for Xfce. Its user interface was designed to "
"look similar to the file chooser which was introduced with GTK+ 2.4, and "
"other file managers such as **Nautilus** and **pcmanfm** already picked up "
"that idea as well."
msgstr ""
"**Thunar** ຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນມາໃໝ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ເປັນຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ທີ່ໃຊ້ງ່າຍ ແຕ່ຍັງເບົາບາງຫຼາຍສຳລັບ Xfce. "
"ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຖືກອອກແບບມາໃຫ້ຄ້າຍຄືກັບຕົວເລືອກໄຟລ໌ ທີ່ນຳສະເໜີໃນ GTK+ 2.4, "
"ແລະ ຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ອື່ນໆ ເຊັ່ນ **Nautilus** ແລະ **pcmanfm** "
"ກໍໄດ້ນຳເອົາແນວຄວາມຄິດນີ້ໄປໃຊ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:29
msgid ""
"**Thunar** supports all the file management functionality which users will "
"expect, and also several advanced features. For example, a so-called *Bulk "
"Renamer* is included which allows users to rename multiple files at once "
"using a certain criterion."
msgstr ""
"**Thunar** ຮອງຮັບທຸກຟັງຊັນການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ທີ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕ້ອງການ ແລະ "
"ຍັງມີຄຸນສົມບັດຂັ້ນສູງອີກຫຼາຍຢ່າງ. ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ: ລະບົບທີ່ເອີ້ນວ່າ *Bulk "
"Renamer* ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ປ່ຽນຊື່ຫຼາຍໆໄຟລ໌ພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ "
"ໂດຍອີງຕາມເງື່ອນໄຂທີ່ກຳນົດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:31
msgid "![Thunar Bulk Rename][img-thunar-bulk-rename]"
msgstr "![ການປ່ຽນຊື່ໄຟລ໌ພ້ອມກັນ Thunar][img-thunar-bulk-rename]"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:33
msgid "Removable Drives and Media"
msgstr "ໄດຣຟ໌ ແລະ ສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:35
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 provides easy access to data on removable drives and media. Just "
"insert the media into the drive or plug the new drive in to the computer and"
" an icon representing the removable volume will appear on the desktop and in"
" **Thunar**'s side pane."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຂໍ້ມູນໃນໄດຣຟ໌ ແລະ ສື່ທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ. "
"ພຽງແຕ່ສຽບແຜ່ນ ຫຼື ສຽບໄດຣຟ໌ໃໝ່ເຂົ້າກັບຄອມພິວເຕີ, "
"ໄອຄອນຂອງອຸປະກອນນັ້ນກໍຈະສະແດງເທິງເດັສທັອບ ແລະ ໃນແຖບຂ້າງຂອງ **Thunar** ທັນທີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:37
msgid "![Removable Volumes][img-removable-volumes]"
msgstr "![ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້][img-removable-volumes]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:39
msgid ""
"Click on the icon to automatically mount the volume. Right-click the icon to"
" unmount the drive or eject the media from the drive. Note however that this"
" feature requires [HAL](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software_2fhal) and is "
"therefore only available for Linux 2.6.x and FreeBSD 6.x and above at the "
"time of this writing (there is limited removable media support for FreeBSD "
"4.x and 5.x which does not require HAL)."
msgstr ""
"ຄລິກທີ່ໄອຄອນເພື່ອເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mount) ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ຄລິກຂວາທີ່ໄອຄອນເພື່ອຕັດການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (unmount) ຫຼື ດັນສື່ອອກຈາກໄດຣຟ໌. "
"ແຕ່ກະລຸນາຮັບຊາບວ່າ ຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ຕ້ອງການ "
"[HAL](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software_2fhal) ດັ່ງນັ້ນຈຶ່ງຮອງຮັບສະເພາະ "
"Linux 2.6.x ແລະ FreeBSD 6.x ຂຶ້ນໄປເທົ່ານັ້ນໃນເວລານີ້ "
"(ມີການຮອງຮັບແບບຈຳກັດສຳລັບ FreeBSD 4.x ແລະ 5.x ທີ່ບໍ່ຕ້ອງການ HAL)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:41
msgid "Text Editor"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:43
msgid ""
"The new text editor **MousePad** is included with this release. **MousePad**"
" provides all the basic editor functionality, nothing more, nothing less."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມໃໝ່ **MousePad** ຖືກຮວມເຂົ້າໃນລຸ້ນນີ້. **MousePad** "
"ມີທຸກຟັງຊັນພື້ນຖານສຳລັບການແກ້ໄຂຂໍ້ຄວາມ, ບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຫຼາຍ ຫຼື ໜ້ອຍໄປກວ່ານັ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:45
msgid "![MousePad][img-mousepad]"
msgstr "![MousePad][img-mousepad]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:47
msgid ""
"You can think of **MousePad** as the equivalent to **NotePad** on Windows. "
"It starts up very fast, usually in less than one second, even on older "
"systems."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານອາດຈະຄິດວ່າ **MousePad** ທຽບເທົ່າກັບ **NotePad** ໃນ Windows. "
"ມັນເປີດຂຶ້ນໄວຫຼາຍ, ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປແມ່ນໃຊ້ເວລາບໍ່ຮອດໜຶ່ງວິນາທີ, "
"ແມ່ນແຕ່ໃນລະບົບເກົ່າໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:51
msgid "**Xfwm4** continues to be the window manager of the hearts."
msgstr "**Xfwm4** ຍັງຄົງເປັນຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ຄອງໃຈສະເໝີມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:53
msgid "![Xfwm4 ARGB32][img-xfwm4-argb32]"
msgstr "![Xfwm4 ARGB32][img-xfwm4-argb32]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:55
msgid ""
"This release features an enhanced compositor, supporting transparent ARGB "
"windows, shadows, window frame transparency and much more."
msgstr ""
"ລຸ້ນນີ້ມີ ຕົວປະສົມພາບ ທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ, ຮອງຮັບໜ້າຕ່າງ ARGB ແບບໂປ່ງໃສ, ເງົາ, "
"ຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສຂອງຂອບໜ້າຕ່າງ ແລະ ອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:57
msgid "![Xfwm4 Switcher][img-xfwm4-switcher]"
msgstr "![ຕົວສະຫຼັບ Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-switcher]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:59
msgid ""
"**Xfwm4** also includes a brand new application switcher, as shown in the "
"screenshot above, which displays all windows from the current workspace with"
" icons and window titles."
msgstr ""
"**Xfwm4** ຍັງຮວມເອົາຕົວສະຫຼັບແອັບພລິເຄຊັນແບບໃໝ່, "
"ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງໃນພາບໜ້າຈໍຂ້າງເທິງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງສະແດງທຸກໜ້າຕ່າງຈາກພື້ນທີ່ເຮັດວຽກປັດຈຸບັນພ້ອມທັງໄອຄອນ ແລະ ຊື່ໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:61
msgid "![Xfwm4 Themes][img-xfwm4-themes]"
msgstr "![ຮູບແບບທີມ Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-themes]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:63
msgid ""
"Further on support for multiple image formats for window decoration themes "
"was added, including `PNG`, `GIF` and `SVG` images."
msgstr ""
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ "
"ຍັງໄດ້ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບຮູບແບບໄຟລ໌ຮູບພາບຫຼາຍປະເພດສຳລັບທີມຕົກແຕ່ງໜ້າຕ່າງ, "
"ເຊິ່ງຮວມມີຮູບພາບ `PNG`, `GIF` ແລະ `SVG`."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:65
msgid "![Xfwm4 Tweaks][img-xfwm4-tweaks]"
msgstr "![ການປັບແຕ່ງ Xfwm4][img-xfwm4-tweaks]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:67
msgid ""
"Advanced controls for the window manager were also added, allowing thorough "
"tweaking of window behavior."
msgstr ""
"ເພີ່ມການຄວບຄຸມຂັ້ນສູງສຳລັບຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ປັບແຕ່ງພຶດຕິກຳຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້ຢ່າງລະອຽດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:71
msgid ""
"The **Xfce4-panel** was completely rewritten for the Xfce 4.4 release. "
"Multiple panels are supported *out of the box* now and can easily be "
"configured using the new **Panel Manager** shown in the screenshot below."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce4-panel** ຖືກຂຽນຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ທັງໝົດສຳລັບລຸ້ນ Xfce 4.4. "
"ຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍແຜງຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ ແລະ ສາມາດກຳນົດຄ່າໄດ້ງ່າຍ ໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"**ຕົວຈັດການແຜງ** ໃໝ່ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງໃນພາບໜ້າຈໍດ້ານລຸ່ມ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:73
msgid "![Panel Manager][img-panel-manager]"
msgstr "![ຕົວຈັດການແຜງ][img-panel-manager]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:75
msgid ""
"One of the major problems in previous Xfce releases was that every plugin "
"had to be run in the same process as the panel, and hence every plugin was "
"able to crash the whole panel. To address this issue, support for external "
"plugins was added to the panel."
msgstr ""
"ບັນຫາໃຫຍ່ໃນລຸ້ນກ່ອນແມ່ນທຸກປລັກອິນເຮັດວຽກໃນໂປຣເຊສດຽວກັບແຜງ, "
"ຖ້າປລັກອິນໃດໜຶ່ງຄ້າງ ມັນຈະເຮັດໃຫ້ແຜງທັງໝົດຄ້າງໄປນຳ. ເພື່ອແກ້ບັນຫານີ້, "
"ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບປລັກອິນຈາກພາຍນອກ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:77
msgid "![Panel Add Item Dialog][img-panel-additem]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງເພີ່ມລາຍການໃສ່ແຜງ][img-panel-additem]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:79
msgid ""
"Developers of panel plugins can now decide whether the plugin should run as "
"external process or as part of the panel process, depending on the stability"
" of the plugin."
msgstr ""
"ຜູ້ພັດທະນາປລັກອິນສາມາດເລືອກໄດ້ວ່າຈະໃຫ້ປລັກອິນເຮັດວຽກແຍກໂປຣເຊສ ຫຼື ລວມກັບແຜງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:81
msgid "![Panel Icon Box Plugin][img-panel-iconbox]"
msgstr "![ປລັກອິນກ່ອງໄອຄອນຂອງແຜງ][img-panel-iconbox]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:83
msgid ""
"Since there is now support for multiple panels, the separate **Xftaskbar4** "
"and **Xfce4-iconbox** utilities are no longer required. Instead, both the "
"taskbar and the iconbox are available as panel plugins now."
msgstr ""
"ເນື່ອງຈາກຕອນນີ້ຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍແຜງແລ້ວ, ໂປຣແກຣມແຍກຕ່າງຫາກຢ່າງ **Xftaskbar4** ແລະ "
"**Xfce4-iconbox** ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ແທນທີ່ນັ້ນ, ທັງແຖບໜ້າວຽກ ແລະ "
"ກ່ອງໄອຄອນ ສາມາດໃຊ້ງານເປັນປລັກອິນຂອງແຜງໄດ້ແລ້ວໃນຕອນນີ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:85
msgid ""
"Most of the additional panel plugins, available via the [Xfce Goodies "
"Project](https://goodies.xfce.org/), have been updated for the new panel, "
"and several new plugins were added. For example, the brand new "
"**xfce4-xfapplet-plugin** allows users to add GNOME panel applets to the "
"Xfce panel."
msgstr ""
"ປລັກອິນແຜງເພີ່ມເຕີມສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ທີ່ມີໃນ [ໂຄງການ Xfce "
"Goodies](https://goodies.xfce.org/) ໄດ້ຖືກອັບເດດສຳລັບແຜງໃໝ່ແລ້ວ, ແລະ "
"ຍັງມີການເພີ່ມປລັກອິນໃໝ່ອີກຫຼາຍອັນ. ຕົວຢ່າງ: ປລັກອິນໃໝ່ລ່າສຸດ "
"**xfce4-xfapplet-plugin** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມ ແອັບເພລັດຂອງແຜງ GNOME "
"ລົງໃນແຜງ Xfce ໄດ້."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:87
msgid "Time Management"
msgstr "ການຈັດການເວລາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:89
msgid ""
"The new time management application **Orage** replaces the **Xfcalendar**, "
"which was introduced with Xfce 4.2.0. **Orage** provides several features to"
" efficiently manage your time."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈັດການເວລາໃໝ່ **Orage** ເຂົ້າມາແທນທີ່ **Xfcalendar**, "
"ເຊິ່ງຖືກນຳສະເໜີໃນ Xfce 4.2.0. **Orage** "
"ໃຫ້ຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼາຍຢ່າງເພື່ອຈັດການເວລາຂອງທ່ານຢ່າງມີປະສິດທິພາບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:91
msgid "![Orage][img-orage]"
msgstr "![Orage][img-orage]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:93
msgid ""
"While **Orage** is very lightweight and easy to use, it supports all the "
"important features found in larger calendar applications like **Outlook** or"
" **Evolution**. While **Xfcalendar** used the custom `dbh` format in the "
"past to store your settings, **Orage** is based on `ical` and therefore "
"compatible with other calendar applications."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ **Orage** ຈະເບົາບາງຫຼາຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ງ່າຍ, "
"ແຕ່ມັນກໍຮອງຮັບທຸກຄຸນສົມບັດສຳຄັນທີ່ມີໃນແອັບປະຕິທິນຂະໜາດໃຫຍ່ເຊັ່ນ **Outlook** "
"ຫຼື **Evolution**. ໃນຂະນະທີ່ **Xfcalendar** ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບ `dbh` "
"ໃນອະດີດເພື່ອບັນທຶກການຕັ້ງຄ່າຂອງທ່ານ, **Orage** ພັດທະນາບົນພື້ນຖານ `ical` "
"ຈຶ່ງເຮັດໃຫ້ເຂົ້າກັນໄດ້ກັບແອັບປະຕິທິນອື່ນໆ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:95
msgid "Terminal Emulator"
msgstr "ຕົວຈຳລອງເທີມິນໍ (Terminal Emulator)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:97
msgid ""
"While **Terminal** was already available during the 4.2 days, it was not "
"mature enough at that time to be part of the core. With this major release, "
"it was moved into the core desktop."
msgstr ""
"ເຖິງແມ່ນວ່າ **Terminal** ຈະມີໃຫ້ໃຊ້ແລ້ວໃນຊ່ວງລຸ້ນ 4.2, "
"ແຕ່ໃນເວລານັ້ນມັນຍັງບໍ່ທັນສົມບູນພໍທີ່ຈະເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງແກນກາງລະບົບ. "
"ໃນລຸ້ນໃຫຍ່ນີ້, ມັນໄດ້ຖືກຍ້າຍເຂົ້າມາເປັນແກນກາງຫຼັກຂອງເດັສທັອບແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:99
msgid "![Terminal][img-terminal]"
msgstr "![Terminal][img-terminal]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:101
msgid ""
"Besides the basic features which you might expect from a terminal emulator, "
"it includes some nice additional features, like multiple tabs per window, "
"customizable toolbars and the ability to configure nearly every aspect of "
"the application via *hidden options*. As can be seen in the screenshot "
"above, this release also supports real transparency using **Xfwm4**'s "
"integrated composition manager."
msgstr ""
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດພື້ນຖານທີ່ທ່ານຄາດຫວັງຈາກຕົວຈຳລອງເທີມິນໍແລ້ວ, "
"ມັນຍັງມີຄຸນສົມບັດເສີມດີໆເຊັ່ນ: ການເປີດຫຼາຍແທັບຕໍ່ໜ້າຕ່າງ, "
"ແຖບເຄື່ອງມືທີ່ປັບແຕ່ງໄດ້ ແລະ ຄວາມສາມາດໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າເກືອບທຸກສ່ວນຂອງແອັບຜ່ານ "
"*ຕົວເລືອກທີ່ເຊື່ອງໄວ້*. ດັ່ງທີ່ເຫັນໃນພາບໜ້າຈໍຂ້າງເທິງ, "
"ລຸ້ນນີ້ຍັງຮອງຮັບຄວາມໂປ່ງໃສແທ້ໆ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວຈັດການປະສົມພາບທີ່ຕິດມາກັບ **Xfwm4**."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:103
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "ການພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:105
msgid ""
"**Xfprint**, the Xfce printing management application, saw several small "
"improvements with this release. First, the `a2ps` converter is not mandatory"
" anymore, whilst still recommended. Support for `CUPS` 1.2 was added and "
"**Xfprint** is now able to display the printer state with the "
"`CUPS`-backend."
msgstr ""
"**Xfprint**, ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນຈັດການການພິມຂອງ Xfce, "
"ມີການປັບປຸງເລັກໆນ້ອຍໆຫຼາຍຈຸດໃນລຸ້ນນີ້. ທຳອິດແມ່ນ ຕົວແປງ `a2ps` "
"ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງມີອີກຕໍ່ໄປ ແຕ່ຍັງແນະນຳໃຫ້ໃຊ້. ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບ `CUPS` 1.2 ແລະ "
"ຕອນນີ້ **Xfprint** ສາມາດສະແດງສະຖານະເຄື່ອງພິມຜ່ານ `CUPS`-backend ໄດ້ແລ້ວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:107
msgid "![Xfce Printing][img-xfprint]"
msgstr "![ການພິມ Xfce][img-xfprint]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:109
msgid ""
"**Xfprint** also integrates with **MousePad** to provide generic printing "
"support for different kinds of text documents using the `a2ps` converter."
msgstr ""
"**Xfprint** ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຮ່ວມກັບ **MousePad** "
"ເພື່ອຮອງຮັບການພິມເອກະສານຂໍ້ຄວາມປະເພດຕ່າງໆ ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວແປງ `a2ps`."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:111
msgid "![Xfce Print Dialog][img-xfprint-dialog]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການພິມ Xfce][img-xfprint-dialog]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:113
msgid ""
"As you can see the print dialog still looks relatively similar to that of "
"Xfce 4.2, but the internal workings of the printing support were improved, "
"especially the `CUPS` support. Besides that, the printing management "
"functionality was moved to a library, so other applications can use the API "
"to access the printer configuration."
msgstr ""
"ດັ່ງທີ່ທ່ານເຫັນ, ກ່ອງການພິມຍັງຄົງຄ້າຍຄືກັບຂອງ Xfce 4.2, "
"ແຕ່ລະບົບການເຮັດວຽກພາຍໃນຂອງການພິມໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງ, ໂດຍສະເພາະການຮອງຮັບ `CUPS`. "
"ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ຟັງຊັນຈັດການການພິມຍັງຖືກຍ້າຍໄປເປັນໄລບຣາຣີ "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ແອັບອື່ນໆສາມາດໃຊ້ API ໃນການເຂົ້າເຖິງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຄື່ອງພິມໄດ້."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:115
msgid "Autostart"
msgstr "ການເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:117
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 implements the new [Autostart "
"Specification](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Standards_2fautostart_2dspec) - "
"actually Xfce was the first desktop to implement said feature, but the "
"others were faster to release. ;-)"
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.4.0 ໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ [ຂໍ້ກຳນົດ Autostart "
"ໃໝ່](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Standards_2fautostart_2dspec) - "
"ຄວາມຈິງແລ້ວ Xfce ເປັນເດັສທັອບທຳອິດທີ່ເລີ່ມສ້າງຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້, "
"ແຕ່ລະບົບອື່ນປ່ອຍອອກມາກ່ອນ. ;-)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:119
msgid "![Xfce Autostart Editor][img-autostart]"
msgstr "![ຕົວແກ້ໄຂ Autostart ຂອງ Xfce][img-autostart]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:121
msgid ""
"The specification consists of two parts, the *Autostart of Applications "
"During Startup*, which is implemented in **xfce4-session** and the "
"*Autostart Of Applications After Mount* which is implemented in [thunar-"
"volman](http://foo-projects.org/~benny/projects/thunar-volman/index.html). "
"This release also includes the **xfce4-autostart-editor**, shown in the "
"screenshot above, which allows users to easily add, remove or disable "
"autostarted applications."
msgstr ""
"ຂໍ້ກຳນົດປະກອບດ້ວຍສອງສ່ວນ ຄື: "
"*ການເລີ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອັດຕະໂນມັດເມື່ອເປີດເຄື່ອງ*, ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກໃນ "
"**xfce4-session** ແລະ "
"*ການເລີ່ມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນອັດຕະໂນມັດຫຼັງຈາກເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ອຸປະກອນ* ເຊິ່ງເຮັດວຽກໃນ "
"[thunar-volman](http://foo-projects.org/~benny/projects/thunar-"
"volman/index.html). ລຸ້ນນີ້ຍັງຮວມເອົາ **xfce4-autostart-editor**, "
"ດັ່ງທີ່ສະແດງໃນພາບໜ້າຈໍຂ້າງເທິງ, ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ສາມາດເພີ່ມ, ລຶບ ຫຼື "
"ປິດການໃຊ້ງານແອັບທີ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນອັດຕະໂນມັດໄດ້ງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:125
msgid ""
"This release introduces new options to customize the desktop to your needs. "
"Some examples of new settings dialogs were already shown in the sections "
"above."
msgstr "ລຸ້ນນີ້ເພີ່ມຕົວເລືອກໃໝ່ໆໃນການປັບແຕ່ງເດັສທັອບຕາມຄວາມຕ້ອງການ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:127
msgid "![Preferred Applications][img-preferences-applications]"
msgstr "![ແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ][img-preferences-applications]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:129
msgid ""
"The preferred applications framework, which was previously only available in"
" **Terminal**, was imported into Xfce, so users no longer need to edit shell"
" profiles to specify which browser and terminal emulator should be used by "
"Xfce applications. The goal was to make it as easy as possible to change an "
"application for a certain category (GNOME users may have already noticed "
"that GNOME adopted this approach, because it is such simple)."
msgstr ""
"ໂຄງຮ່າງແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕ້ອງການ, ເຊິ່ງກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ມີສະເພາະໃນ **Terminal**, "
"ໄດ້ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າມາສູ່ Xfce, ດັ່ງນັ້ນຜູ້ໃຊ້ຈຶ່ງບໍ່ຈຳເປັນຕ້ອງແກ້ໄຂໂປຣໄຟລ໌ຂອງ "
"shell ເພື່ອກຳນົດວ່າຈະໃຊ້ບຣາວເຊີ ແລະ ຕົວຈຳລອງເທີມິນໍອັນໃດສຳລັບແອັບ Xfce "
"ອີກຕໍ່ໄປ. ເປົ້າໝາຍແມ່ນເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ການປ່ຽນແອັບສຳລັບໝວດໝູ່ໃດໜຶ່ງງ່າຍທີ່ສຸດ "
"(ຜູ້ໃຊ້ GNOME ອາດສັງເກດເຫັນແລ້ວວ່າ GNOME ໄດ້ນຳໃຊ້ວິທີນີ້ຄືກັນ "
"ເພາະມັນງ່າຍດາຍຫຼາຍ)."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:131
msgid "![Keyboard Shortcuts][img-preferences-keyboard]"
msgstr "![ປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມ][img-preferences-keyboard]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:133
msgid ""
"And then there was the problem with the keyboard shortcuts in Xfce 4.2... "
"Xfce 4.2 limited the number of freely available keyboard shortcuts, while "
"people wanted to assign any number of keyboard shortcuts. With Xfce 4.4 this"
" limitation is history and the application shortcuts are now separated from "
"the window manager shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດກຳນົດປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມໄດ້ແບບບໍ່ຈຳກັດ ແລະ "
"ແຍກສ່ວນລະຫວ່າງປຸ່ມລັດແອັບກັບປຸ່ມລັດຂອງຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:135
msgid "Feedback"
msgstr "ຄຳຕິຊົມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:137
msgid ""
"Please post comments on this article in my [blog](http://xfce-"
"diary.blogspot.com/2007/01/visual-tour-of-xfce-440.html) and use the "
"[xfce](/community/lists) mailinglist if you have questions about Xfce 4.4.0 "
"or trouble with the installation."
msgstr ""
"ກະລຸນາຂຽນຄຳຄິດເຫັນກ່ຽວກັບບົດຄວາມນີ້ໃນ [ບລັອກ](http://xfce-"
"diary.blogspot.com/2007/01/visual-tour-of-xfce-440.html) ຂອງຂ້ອຍ ແລະ ໃຊ້ "
"ລາຍການອີເມລ [xfce](/community/lists) ຫາກທ່ານມີຄຳຖາມກ່ຽວກັບ Xfce 4.4.0 ຫຼື "
"ມີບັນຫາໃນການຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour44.md:139 content/about/tour46.md:137
msgid "Links"
msgstr "ລິງຕ່າງໆ"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour44.md:141 content/about/tour46.md:139
msgid "[Xfce website](https://xfce.org/)"
msgstr "[ເວັບໄຊ Xfce](https://xfce.org/)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour44.md:142
msgid "[Thunar website](http://thunar.xfce.org/)"
msgstr "[ເວັບໄຊ Thunar](http://thunar.xfce.org/)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour44.md:146
msgid "Written by Benedikt Meurer, 21 Jan 2007"
msgstr "ຂຽນໂດຍ Benedikt Meurer, 21 ມັງກອນ 2007"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour46.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.6 tour"
msgstr "ການນຳຊົມ Xfce 4.6"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:7
msgid ""
"The long awaited 4.6.0 version of the Xfce Desktop Environment is finally "
"available. We will try to highlight some of the new features which have been"
" added since the last stable release."
msgstr ""
"ໃນທີ່ສຸດ Xfce 4.6.0 ກໍໄດ້ເປີດຕົວແລ້ວ. "
"ພວກເຮົາຈະມາແນະນຳຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ໆທີ່ຖືກເພີ່ມເຂົ້າມາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:11
msgid ""
"Since desktop icons have been introduced in Xfce 4.4, people have expressed "
"the need to allow the selection of multiple icons (rubber banding). With "
"**Xfce 4.6**, the **Xfdesktop** manager finally implements this feature: you"
" can select multiple icons, remove them, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"ຕັ້ງແຕ່ມີການນຳສະເໜີໄອຄອນເທິງເດັສທັອບໃນ Xfce 4.4, "
"ຜູ້ໃຊ້ຫຼາຍຄົນໄດ້ຮຽກຮ້ອງໃຫ້ສາມາດລາກເລືອກຫຼາຍໄອຄອນພ້ອມກັນໄດ້ (rubber banding)."
" ໃນ **Xfce 4.6**, ຕົວຈັດການ **Xfdesktop** ກໍໄດ້ເພີ່ມຄຸນສົມບັດນີ້ໃນທີ່ສຸດ: "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລືອກຫຼາຍໄອຄອນ, ລຶບພວກມັນ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:13
msgid "![Multiple icons selection][img-xfdesktop-rubberbanding]"
msgstr "![ການເລືອກຫຼາຍໄອຄອນ][img-xfdesktop-rubberbanding]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:15
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** features a brand new desktop menu which allows you to "
"manipulate files as with the **Thunar** filemanager contextual menu, but "
"also to open applications, exit your session, or access the help "
"documentation."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce 4.6** ມາພ້ອມເມນູເດັສທັອບໃໝ່ "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໄດ້ຄືກັບເມນູຄລິກຂວາຂອງຕົວຈັດການໄຟລ໌ **Thunar**, "
"ທັງຍັງສາມາດເປີດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ, ອອກຈາກເຊສຊັນ, ຫຼື "
"ເຂົ້າເຖິງເອກະສານຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອໄດ້ອີກດ້ວຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:17
msgid "![New desktop menu][img-xfdesktop-menu]"
msgstr "![ເມນູເດັສທັອບໃໝ່][img-xfdesktop-menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:21
msgid ""
"A lot of long standing bugs have been fixed in **Xfce4 Panel**, particularly"
" for multiple screen setups, but this new release also brings an improved "
"set of panel plugins."
msgstr ""
"ບັກທີ່ຄ້າງຄາມາດົນນານຫຼາຍຈຸດໄດ້ຖືກແກ້ໄຂໃນ **ແຜງ Xfce4**, "
"ໂດຍສະເພາະສຳລັບການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍໜ້າຈໍ, ນອກຈາກນີ້ "
"ລຸ້ນໃໝ່ນີ້ຍັງມາພ້ອມຊຸດປລັກອິນຂອງແຜງທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:23
msgid "![New binary clock][img-xfce4-panel-clock]"
msgstr "![ໂມງເລກຖານສອງໃໝ່][img-xfce4-panel-clock]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:25
msgid ""
"The **clock plugin** has been rewritten to consume fewer system resources "
"and to fix some display bugs, but there is also a new clock mode for the "
"geek in you: binary clock! The new **notification area plugin** allows you "
"to hide selected notification icons to keep your notification area clean and"
" readable."
msgstr ""
"**ປລັກອິນໂມງ** ຖືກຂຽນໃໝ່ເພື່ອໃຊ້ຊັບພະຍາກອນລະບົບໜ້ອຍລົງ ແລະ "
"ແກ້ໄຂບັກການສະແດງຜົນບາງຢ່າງ, ແຕ່ຍັງມີໂໝດໂມງໃໝ່ສຳລັບສາຍໄອທີ: ໂມງເລກຖານສອງ! "
"**ປລັກອິນພື້ນທີ່ແຈ້ງເຕືອນ** ໃໝ່ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານເຊື່ອງໄອຄອນແຈ້ງເຕືອນທີ່ເລືອກ "
"ເພື່ອຮັກສາພື້ນທີ່ແຈ້ງເຕືອນໃຫ້ສະອາດ ແລະ ເບິ່ງງ່າຍ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/about/tour46.md:27
msgid "Sound Mixer *(xfce4-mixer)*"
msgstr "ຕົວປະສົມສຽງ *(xfce4-mixer)*"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:29
msgid ""
"**Xfce4 Mixer** has been rewritten from scratch to use "
"[Gstreamer](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/). This allows us to more "
"easily support multiple sound systems, the user interface is more polished, "
"and you can manage several different sound cards. Additionally, a panel "
"plugin allows you to set the system sound quickly using the mouse scroll "
"wheel."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce4 Mixer** ຖືກຂຽນໃໝ່ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໂດຍໃຊ້ "
"[Gstreamer](https://gstreamer.freedesktop.org/). "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຮອງຮັບລະບົບສຽງໄດ້ຫຼາຍລະບົບງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, "
"ສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ມີຄວາມສວຍງາມຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດຈັດການຊາວ໌ກາດຫຼາຍອັນໄດ້. "
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, "
"ປລັກອິນຂອງແຜງຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບສຽງລະບົບໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວໂດຍໃຊ້ລູກກິ້ງເມົາສ໌."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:31
msgid "![New sound mixer][img-xfce4-mixer]"
msgstr "![ຕົວປະສົມສຽງໃໝ່][img-xfce4-mixer]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:35
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** comes with an enhanced session manager: your session should be "
"started faster, and the settings dialog has been reworked to ease the "
"management of session-aware applications. Additionally, the session manager "
"will now automatically restart session applications which crashed so that "
"you are not left without a desktop, panel, window manager, etcetera, if a "
"crash occurs."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce 4.6** ມາພ້ອມກັບຕົວຈັດການເຊສຊັນທີ່ໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງ: "
"ເຊສຊັນຂອງທ່ານຈະເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄວຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ "
"ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໄດ້ຖືກປັບປຸງເພື່ອໃຫ້ຈັດການແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃນເຊສຊັນໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ. "
"ນອກຈາກນີ້, ຕົວຈັດການເຊສຊັນຈະເປີດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຂັດຂ້ອງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ "
"ເພື່ອບໍ່ໃຫ້ທ່ານຂາດເດັສທັອບ, ແຜງ, ຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ "
"ເມື່ອເກີດການຂັດຂ້ອງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:37
msgid "![Session settings dialog][img-xfce4-session-settings]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊສຊັນ][img-xfce4-session-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:39
msgid ""
"The session manager also includes a new long-awaited feature: support for "
"**suspend** and **hibernate** \"out of the box.\" The logout dialog now has "
"two additional buttons which offer to suspend or hibernate your computer."
msgstr ""
"ຕົວຈັດການເຊສຊັນຍັງຮວມເອົາຄຸນສົມບັດທີ່ລໍຄອຍມາດົນນານ: ການຮອງຮັບ **ພັກເຄື່ອງ "
"(suspend)** ແລະ **ຈຳສິນ (hibernate)** ແບບພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານ. ກ່ອງອອກຈາກລະບົບຕອນນີ້ມີ"
" ສອງປຸ່ມເພີ່ມເຕີມເພື່ອເລືອກພັກເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ຈຳສິນຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:41
msgid "![Session logout dialog][img-xfce4-session-logout]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງອອກຈາກເຊສຊັນ][img-xfce4-session-logout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:45
msgid ""
"As usual, **Xfwm4** has matured quite a bit during this release cycle: many "
"bugs have been fixed, support for multiple displays has been added, and "
"overall performance has been improved."
msgstr ""
"ເຊັ່ນເຄີຍ, **Xfwm4** ມີຄວາມສົມບູນຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍໃນຮອບການປ່ອຍລຸ້ນນີ້: "
"ມີການແກ້ໄຂບັກຫຼາຍຈຸດ, ເພີ່ມການຮອງຮັບຫຼາຍໜ້າຈໍ, ແລະ "
"ປະສິດທິພາບໂດຍລວມໄດ້ຮັບການປັບປຸງດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:47
msgid ""
"In addition to some other new features, **Xfwm4** is now able to detect "
"windows that do not respond and offer to terminate them."
msgstr ""
"ນອກເໜືອຈາກຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ອື່ນໆແລ້ວ, **Xfwm4** "
"ຕອນນີ້ສາມາດກວດພົບໜ້າຕ່າງທີ່ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ ແລະ ສະເໜີໃຫ້ປິດໜ້າຕ່າງເຫຼົ່ານັ້ນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:49
msgid "![Dialog to terminate busy applications][img-xfwm4-net-ping]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງປິດແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ບໍ່ຕອບສະໜອງ][img-xfwm4-net-ping]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:51
msgid ""
"There is also a new **actions menu** which allows you to quickly move and "
"resize windows, put them above or below other windows, or fullscreen them."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີ **ເມນູການກະທຳ** ໃໝ່ ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຍ້າຍ ແລະ "
"ປັບຂະໜາດໜ້າຕ່າງໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ, ວາງໄວ້ທາງໜ້າ ຫຼື ທາງຫຼັງໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆ, ຫຼື "
"ສະແດງແບບເຕັມຈໍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:53
msgid "![New actions menu][img-xfwm4-new-menu]"
msgstr "![ເມນູການກະທຳໃໝ່][img-xfwm4-new-menu]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:55
msgid ""
"A new **fill** operation has been implemented; it expands a given window to "
"the available space without overlapping other adjacent windows."
msgstr ""
"ມີການເພີ່ມຄຳສັ່ງ **ຂະຫຍາຍເຕັມພື້ນທີ່ (fill)** ໃໝ່; "
"ມັນຈະຂະຫຍາຍໜ້າຕ່າງໃຫ້ເຕັມພື້ນທີ່ວ່າງ "
"ໂດຍບໍ່ທັບຊ້ອນກັບໜ້າຕ່າງອື່ນໆທີ່ຢູ່ຕິດກັນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:57
msgid "![Fill operation][img-xfwm4-fill-operation]"
msgstr "![ການເຮັດວຽກຂອງຄຳສັ່ງຂະຫຍາຍເຕັມພື້ນທີ່][img-xfwm4-fill-operation]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:59
msgid ""
"The **compositor** has been optimized to reduce window flickering during "
"resize operations."
msgstr ""
"**ຕົວປະສົມພາບ (compositor)** ໄດ້ຮັບການປັບແຕ່ງໃຫ້ມີປະສິດທິພາບສູງຂຶ້ນ "
"ເພື່ອຫຼຸດການກະພິບຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງໃນລະຫວ່າງການປັບຂະໜາດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:61
msgid "![Flicker free resizing][img-xfwm4-resize]"
msgstr "![ການປັບຂະໜາດແບບບໍ່ມີການກະພິບ][img-xfwm4-resize]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:63
msgid ""
"Some **tweakable options** have also been added: for example, you can now "
"disable the blinking of windows when they receive an urgency hint."
msgstr ""
"ຍັງມີການເພີ່ມ **ຕົວເລືອກປັບແຕ່ງ** ໃໝ່: ຕົວຢ່າງເຊັ່ນ "
"ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດປິດການກະພິບເຕືອນຂອງໜ້າຕ່າງເມື່ອມີການແຈ້ງເຕືອນດ່ວນໄດ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:65
msgid "![New tweakable options][img-xfwm4-new-tweaks]"
msgstr "![ຕົວເລືອກປັບແຕ່ງໃໝ່][img-xfwm4-new-tweaks]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:69
msgid ""
"There have been many bug fixes and performance improvements in **Thunar**. "
"It can use the mouse forward and backward buttons (if available) to "
"navigate, and it includes a new plugin that allows you to set an image as "
"wallpaper from the context menu."
msgstr ""
"ມີການແກ້ໄຂບັກ ແລະ ປັບປຸງປະສິດທິພາບຫຼາຍຢ່າງໃນ **Thunar**. "
"ມັນສາມາດໃຊ້ປຸ່ມເດີນໜ້າ ແລະ ຖອຍຫຼັງຂອງເມົາສ໌ (ຫາກມີ) ເພື່ອນຳທາງ, ແລະ "
"ຍັງມີປລັກອິນໃໝ່ "
"ທີ່ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຮູບພາບເປັນພາບພື້ນຫຼັງໄດ້ໂດຍກົງຈາກເມນູຄລິກຂວາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:71
msgid ""
"![Set an image in a Thunar folder as wallpaper][img-thunar-wallpaper-plugin]"
msgstr ""
"![ຕັ້ງຮູບພາບໃນໂຟນເດີ Thunar ເປັນພາບພື້ນຫຼັງ][img-thunar-wallpaper-plugin]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:73
msgid ""
"**Thunar** now follows the [XDG user "
"directories](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/xdg-user-dirs) "
"specification; this allows you to have themed and localized user folders to "
"store your music, documents, videos, templates, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"ຕອນນີ້ **Thunar** ປະຕິບັດຕາມຂໍ້ກຳນົດ [XDG user "
"directories](https://freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/xdg-user-dirs); "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານມີໂຟນເດີຜູ້ໃຊ້ຕາມພາສາທ້ອງຖິ່ນເພື່ອເກັບເພງ, ເອກະສານ, "
"ວິດີໂອ, ແມ່ແບບ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:75
msgid "![Thunar menu for user directories][img-thunar-xdg-user-dirs]"
msgstr "![ເມນູ Thunar ສຳລັບໂຟນເດີຜູ້ໃຊ້][img-thunar-xdg-user-dirs]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:77
msgid ""
"**Thunar** will now display a translucent icon for drives or volumes that "
"are not mounted, so that you can distinguish them from the mounted ones."
msgstr ""
"**Thunar** ຈະສະແດງໄອຄອນແບບໂປ່ງແສງສຳລັບໄດຣຟ໌ ຫຼື "
"ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ (mount), "
"ເພື່ອໃຫ້ທ່ານແຍກແຍະພວກມັນອອກຈາກອັນທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ແລ້ວໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:79
msgid ""
"![Translucent icons for unmounted drives and volumes][img-thunar-mounting]"
msgstr ""
"![ໄອຄອນໂປ່ງແສງສຳລັບໄດຣຟ໌ ແລະ ພື້ນທີ່ຈັດເກັບທີ່ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່][img-"
"thunar-mounting]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:81
msgid "Last, but not least, **Thunar** now supports encrypted devices!"
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍແຕ່ບໍ່ທ້າຍສຸດ, ຕອນນີ້ **Thunar** ຮອງຮັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດແລ້ວ!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:83
msgid "![Thunar support for encrypted devices][img-thunar-encrypted]"
msgstr "![Thunar ຮອງຮັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ເຂົ້າລະຫັດ][img-thunar-encrypted]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:87
msgid ""
"Xfce 4.6 features a new settings interface, **Xfce Settings Manager**, which"
" allows you to configure your desktop environment much more easily than "
"before. The dialogs which are accessible by single clicking on the icons "
"have been designed to be more compact and to allow you to customize your "
"desktop quickly and in a more intuitive way."
msgstr ""
"Xfce 4.6 ມາພ້ອມໜ້າຕ່າງການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃໝ່, **ຕົວຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Xfce (Xfce "
"Settings Manager)**, "
"ເຊິ່ງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນກວ່າແຕ່ກ່ອນຫຼາຍ. "
"ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ໂດຍການຄລິກເທື່ອດຽວທີ່ໄອຄອນ "
"ໄດ້ຖືກອອກແບບໃຫ້ກະທັດຮັດຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານປັບແຕ່ງເດັສທັອບຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ໄວ ແລະ "
"ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍກວ່າເກົ່າ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:89
msgid "![Xfce4 Settings Manager][img-xfce4-settings-manager]"
msgstr "![ຕົວຈັດການການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Xfce4][img-xfce4-settings-manager]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:91
msgid "Accessibility settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:93
msgid "![Accessibility settings dialog][img-xfce4-accessibility-settings]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງ][img-xfce4-accessibility-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:95
msgid ""
"The **Accessibility settings** dialog allows you to set the accessibility "
"related mouse and keyboard options, such as sticky keys, bounce keys, or "
"mouse emulation."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງ **ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຂົ້າເຖິງ** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າຕົວເລືອກເມົາສ໌ ແລະ "
"ແປ້ນພິມທີ່ກ່ຽວກັບການເຂົ້າເຖິງ ເຊັ່ນ: ປຸ່ມຄ້າງ (sticky keys), ປຸ່ມສະທ້ອນ "
"(bounce keys), ຫຼື ການຈຳລອງເມົາສ໌."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:97
msgid "Appearance settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບລັກສະນະ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:99
msgid "![Appearance settings dialog][img-xfce4-appearance-settings]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບລັກສະນະ][img-xfce4-appearance-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:101
msgid ""
"The **Appearance settings** dialog allows you to set the widget style, the "
"icon theme, and font, toolbar and menu options."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງ **ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຮູບລັກສະນະ** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຮູບແບບວິດເຈັດ, ຮູບແບບທີມໄອຄອນ,"
" ຕົວອັກສອນ, ແຖບເຄື່ອງມື ແລະ ຕົວເລືອກເມນູຕ່າງໆ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:103
msgid "Display settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍສະແດງຜົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:105
msgid "![Display settings dialog][img-xfce4-display-settings]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍສະແດງຜົນ][img-xfce4-display-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:107
msgid ""
"The **Display settings** dialog allows you to set the resolution, refresh "
"rate, and the rotation for each screen that is connected."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງ **ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍສະແດງຜົນ** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຄວາມລະອຽດ, ອັດຕາຣີເຟຣຊ "
"(refresh rate), ແລະ ການໝຸນຈໍສຳລັບແຕ່ລະໜ້າຈໍທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຢູ່."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:109
msgid "Keyboard settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແປ້ນພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:111
msgid ""
"![Keyboard settings dialog, layout tab][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-layout]"
msgstr ""
"![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າແປ້ນພິມ, ແທັບຮູບແບບ][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-layout]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:113
msgid ""
"The **Keyboard settings** dialog allows you to set keyboard preferences such"
" as key repeating, keyboard shortcuts, and your keyboard layout."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງ **ການຕັ້ງຄ່າແປ້ນພິມ** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຄ່າແປ້ນພິມ ເຊັ່ນການກົດຊ້ຳ, "
"ປຸ່ມລັດແປ້ນພິມ, ແລະ ຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມຂອງທ່ານ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:115
msgid ""
"![Keyboard settings dialog, shortcuts tab][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-"
"shortcuts]"
msgstr ""
"![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າແປ້ນພິມ, ແທັບປຸ່ມລັດ][img-xfce4-keyboard-settings-shortcuts]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:117
msgid ""
"You can now configure shortcuts more simply, and any shortcut conflicts are "
"automatically detected."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າປຸ່ມລັດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ແລະ ມີລະບົບກວດສອບປຸ່ມທີ່ຊ້ຳກັນ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:119
msgid "Mouse settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມົາສ໌"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:121
msgid "![Mouse settings dialog][img-xfce4-mouse-settings]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມົາສ໌][img-xfce4-mouse-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:123
msgid ""
"The **Mouse settings** dialog allows you to configure the different mice "
"connected to your computer: button order, acceleration, double-click speed, "
"mouse cursor theme, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງ **ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເມົາສ໌** ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານກຳນົດຄ່າເມົາສ໌ຕ່າງໆ "
"ທີ່ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບຄອມພິວເຕີຂອງທ່ານ: ລຳດັບປຸ່ມ, ຄວາມໄວການເລັ່ງ, "
"ຄວາມໄວການດັບເບິລຄລິກ, ຮູບແບບຕົວກະພິບເມົາສ໌, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ..."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour46.md:125
msgid "Desktop settings"
msgstr "ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເດັສທັອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:127
msgid "![Desktop settings dialog][img-xfdesktop-settings]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າເດັສທັອບ][img-xfdesktop-settings]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:129
msgid ""
"The **Desktop settings** dialog is now much more compact; it allows you to "
"configure per-screen settings: wallpaper, brightness, desktop menu, "
"displayed icons, etcetera..."
msgstr ""
"ກ່ອງ **ການຕັ້ງຄ່າເດັສທັອບ** ຕອນນີ້ກະທັດຮັດຂຶ້ນຫຼາຍ; "
"ມັນຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານຕັ້ງຄ່າແຍກຕາມແຕ່ລະຈໍພາບໄດ້: ພາບພື້ນຫຼັງ, ຄວາມສະຫວ່າງ, "
"ເມນູເດັສທັອບ, ໄອຄອນທີ່ສະແດງ, ແລະ ອື່ນໆ..."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:133
msgid ""
"**Xfce 4.6** also comes with a brand new application finder which features a"
" cleaner user interface. It is also easier to use it with the keyboard, and "
"it monitors installed applications to update the list \"on the fly.\" It "
"also allows you to create panel launchers quickly by dragging an application"
" icon to the launcher creation window."
msgstr ""
"**Xfce 4.6** ຍັງມາພ້ອມກັບຕົວຄົ້ນຫາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່ "
"ເຊິ່ງມີສ່ວນຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ສະອາດຕາກວ່າເກົ່າ. "
"ມັນຍັງໃຊ້ງານຜ່ານແປ້ນພິມໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ, ແລະ "
"ຕິດຕາມແອັບພລິເຄຊັນທີ່ຕິດຕັ້ງໄວ້ເພື່ອອັບເດດລາຍຊື່ແບບທັນທີທັນໃດ. "
"ມັນຍັງຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສ້າງຕົວຮຽກໃຊ້ເທິງແຜງໄດ້ໄວຂຶ້ນ "
"ໂດຍການລາກໄອຄອນແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໄປວາງໃສ່ໜ້າຕ່າງສ້າງຕົວຮຽກໃຊ້."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour46.md:135
msgid "![New application finder][img-xfce4-appfinder]"
msgstr "![ຕົວຄົ້ນຫາແອັບພລິເຄຊັນໃໝ່][img-xfce4-appfinder]"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:140
msgid "[Thunar website](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"
msgstr "[ເວັບໄຊ Thunar](https://xfce.org/projects/thunar)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:144
msgid "Written by Jérôme Guelfucci (February 2009)"
msgstr "ຂຽນໂດຍ Jérôme Guelfucci (ກຸມພາ 2009)"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: content/about/tour46.md:145
msgid "Screenshots by Jannis Pohlmann"
msgstr "ພາບໜ້າຈໍໂດຍ Jannis Pohlmann"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/about/tour48.md:0
msgid "Xfce 4.8 tour"
msgstr "ການນຳຊົມ Xfce 4.8"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:7
msgid ""
"This tour will introduce you to all the new major visual features in Xfce "
"4.8. This is only the visual part of what has been done; for a full list of "
"changes, see the [changelogs](/download/changelogs/)."
msgstr ""
"ການນຳຊົມນີ້ຈະແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານຮູ້ຈັກກັບຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ຫຼັກໆດ້ານຮູບລັກສະນະໃນ Xfce "
"4.8. ນີ້ເປັນພຽງສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງສິ່ງທີ່ໄດ້ປັບປຸງເທົ່ານັ້ນ; "
"ສຳລັບລາຍການການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດ, ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງທີ່ "
"[ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ](/download/changelogs/)."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:11
msgid "Remote shares browsing"
msgstr "ການທ່ອງເບິ່ງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທາງໄກ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:13
msgid ""
"Thunar now has optional support for GVFS which will allow you to browse "
"remote shares using Thunar: FTP, Windows Shares, WebDav and SSH servers..."
msgstr "Thunar ຮອງຮັບ GVFS ເພື່ອທ່ອງເບິ່ງ FTP, ໄດຣຟ໌ Windows, WebDav ແລະ SSH."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:15
msgid "![Thunar browsing a remote share][img-thunar-remote]"
msgstr "![Thunar ຂະນະກຳລັງທ່ອງເບິ່ງແຫຼ່ງຂໍ້ມູນທາງໄກ][img-thunar-remote]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:17
msgid "New file operations progress dialog"
msgstr "ກ່ອງສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ແບບໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:19
msgid ""
"When several file operations (copy or move) are being handled in parallel, "
"Thunar now shows a single progress dialog which displays all the relevant "
"information."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ Thunar ສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າຂອງທຸກການຈັດການໄຟລ໌ໃນກ່ອງດຽວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:21
msgid "![Progress dialog][img-thunar-progress]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງສະແດງຄວາມຄືບໜ້າ][img-thunar-progress]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:23
msgid "Eject button for removable devices"
msgstr "ປຸ່ມດັນອອກສຳລັບອຸປະກອນທີ່ຖອດຖອນໄດ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:25
msgid ""
"It is is now possible to eject removable devices by clicking the eject "
"button near each removable device label in the side pane."
msgstr "ສາມາດດັນອຸປະກອນອອກໄດ້ໂດຍຄລິກປຸ່ມດັນອອກໃນແຖບຂ້າງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:27
msgid "![Eject button][img-thunar-eject]"
msgstr "![ປຸ່ມດັນອອກ][img-thunar-eject]"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:31
msgid ""
"The Xfce panel has been totally rewritten in 4.8, here are the most visible "
"changes."
msgstr "ແຜງ Xfce ຖືກຂຽນໃໝ່ທັງໝົດໃນ 4.8."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:33
msgid "Improved positioning and size handling"
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການວາງຕຳແໜ່ງ ແລະ ການຈັດການຂະໜາດ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:35
msgid ""
"The panel has much better support for positioning panels on the screen. It "
"can be dragged and snapped to screen borders; floating positions are only "
"remembered when moving a panel and the length of the panel can be adjusted "
"as a percentage of the monitor size."
msgstr "ແຜງສາມາດລາກ ແລະ ດູດຕິດຂອບຈໍໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:37
msgid "Transparent backgrounds"
msgstr "ພື້ນຫຼັງແບບໂປ່ງໃສ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:39
msgid ""
"The panel is now able to draw transparent panel backgrounds with non "
"transparent items. Your panel items will remain readable and you will enjoy "
"a nice panel look."
msgstr "ແຜງສາມາດຕັ້ງພື້ນຫຼັງໃຫ້ໂປ່ງໃສໄດ້ ໂດຍທີ່ລາຍການຕ່າງໆຍັງເບິ່ງເຫັນຊັດເຈນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:41
msgid "![Transparent panel background][img-panel-transparent]"
msgstr "![ພື້ນຫຼັງແຜງແບບໂປ່ງໃສ][img-panel-transparent]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:43
msgid "New item editor"
msgstr "ຕົວແກ້ໄຂລາຍການແບບໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:45
msgid ""
"The panel now features an item editor which allows to modify, move, add and "
"remove items quickly. This is particularly useful for items which are hard "
"to right click and gives you an easy way to change your panel layout from a "
"single place."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຈັດການລາຍການໃນແຜງໄດ້ງ່າຍ ແລະ ໄວຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:47
msgid "![Panel item editor][img-panel-editor]"
msgstr "![ຕົວແກ້ໄຂລາຍການໃນແຜງ][img-panel-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:49
msgid "Drag and drop to create launchers"
msgstr "ລາກ ແລະ ວາງເພື່ອສ້າງຕົວຮຽກໃຊ້"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:51
msgid ""
"You can now drag and drop menu entries from the panel applications menu, "
"application finder or Thunar to the panel to create launchers. This feature "
"should please the huge number of people who had been requesting it for ages."
" The launcher also has an integrated application finder to add new items."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດລາກແອັບມາສ້າງຕົວຮຽກໃຊ້ເທິງແຜງໄດ້ເລີຍ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:53
msgid "Window buttons plugin"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນປຸ່ມໜ້າຕ່າງ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:55
msgid ""
"The iconbox and tasklist plugins are new merged into 1 plugin, called window"
" buttons. It implements different sorting modes, improved handling in "
"vertical panels and can draw a similar frame as Xfwm4 Alt+tab when hovering "
"a button."
msgstr "ລວມປລັກອິນ iconbox ແລະ tasklist ເຂົ້າເປັນອັນດຽວ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:57
msgid "New fuzzy clock"
msgstr "ໂມງແບບຄຳເວົ້າ (fuzzy clock) ໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:59
msgid ""
"An Xfce release without a new clock mode would not be a true Xfce release. "
"Let us introduce you the 'fuzzy' clock mode!"
msgstr "ຂໍແນະນຳໂໝດໂມງແບບ 'fuzzy' ທີ່ສະແດງເວລາເປັນຄຳເວົ້າ!"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:61
msgid "![New fuzzy clock mode][img-panel-fuzzy-clock]"
msgstr "![ໂໝດໂມງແບບຄຳເວົ້າໃໝ່][img-panel-fuzzy-clock]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:63
msgid "New directory menu plugin"
msgstr "ປລັກອິນເມນູໄດຣັກທໍຣີໃໝ່"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:65
msgid ""
"The directory menu plugin provides a menu reproducing the arborescence of a "
"particular folder. This allows you to open a terminal or a file manager in a"
" sub-folder in a very fast and efficient way."
msgstr "ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງໂຟນເດີຍ່ອຍໄດ້ຢ່າງວ່ອງໄວ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:67
msgid "![Directory menu plugin][img-panel-directorymenu]"
msgstr "![ປລັກອິນເມນູໄດຣັກທໍຣີ][img-panel-directorymenu]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:69
msgid "Applications menu edition"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂເມນູແອັບພລິເຄຊັນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:71
msgid ""
"You can now edit the applications menu using any Freedesktop compliant menu "
"editor, Alacarte being the one we used to test."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ທ່ານສາມາດແກ້ໄຂເມນູແອັບໄດ້ໂດຍໃຊ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂເມນູທົ່ວໄປ."

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:75
msgid "Improved multihead setup configuration"
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍຈໍພາບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:77
msgid ""
"Xfce can now handle and setup multihead setups for any randr 1.2 compatible "
"driver. Unfortunately, this means it will not work with Nvidia proprietary "
"drivers."
msgstr "ຮອງຮັບການຈັດການຫຼາຍຈໍພາບໄດ້ດີຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:79
msgid ""
"You can enable and disable plugged screens, set their resolution, refresh "
"rate, rotation and reflection, clone screens or extend desktops."
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າຄວາມລະອຽດ, ການໝຸນ, ການເຮັດຈໍຄືກັນ ຫຼື ຂະຫຍາຍເດັສທັອບ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:81
msgid "![New display settings dialog][img-display-settings]"
msgstr "![ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າຈໍສະແດງຜົນໃໝ່][img-display-settings]"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/about/tour48.md:83
msgid "Timed confirmation"
msgstr "ການຢືນຢັນແບບກຳນົດເວລາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:85
msgid ""
"Any change made with the settings dialog will have to be confirmed within "
"ten seconds or they will be reverted. This prevents broken video drivers "
"from leaving your computer unusable."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າບໍ່ຢືນຢັນພາຍໃນ 10 ວິນາທີ, ຄ່າຈະຖືກຕັ້ງກັບຄືນເປັນຄືເກົ່າ "
"ເພື່ອປ້ອງກັນຈໍມືດ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:87
msgid ""
"![Timed confirmation for display settings changes][img-display-settings-"
"confirmation]"
msgstr ""
"![ການຢືນຢັນແບບກຳນົດເວລາສຳລັບການປ່ຽນຄ່າຈໍສະແດງຜົນ][img-display-settings-"
"confirmation]"

#. type: Title ####
#: content/about/tour48.md:89
msgid "Quick setup dialog"
msgstr "ກ່ອງການຕັ້ງຄ່າດ່ວນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:91
msgid ""
"The quick setup dialog allows you to configure a dual screen setup in a "
"second. Plug the second screen, press the display key or Windows + p and "
"select the wanted layout. Done!"
msgstr "ຕັ້ງຄ່າສອງຈໍໄດ້ໃນວິນາທີດຽວ ພຽງແຕ່ກົດປຸ່ມ Windows + p."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:93
msgid "![Quick multihead setup][img-minimal-display-settings]"
msgstr "![ການຕັ້ງຄ່າຫຼາຍຈໍພາບແບບດ່ວນ][img-minimal-display-settings]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:95
msgid "Settings edition in the Xfce Settings Editor"
msgstr "ການແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າໃນຕົວແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Xfce"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:97
msgid ""
"The Xfce Settings Editor now deserves its name, it is no longer a simpler "
"Xfconf settings viewer. You can now modify, delete, add and reset settings "
"through its interface. It also monitors changes to update its view."
msgstr "ຕອນນີ້ຕົວແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າສາມາດແກ້ໄຂ, ລຶບ ແລະ ເພີ່ມຄ່າຕ່າງໆໄດ້ໂດຍກົງ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:99
msgid ""
"![Editing Xfconf properties with the Settings Editor][img-settings-editor]"
msgstr ""
"![ການແກ້ໄຂຄຸນສົມບັດ Xfconf ດ້ວຍຕົວແກ້ໄຂການຕັ້ງຄ່າ][img-settings-editor]"

#. type: Title ###
#: content/about/tour48.md:101
msgid "Improved keyboard layout selection"
msgstr "ປັບປຸງການເລືອກຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:103
msgid ""
"The layout selection dialog received a lot of love: it no longer displays "
"cryptic language/variants codes but uses localized languages/variants names."
" Layout edition was also made easier by prefilling the dialogs with the "
"current values."
msgstr ""
"ການເລືອກພາສາ ແລະ ຮູບແບບແປ້ນພິມເຮັດໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນ ໂດຍສະແດງຊື່ພາສາທີ່ເຂົ້າໃຈງ່າຍ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/about/tour48.md:105
msgid "![Layouts and variants list][img-keyboard-settings-list]"
msgstr "![ລາຍຊື່ຮູບແບບ ແລະ ແບບຍ່ອຍຂອງແປ້ນພິມ][img-keyboard-settings-list]"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/community/_index.md:0
msgid "Community"
msgstr "ຊຸມຊົນ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"Whether it be to solve a problem or to contribute in any way, the Xfce "
"communities are a good place to get help or to share your ideas. You might "
"also want to have a look at the communities of the different distributions "
"which provide Xfce."
msgstr ""
"ບໍ່ວ່າຈະເປັນການແກ້ໄຂບັນຫາ ຫຼື ການມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ, ຊຸມຊົນ Xfce "
"ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ດີໃນການຂໍຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ ຫຼື ແບ່ງປັນໄອເດຍ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:8
msgid "Mailing lists"
msgstr "ລາຍການອີເມລ (Mailing lists)"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:10
msgid ""
"Almost all development and coordination work is taking place on the Xfce "
"mailing lists. A summary of all lists is available at "
"[mail.xfce.org](https://mail.xfce.org). There is also a user-specific list "
"where you can ask questions and freely discuss about the desktop."
msgstr ""
"ວຽກງານການພັດທະນາ ແລະ ການປະສານງານເກືອບທັງໝົດແມ່ນດຳເນີນຜ່ານລາຍການອີເມລຂອງ "
"Xfce. ບົດສະຫຼຸບຂອງທຸກລາຍການແມ່ນມີໃຫ້ເບິ່ງທີ່ "
"[mail.xfce.org](https://mail.xfce.org). "
"ນອກຈາກນີ້ຍັງມີລາຍການສະເພາະສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ ເຊິ່ງທ່ານສາມາດຖາມຄຳຖາມ ແລະ "
"ສົນທະນາກ່ຽວກັບເດັສທັອບໄດ້ຢ່າງເສລີ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:12
msgid "**NOTE:** In order to post to these lists, you must first subscribe."
msgstr ""
"**ໝາຍເຫດ:** ເພື່ອທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຂໍ້ຄວາມໄປຫາລາຍການເຫຼົ່ານີ້, "
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງສະໝັກສະມາຊິກກ່ອນ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:14
msgid "Matrix"
msgstr "Matrix"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"If you have a problem that you cannot resolve, you might want to try asking "
"a question in our Matrix channel "
"[#xfce](https://matrix.to/#/#xfce:matrix.org). The channel has several "
"active users. It is recommended that you consult the "
"[documentation](https://docs.xfce.org/) about your problem before asking "
"your question."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານພົບບັນຫາທີ່ບໍ່ສາມາດແກ້ໄຂໄດ້, ທ່ານອາດລອງຖາມໃນຊ່ອງ Matrix ຂອງພວກເຮົາ "
"[#xfce](https://matrix.to/#/#xfce:matrix.org). ຊ່ອງນີ້ມີຜູ້ໃຊ້ງານຢູ່ຕະຫຼອດ. "
"ແນະນຳໃຫ້ທ່ານກວດເບິ່ງ [ເອກະສານ](https://docs.xfce.org/) "
"ກ່ຽວກັບບັນຫາຂອງທ່ານກ່ອນທີ່ຈະຖາມ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:18
msgid "Forums"
msgstr "ຟໍຣຳ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"For users who prefer forums, the [Xfce Forum](https://forum.xfce.org/) is "
"the place to be. Active contributors will be able to help you, but please do"
" not use it for bug reports."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຜູ້ໃຊ້ທີ່ມັກໃຊ້ຟໍຣຳ, [ຟໍຣຳ Xfce](https://forum.xfce.org/) "
"ແມ່ນບ່ອນທີ່ເໝາະສົມທີ່ສຸດ. ຜູ້ປະກອບສ່ວນທີ່ມີການເຄື່ອນໄຫວຈະສາມາດຊ່ວຍທ່ານໄດ້, "
"ແຕ່ກະລຸນາຢ່າໃຊ້ມັນເພື່ອລາຍງານບັກ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/community/_index.md:22
msgid "Social Networks"
msgstr "ເຄືອຂ່າຍສັງຄົມ"

#: content/community/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"You can follow us on the official [Mastodon "
"account](https://floss.social/@xfce)."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມພວກເຮົາໄດ້ທີ່ [ບັນຊີ Mastodon "
"ທາງການ](https://floss.social/@xfce)."

#: content/download/_index.md:0
msgid "Download"
msgstr "ດາວໂຫຼດ"

#: content/download/_index.md:7
msgid ""
"Most distributions ship with Xfce in their own packaging format, but if you "
"want a newer version or you want to build Xfce from scratch, you can find "
"the packages below. [How to compile "
"Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/building)."
msgstr ""
"ດິດທຣິບິວຊັນສ່ວນໃຫຍ່ມາພ້ອມກັບ Xfce ໃນຮູບແບບແພັກເກດຂອງຕົນເອງ, "
"ແຕ່ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການລຸ້ນໃໝ່ກວ່າ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການສ້າງ Xfce ຕັ້ງແຕ່ເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຊອກຫາແພັກເກດໄດ້ດ້ານລຸ່ມ. [ວິທີຄອມໄພລ໌ "
"Xfce](https://docs.xfce.org/xfce/building)."

#: content/download/_index.md:9
msgid "Stable release {{% version \"stable\" %}}"
msgstr "ລຸ້ນທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງ {{% version \"stable\" %}}"

#: content/download/_index.md:11
msgid ""
"Xfce {{% version \"stable\" %}} is the most recent version of the Xfce "
"desktop environment. [Changes in this release](/download/changelogs/{{% "
"version \"stable\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"Xfce {{% version \"stable\" %}} ແມ່ນລຸ້ນລ່າສຸດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ Xfce. "
"[ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນລຸ້ນນີ້](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"stable\" %}})."

#: content/download/_index.md:13
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"stable\" %}}/>"
msgstr "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"stable\" %}}/>"

#: content/download/_index.md:15
msgid "Individual releases"
msgstr "ການປ່ອຍແຍກແຕ່ລະສ່ວນ"

#: content/download/_index.md:17
msgid ""
"Each package in Xfce can make individual stable or development releases, "
"including the core packages (as described in the [release "
"model](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/dev/make-a-platform-"
"release#making_a_platform_release)). You can follow the announcements of the"
" releases on the [Xfce users mailing list](/community), watch the [release "
"feeds](https://archive.xfce.org/feeds/project/) or follow the Xfce "
"[Mastodon](https://floss.social/@xfce)."
msgstr ""
"ແຕ່ລະແພັກເກດໃນ Xfce ສາມາດປ່ອຍລຸ້ນທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງ ຫຼື ລຸ້ນພັດທະນາແຍກຕ່າງຫາກໄດ້, "
"ລວມທັງແພັກເກດຫຼັກ (ດັ່ງທີ່ອະທິບາຍໄວ້ໃນ "
"[ຮູບແບບການປ່ອຍລຸ້ນ](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/dev/make-a-platform-"
"release#making_a_platform_release)). "
"ທ່ານສາມາດຕິດຕາມການປະກາດການປ່ອຍລຸ້ນໄດ້ທີ່ [ລາຍການອີເມລຜູ້ໃຊ້ "
"Xfce](/community), ເບິ່ງ "
"[ຟີດການປ່ອຍລຸ້ນ](https://archive.xfce.org/feeds/project/) ຫຼື ຕິດຕາມ Xfce "
"[Mastodon](https://floss.social/@xfce)."

#: content/download/_index.md:19
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/src/>"
msgstr "<https://archive.xfce.org/src/>"

#: content/download/_index.md:22
msgid "Preview release {{% version \"preview\" %}}"
msgstr "ລຸ້ນທົດລອງ {{% version \"preview\" %}}"

#: content/download/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"Xfce {{% version \"preview\" %}} is the latest development release of the "
"Xfce desktop environment. This release should not be used in a production "
"environments. If you are uncertain about downloading this release, you "
"should probably use the [stable release](#stable) above. [Changes in this "
"release](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"preview\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"Xfce {{% version \"preview\" %}} "
"ແມ່ນລຸ້ນພັດທະນາລ່າສຸດຂອງສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ Xfce. "
"ລຸ້ນນີ້ບໍ່ຄວນນຳໄປໃຊ້ໃນສະພາບແວດລ້ອມການເຮັດວຽກຕົວຈິງ. "
"ຫາກທ່ານບໍ່ແນ່ໃຈໃນການດາວໂຫຼດລຸ້ນນີ້, ທ່ານຄວນໃຊ້ [ລຸ້ນທີ່ໝັ້ນຄົງ](#stable) "
"ດ້ານເທິງ. [ການປ່ຽນແປງໃນລຸ້ນນີ້](/download/changelogs/{{% version \"preview\""
" %}})."

#: content/download/_index.md:26
msgid "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"preview\" %}}/>"
msgstr "<https://archive.xfce.org/xfce/{{% version \"preview\" %}}/>"

#: content/download/_index.md:30
msgid "Distributions"
msgstr "ດິດທຣິບິວຊັນ (Distributions)"

#: content/download/_index.md:32
msgid ""
"A lot of different distributions provide Xfce packages. Popular examples "
"built around Xfce are [Xubuntu](https://xubuntu.org/), the [Fedora Xfce "
"Spin](https://fedoraproject.org/spins/xfce), "
"[Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/products/download/) or "
"[Zenwalk](http://www.zenwalk.org/), but there is a good chance your favorite"
" distro provides packages as well."
msgstr ""
"ດິດທຣິບິວຊັນຕ່າງໆ ຫຼວງຫຼາຍມີແພັກເກດ Xfce ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ງານ. "
"ຕົວຢ່າງຍອດນິຍົມທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນບົນພື້ນຖານ Xfce ແມ່ນ "
"[Xubuntu](https://xubuntu.org/), [Fedora Xfce "
"Spin](https://fedoraproject.org/spins/xfce), "
"[Manjaro](https://manjaro.org/products/download/) ຫຼື "
"[Zenwalk](http://www.zenwalk.org/), "
"ແຕ່ກໍມີໂອກາດສູງທີ່ດິດທຣິບິວຊັນທີ່ທ່ານມັກຈະມີແພັກເກດໃຫ້ເຊັ່ນກັນ."

#: content/download/_index.md:34
msgid ""
"You can find a more complete list at "
"[DistroWatch.com](https://distrowatch.com/search.php?pkg=xfdesktop&pkgver={{%"
" version \"stable\" %}})."
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງລາຍຊື່ທີ່ສົມບູນກວ່ານີ້ໄດ້ທີ່ "
"[DistroWatch.com](https://distrowatch.com/search.php?pkg=xfdesktop&pkgver={{%"
" version \"stable\" %}})."

#: content/download/_index.md:36
msgid "Artwork"
msgstr "ງານສິລະປະ (Artwork)"

#: content/download/_index.md:38
msgid ""
"[Download the Xfce artwork "
"tarball](//cdn.xfce.org/downloads/xfce_artwork.tar.bz2). It contains some "
"high-quality logos and banners. Copying of the Xfce logo is subject to the "
"LGPL copyright license."
msgstr ""
"[ດາວໂຫຼດໄຟລ໌ທາຣ໌ບອນ (tarball) ງານສິລະປະຂອງ "
"Xfce](//cdn.xfce.org/downloads/xfce_artwork.tar.bz2). ພາຍໃນປະກອບມີໂລໂກ້ ແລະ "
"ແບນເນີຄຸນນະພາບສູງ. ການຄັດລອກໂລໂກ້ຂອງ Xfce ແມ່ນຢູ່ພາຍໃຕ້ໃບອະນຸຍາດລິຂະສິດ "
"LGPL."

#: content/download/changelogs/_index.md:0
msgid "Changelogs"
msgstr "ບັນທຶກການປ່ຽນແປງ"

#: content/download/changelogs/_index.md:7
msgid ""
"Xfce release notes are specific to each version. Select your version from "
"the list below to see the changes in the release."
msgstr ""
"ບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍລຸ້ນຂອງ Xfce ແມ່ນແຍກສະເພາະແຕ່ລະລຸ້ນ. "
"ເລືອກລຸ້ນຂອງທ່ານຈາກລາຍຊື່ດ້ານລຸ່ມເພື່ອເບິ່ງການປ່ຽນແປງໃນລຸ້ນນັ້ນໆ."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:0
msgid "Get Involved"
msgstr "ມີສ່ວນຮ່ວມ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:6
msgid ""
"Welcome to the Xfce community. By joining our team, you will be part of an "
"international effort by hundreds of people working to deliver a stunning "
"Free Software computing experience. You will meet new friends, learn new "
"skills and make a difference to millions of users while working with people "
"from all around the globe. There are many different ways you can become part"
" of this, just read on and pick an area which interests you or seems "
"challenging."
msgstr ""
"ຍິນດີຕ້ອນຮັບສູ່ຊຸມຊົນ Xfce. ການເຂົ້າຮ່ວມທີມຂອງພວກເຮົາ "
"ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງຂອງຄວາມພະຍາຍາມລະດັບສາກົນ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:8
msgid ""
"Possible tasks include testing, bug reporting; writing code, developing "
"artwork, documentation or translations; or spreading the word and helping "
"out with promotion and marketing both on line and at tradeshows and "
"conferences."
msgstr ""
"ໜ້າວຽກທີ່ມີໃຫ້ເຮັດຮວມເຖິງການທົດສອບ, ລາຍງານບັກ, ຂຽນໂຄ້ດ, ອອກແບບ, ຂຽນເອກະສານ "
"ຫຼື ແປພາສາ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:10
msgid "Documentation"
msgstr "ເອກະສານ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:12
msgid ""
"There's lots of people using and testing Xfce. By providing useful and up-"
"to-date documentation, you will make a big impact on helping people "
"understand how to make the most of the Xfce Desktop Environment. [Learn More"
" →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/documentation)"
msgstr ""
"ມີຫຼາຍຄົນທີ່ກຳລັງໃຊ້ງານ ແລະ ທົດສອບ Xfce. ການສະໜອງເອກະສານທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດ ແລະ "
"ທັນສະໄໝ ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ຄົນເຂົ້າໃຈວິທີນຳໃຊ້ສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ Xfce "
"ໃຫ້ເກີດປະໂຫຍດສູງສຸດ. [ສຶກສາເພີ່ມເຕີມ "
"→](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/documentation)"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:14
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "ການແປພາສາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:16
msgid ""
"Are you fluent in multiple languages? By contributing your translations of "
"text to the Xfce Desktop Environment, you will help Xfce be a better part of"
" the global market and more accessible to the millions of potential users "
"out there. [Learn More →](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/translate/start)"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານມີຄວາມຊຳນານໃນຫຼາຍພາສາຫຼືບໍ່? "
"ການປະກອບສ່ວນຊ່ວຍແປຂໍ້ຄວາມໃຫ້ກັບສະພາບແວດລ້ອມເດັສທັອບ Xfce ຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ Xfce "
"ເປັນສ່ວນໜຶ່ງທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນຂອງຕະຫຼາດສາກົນ ແລະ "
"ເຮັດໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ງານທົ່ວໂລກເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຫຼາຍລ້ານຄົນ. [ສຶກສາເພີ່ມເຕີມ "
"→](https://docs.xfce.org/contribute/translate/start)"

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:18
msgid "Development"
msgstr "ການພັດທະນາ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:20
msgid ""
"By becoming a developer, you can make a big difference while enjoying a "
"challenging and fun experience. You'll learn to be a better coder, you will "
"get to implement new features and defeat daunting bugs, creating a stunning "
"product, all the while collaborating with people from all around the world. "
"You can start by browsing the [source code](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."
msgstr ""
"ການເຂົ້າມາເປັນຜູ້ພັດທະນາ, "
"ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງຄວາມປ່ຽນແປງອັນໃຫຍ່ຫຼວງພ້ອມກັບປະສົບການທີ່ທ້າທາຍ ແລະ ມ່ວນຊື່ນ. "
"ທ່ານຈະໄດ້ຮຽນຮູ້ການຂຽນໂຄ້ດທີ່ດີຂຶ້ນ, ໄດ້ສ້າງຄຸນສົມບັດໃໝ່ ແລະ ປາບບັກທີ່ຍາກໆ, "
"ສ້າງສັນຜະລິດຕະພັນທີ່ຍອດຢ້ຽມ, ພ້ອມທັງໄດ້ຮ່ວມງານກັບຜູ້ຄົນຈາກທົ່ວທຸກມຸມໂລກ. "
"ທ່ານສາມາດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນໄດ້ໂດຍການເຂົ້າເບິ່ງ [ຊອດໂຄ້ດ](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:22
msgid "Promotion"
msgstr "ການປະຊາສຳພັນ"

#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:24
msgid ""
"If you own a blog or website you can greatly help by spreading the word and "
"encouraging new users to give Xfce a try. If you have a Mastodon account you"
" can also help by reposting any announcements we make to help us reach a "
"larger audience."
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານມີບລັອກ ຫຼື ເວັບໄຊ, ທ່ານສາມາດຊ່ວຍໄດ້ຫຼາຍໂດຍການບອກຕໍ່ ແລະ "
"ຊັກຊວນໃຫ້ຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃໝ່ໆ ມາລອງໃຊ້ Xfce. ຫາກທ່ານມີບັນຊີ Mastodon "
"ທ່ານກໍສາມາດຊ່ວຍຣີໂພສຕ໌ປະກາດຕ່າງໆ ຂອງພວກເຮົາ "
"ເພື່ອຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າເຖິງຜູ້ຄົນໄດ້ຫຼາຍຂຶ້ນ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:26
msgid "Bug Reporting and testing"
msgstr "ການລາຍງານບັກ ແລະ ການທົດສອບ"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:28
msgid ""
"One of the most useful tasks that we rely on the community for is testing "
"and reporting of bugs. Since Xfce runs on various platform and in a lot of "
"different setups, testing all changes in every possible situation is an "
"impossible task. As such we kindly ask users to assist in testing, and "
"reporting all bugs they may find, using our [bug "
"tracker](https://gitlab.xfce.org)."
msgstr ""
"ໜຶ່ງໃນໜ້າວຽກທີ່ມີປະໂຫຍດທີ່ສຸດທີ່ພວກເຮົາເພິ່ງພາຊຸມຊົນແມ່ນການທົດສອບ ແລະ "
"ການລາຍງານບັກ. ເນື່ອງຈາກ Xfce ເຮັດວຽກບົນຫຼາຍແພລັດຟອຣ໌ມ ແລະ "
"ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຫຼາກຫຼາຍ, "
"ການທົດສອບການປ່ຽນແປງທັງໝົດໃນທຸກສະຖານະການຈຶ່ງເປັນໄປບໍ່ໄດ້. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, "
"ພວກເຮົາຈຶ່ງຂໍຄວາມຮ່ວມມືຈາກຜູ້ໃຊ້ໃນການຊ່ວຍທົດສອບ ແລະ ລາຍງານທຸກບັກທີ່ພົບ "
"ໂດຍໃຊ້ [ລະບົບຕິດຕາມບັກ](https://gitlab.xfce.org) ຂອງພວກເຮົາ."

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:30
msgid ""
"Once a bug has been found, the cause of the bug needs to be tracked down, "
"and then (obviously) fixed. If you want to get involved in the actual "
"development process of Xfce a great way to start is by solving bugs and then"
" submitting a patch file."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອພົບກໍລະນີບັກ, ການຊອກຫາສາເຫດ ແລະ "
"ແກ້ໄຂດ້ວຍການສົ່ງແພັດແມ່ນຈຸດເລີ່ມຕົ້ນທີ່ດີໃນການເປັນຜູ້ພັດທະນາ."

#. type: Title ##
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:32
msgid "OpenCollective"
msgstr "OpenCollective"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/getinvolved/_index.md:34
msgid ""
"If you want to fund the project, you can use OpenCollective. Xfce has "
"created two collectives, known as [Xfce "
"($)](https://opencollective.com/xfce) and [Xfce-Eu "
"(€)](https://opencollective.com/xfce-eu) respectively. [Learn More "
"→](https://mail.xfce.org/pipermail/xfce/2021-May/037348.html)"
msgstr ""
"ຫາກທ່ານຕ້ອງການສະໜັບສະໜູນທຶນໃຫ້ໂຄງການ, ທ່ານສາມາດໃຊ້ OpenCollective. Xfce "
"ໄດ້ສ້າງສອງກອງທຶນຄື: [Xfce ($)](https://opencollective.com/xfce) ແລະ [Xfce-Eu"
" (€)](https://opencollective.com/xfce-eu) ຕາມລຳດັບ. [ສຶກສາເພີ່ມເຕີມ "
"→](https://mail.xfce.org/pipermail/xfce/2021-May/037348.html)"

#: content/projects/_index.md:0
msgid "Projects"
msgstr "ໂຄງການ"

#: content/projects/_index.md:7
msgid ""
"The Xfce project contains several separated projects for each part of the "
"desktop. Some projects have their own project pages to provide additional "
"information."
msgstr "ໂຄງການ Xfce ປະກອບດ້ວຍຫຼາຍໂຄງການຍ່ອຍທີ່ແຍກຕາມແຕ່ລະສ່ວນຂອງເດດທັອບ."
